med as the exception."}},{"k":"allowance_aria","v":{"s":"Exceptions allowed while still meeting the goal"}},{"k":"criteria_help","v":{"s":"App-tracked criteria show live progress and prompt you when met. Awarding is always your tap, never automatic."}},{"k":"criteria_aria","v":{"s":"Optional app-tracked progress signal for this goal"}}],"id":20}},{"k":"word_sounds","v":{"o":[{"k":"lesson_practice_complete","v":{"s":"Lesson complete! You practiced every activity."}},{"k":"picture_clue_for","v":{"s":"Picture clue: {word}"}},{"k":"sound_sort_review_needed","v":{"s":"This sound needs a reviewed word set. Choose another activity or return to setup."}},{"k":"adaptive_evidence","v":{"s":"Current activity and support: {count} recent responses across {words} words. Difficulty moves one step after sustained practice."}},{"k":"choose_lesson_activity","v":{"s":"Choose at least one lesson activity before preparing."}},{"k":"activity_item_count","v":{"s":"{activity}: item count"}},{"k":"words_prepared_count","v":{"s":"{count} words prepared"}},{"k":"preparation_options","v":{"s":"Preparation and taught spellings"}},{"k":"prepare_scope","v":{"s":"Activities to prepare"}},{"k":"prepare_all","v":{"s":"All activities (allows switching)"}},{"k":"prepare_lesson","v":{"s":"Selected lesson only (less audio to prepare)"}},{"k":"taught_spellings_help","v":{"s":"Optional spelling coverage check. Enter taught letters and adjacent letter groups, separated by commas; list known whole words separately. Review sound values and irregular spellings with the learner."}},{"k":"taught_patterns","v":{"s":"Taught letters and letter groups"}},{"k":"known_words","v":{"s":"Known whole words"}},{"k":"pattern_review_words","v":{"s":"Words to review against taught spellings: {words}"}},{"k":"none","v":{"s":"None"}},{"k":"matching_practice","v":{"s":"Match your word to a choice."}},{"k":"picture_cloze_practice","v":{"s":"Use the picture to choose a word."}},{"k":"coverage_review","v":{"s":"Check taught spelli