pen in Canvas."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_new","v":{"s":"New pack created. Name it, pick Teacher or Student, then record."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_no_default_preview","v":{"s":"No default recording to preview for this one."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_no_model","v":{"s":"No model recording for /{key}/ in the default voice. Record what you think it sounds like, or check a reference chart."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_not_pack","v":{"s":"That file is not a phoneme pack."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_read_fail","v":{"s":"Could not read that file."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_record_all","v":{"s":"Record every sound in \"{word}\" first."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_recorded","v":{"s":"✓ Recorded {what}. Tap 🔊 to hear it, then Save & Use."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_recorded_sound","v":{"s":"✓ Recorded /{key}/. Tap 🔊 to hear it, then Save & Use."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_recording","v":{"s":"● Recording {what}. Tap again to stop."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_save_extra","v":{"s":" + your cheers/instructions"}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_saved","v":{"s":"✅ Saved and active now ({count} sounds{extra}). Word Sounds will use this voice."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_saved_session","v":{"s":"Active for this session ({count} sounds), but the pack was too large for browser storage. Use Export to keep it as a file."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_switched","v":{"s":"Switched to \"{name}\". This voice is active now."}},{"k":"voice_pack_msg_unsupported","v":{"s":"Recording is not supported in this browser."}},{"k":"voice_pack_name_label","v":{"s":"Pack name"}},{"k":"voice_pack_new","v":{"s":"New"}},{"k":"voice_pack_pack_label","v":{"s":"Pack"}},{"k":"voice_pack_play_recording","v":{"s":"Play your recording of {label}"}},{"k":"voice_pack_progress_empty","v":{"s":"Record sounds (with the 😀 / 🤔 self-rating, or the 🎯 AI coach on) to build a practice log here. Every recording is logged so you can see a sound improve over time."}},{"k":"voice_pack_progress_improving","v":{"s":"improving"}},{"k":"voice_pack_progress_legend","v":{"s":"A practice lo