o its numbered card."}},{"k":"preset_trophy","v":{"s":"Trophy"}},{"k":"preset_plant","v":{"s":"Potted plant"}},{"k":"preset_lamp","v":{"s":"Lamp"}},{"k":"preset_books","v":{"s":"Book stack"}},{"k":"preset_rocket","v":{"s":"Rocket"}},{"k":"preset_robot","v":{"s":"Robot"}},{"k":"preset_castle","v":{"s":"Castle"}},{"k":"preset_telescope","v":{"s":"Telescope"}},{"k":"preset_chest","v":{"s":"Treasure chest"}},{"k":"preset_snowman","v":{"s":"Snowman"}},{"k":"preset_mushroom","v":{"s":"Mushroom"}},{"k":"preset_globe","v":{"s":"Globe"}},{"k":"decorate_collectibles","v":{"s":"Collectibles (open 3D library)"}},{"k":"collect_sprout","v":{"s":"Sprout"}},{"k":"collect_boulder","v":{"s":"Mossy boulder"}},{"k":"collect_lantern","v":{"s":"Paper lantern"}},{"k":"collect_companion","v":{"s":"Blocky companion"}},{"k":"collect_torch","v":{"s":"Torch"}},{"k":"collect_chest_gold","v":{"s":"Golden chest"}},{"k":"collect_coin_stack","v":{"s":"Coin hoard"}},{"k":"collect_candles","v":{"s":"Candles"}},{"k":"collect_key","v":{"s":"Great key"}},{"k":"collect_banner","v":{"s":"Shield banner"}},{"k":"collect_crates","v":{"s":"Supply crates"}},{"k":"collect_barrel","v":{"s":"Barrel"}},{"k":"collect_pillar","v":{"s":"Carved pillar"}},{"k":"collect_table","v":{"s":"Scholar table"}},{"k":"collect_potion","v":{"s":"Potion bottle"}},{"k":"decorate_credit","v":{"s":"3D models: KayKit by Kay Lousberg (CC0)"}},{"k":"stamp_star","v":{"s":"Star"}},{"k":"stamp_heart","v":{"s":"Heart"}},{"k":"stamp_bolt","v":{"s":"Lightning bolt"}},{"k":"stamp_flame","v":{"s":"Flame"}},{"k":"stamp_rainbow","v":{"s":"Rainbow"}},{"k":"stamp_dragon","v":{"s":"Dragon"}},{"k":"stamp_trex","v":{"s":"T-rex"}},{"k":"stamp_rocket","v":{"s":"Rocket"}},{"k":"stamp_crown","v":{"s":"Crown"}},{"k":"stamp_music","v":{"s":"Music note"}},{"k":"stamp_ice","v":{"s":"Ice cube"}},{"k":"stamp_volcano","v":{"s":"Volcano"}},{"k":"voice_direct","v":{"s":"Speak"}},{"k":"voice_direct_title","v":{"s":"Speak your prompt for this locus, hands-free"}},{"k":"voice_listening","v":{"s":"Listening…"}},{"k":"voice_unavailable","v":{"s":"Voice input is unavailable in this browser."}},{"k":"theme_label","v":{"s":"Palace setting"}},{"k":"theme_gallery","v":{"s":"Gallery"}},{"k":"theme_pasture","v":{"s":"Pasture"}},{"k":"theme_space","v":{"s":"Space"}},{"k":"enter_vr","v":{"s":"VR"}},{"k":"enter_vr_title","v":{"s":"Enter VR — stand inside the palace (needs a headset)"}},{"k":"vr_entered","v":{"s":"Entered VR. Look around and walk the palace."}},{"k":"vr_failed","v":{"s":"Could not start VR."}},{"k":"hint","v":{"s":"A memory palace works through repetition: walk the route, picture each mnemonic vividly, then walk it again from memory."}},{"k":"caption","v":{"s":"Method of loci: a practice strategy with strong evidence for remembering ordered material — the effect comes from walking the route repeatedly and picturing each image vividly, not from the tool itself."}},{"k":"empty_title","v":{"s":"No palace to walk yet"}},{"k":"empty_body","v":{"s":"Generate this organizer from a source text and the facts will become rooms and loci you can walk through."}},{"k":"furnish","v":{"s":"Furnish with AI images"}},{"k":"relief_toggle","v":{"s":"Relief"}},{"k":"relief_tooltip","v":{"s":"Relief mode: also generate a depth map per locus so furnished images become 3D bas-reliefs (two images per locus — uses more image credits and save space)"}},{"k":"furnishing","v":{"s":"Furnishing {done}/{total}…"}},{"k":"furnish_tooltip","v":{"s":"Generate one AI illustration per locus from its mnemonic (uses image credits; saved with the resource)"}},{"k":"furnish_done","v":{"s":"🖼 Palace furnished! Walk the route to lock the images in."}},{"k":"furnish_done_already","v":{"s":"Every locus already has an image."}},{"k":"furnish_partial","v":{"s":"Furnished {ok} loci; {fail} could not be generated."}},{"k":"clear_images","v":{"s":"Clear images"}},{"k":"clear_tooltip","v":{"s":"Remove the generated images from this palace"}},{"k":"sculpt","v":{"s":"Sculpt 3D objects"}},{"k":"sculpt_tooltip","v":{"s":"AI designs a small primitive-block sculpture of each mnemonic and places it beside the frame (saved with the resource)"}},{"k":"sculpting","v":{"s":"Sculpting {done}/{total}…"}},{"k":"sculpt_done","v":{"s":"🗿 Sculptures placed! Walk the route to meet them."}},{"k":"sculpt_done_already","v":{"s":"Every locus already has a sculpture."}},{"k":"sculpt_partial","v":{"s":"Sculpted {ok} loci; {fail} could not be designed."}},{"k":"clear_generated","v":{"s":"Clear generated art"}},{"k":"clear_generated_tooltip","v":{"s":"Remove the generated images and sculptures from this palace"}},{"k":"gen_stop","v":{"s":"Stop"}},{"k":"gen_stop_tooltip","v":{"s":"Stop generating — keep what has been made so far"}},{"k":"gen_stopped","v":{"s":"Stopped — {ok} made so far."}},{"k":"direct_toggle","v":{"s":"Direct the AI"}},{"k":"direct_tooltip","v":{"s":"Direct the AI yourself: write the prompt for each locus and the AI checks it before creating"}},{"k":"direct_at_entry","v":{"s":"✍️ Walk to a locus (▶ or WASD), then direct the AI to create its image or sculpture."}},{"k":"direct_for","v":{"s":"Direct the AI for: {label}"}},{"k":"direct_make","v":{"s":"Make:"}},{"k":"direct_image","v":{"s":"Image"}},{"k":"direct_sculpture","v":{"s":"Sculpture"}},{"k":"direct_placeholder","v":{"s":"Describe what the AI should create here…"}},{"k":"direct_submit","v":{"s":"Check & create"}},{"k":"direct_checking","v":{"s":"Checking…"}},{"k":"direct_creating","v":{"s":"Creating…"}},{"k":"direct_note","v":{"s":"The AI checks your prompt fits the fact and is school-appropriate before creating."}},{"k":"direct_rejected","v":{"s":"Let’s adjust:"}},{"k":"direct_use_enhanced","v":{"s":"Use the improved version"}},{"k":"direct_use_mine","v":{"s":"Use mine as-is"}},{"k":"direct_placed","v":{"s":"✨ Placed at this locus! Walk on and direct the next."}},{"k":"direct_gen_failed","v":{"s":"Generation failed — try a different prompt."}},{"k":"direct_eval_failed","v":{"s":"Could not check the prompt — try again."}},{"k":"refine_title","v":{"s":"Refine this sculpture"}},{"k":"refine_bigger","v":{"s":"Bigger"}},{"k":"refine_smaller","v":{"s":"Smaller"}},{"k":"refine_rotate","v":{"s":"Rotate"}},{"k":"refine_recolor","v":{"s":"Recolor"}},{"k":"refine_placeholder","v":{"s":"Tell the AI what to change… (e.g. add a red hat)"}},{"k":"refine_apply","v":{"s":"Refine"}},{"k":"refine_done","v":{"s":"✨ Refined!"}},{"k":"refine_failed","v":{"s":"Could not refine — try rephrasing."}},{"k":"locus_of","v":{"s":"Locus {idx} of {total}"}},{"k":"picture_this","v":{"s":"Picture this:"}},{"k":"decorate_restored","v":{"s":"Stamp removed — your illustration is back."}},{"k":"no_walk_notice","v":{"s":"This device cannot show the 3D palace, so the walking route is listed below instead. Making art, decorating, building and the recall walk all need the 3D walk and are turned off here — the printable study sheet still works."}},{"k":"build_here","v":{"s":"Add a spot in this room"}},{"k":"build_here_tip","v":{"s":"Add a spot to the room you are standing in — no pointer needed"}},{"k":"answer_wrong","v":{"s":"Not quite — try again."}},{"k":"answer_right","v":{"s":"Correct."}},{"k":"stale_notice","v":{"s":"{count} spot(s) now hold different facts than when you worked on them, so that work is being held back rather than shown on the wrong locus."}},{"k":"stale_clear","v":{"s":"Clear it"}},{"k":"stale_cleared","v":{"s":"Cleared the work whose spots had changed."}},{"k":"recall_focused_note","v":{"s":"Focused review: only the {count} loci that were due."}},{"k":"recall_self_rated_note","v":{"s":"You rated {count} of these yourself — practice, not a tested recall."}},{"k":"build_toggle","v":{"s":"Build"}},{"k":"build_tooltip","v":{"s":"Extend the palace yourself: point at a spot on any room floor and click to add a new locus there"}},{"k":"build_hint","v":{"s":"Point at the floor inside any room and click to add a new spot. Rooms you add are yours to keep — the palace grows, and nothing you already learned moves."}},{"k":"build_outside","v":{"s":"Aim at the floor inside a room to put a new spot there."}},{"k":"build_name_label","v":{"s":"What lives at this new spot in {room}?"}},{"k":"build_name_placeholder","v":{"s":"A fact, a word, a step…"}},{"k":"build_place","v":{"s":"Place it"}},{"k":"build_added","v":{"s":"Added \"{label}\" to your palace."}},{"k":"build_new_room","v":{"s":"New room"}},{"k":"build_room_label","v":{"s":"Name your new room"}},{"k":"build_room_placeholder","v":{"s":"The Attic, Grandma’s kitchen…"}},{"k":"build_room_add","v":{"s":"Add room"}},{"k":"build_room_added","v":{"s":"Added the {title} to your palace."}},{"k":"build_count","v":{"s":"You have added {rooms} room(s) and {spots} spot(s)."}},{"k":"build_remove","v":{"s":"Remove this spot"}},{"k":"build_remove_tip","v":{"s":"Remove this spot you added, along with anything placed on it"}},{"k":"build_removed","v":{"s":"Spot removed from your palace."}},{"k":"own_badge","v":{"s":"Yours"}},{"k":"own_write","v":{"s":"Write my own image"}},{"k":"own_edit","v":{"s":"Edit my image"}},{"k":"own_tooltip","v":{"s":"Write the picture in your own words — an image you invent yourself is easier to recall than one you were handed"}},{"k":"own_label","v":{"s":"Your picture for: {label}"}},{"k":"own_placeholder","v":{"s":"Something you can SEE happening right here…"}},{"k":"own_save","v":{"s":"Save my image"}},{"k":"own_revert","v":{"s":"Use the generated one"}},{"k":"own_saved","v":{"s":"Saved — that image is yours now."}},{"k":"own_reverted","v":{"s":"Back to the generated image."}},{"k":"own_warn_echo","v":{"s":"That is the item name again — describe a picture of it instead."}},{"k":"own_warn_short","v":{"s":"A little more detail gives your memory something to hold on to."}},{"k":"own_crit_action","v":{"s":"Is something MOVING in it?"}},{"k":"own_crit_sensory","v":{"s":"Can you see a colour or hear a sound?"}},{"k":"own_crit_placed","v":{"s":"Is it happening at THIS spot?"}},{"k":"own_crit_personal","v":{"s":"Does it connect to something of yours?"}},{"k":"order_next","v":{"s":"Try it a harder way:"}},{"k":"order_backward","v":{"s":"Backwards"}},{"k":"order_backward_tip","v":{"s":"Walk the same palace from the last locus to the first — proof the content is stored in places, not in list order"}},{"k":"order_shuffle","v":{"s":"Shuffled"}},{"k":"order_shuffle_tip","v":{"s":"Visit the loci in a scrambled order — no running start from the locus before it"}},{"k":"route_title","v":{"s":"Palace route"}},{"k":"route_aria","v":{"s":"Memory palace route in walking order"}},{"k":"no_webgl","v":{"s":"This browser cannot show the 3D palace. Showing the walking route instead."}},{"k":"load_error","v":{"s":"The 3D library could not load. Showing the walking route instead."}},{"k":"gl_error","v":{"s":"The 3D palace could not start. Showing the walking route instead."}},{"k":"canvas_role","v":{"s":"Memory palace 3D walk"}},{"k":"canvas_label","v":{"s":"Memory palace. Use W A S D to walk and the arrow keys to jump between loci in order."}},{"k":"canvas_instructions","v":{"s":"W A S D keys walk you around the palace and dragging looks around. The right and left arrow keys jump to the next or previous locus in order; Home returns to the entrance and End jumps to the last locus. O toggles the overview map. Each stop announces the room, the item, and its mnemonic image."}},{"k":"controls_hint","v":{"s":"WASD to walk · drag to look · ◀ ▶ for the guided tour"}},{"k":"prev","v":{"s":"Previous locus"}},{"k":"next","v":{"s":"Next locus"}},{"k":"overview","v":{"s":"Overview"}},{"k":"sr_entry","v":{"s":"Palace entrance"}},{"k":"sr_locus","v":{"s":"Locus"}},{"k":"sr_of","v":{"s":"of"}},{"k":"sr_room","v":{"s":"room"}},{"k":"sr_picture","v":{"s":"Picture this"}},{"k":"sr_recall_q","v":{"s":"What belongs at this locus?"}},{"k":"recall_play","v":{"s":"Recall walk"}},{"k":"recall_expert","v":{"s":"Expert recall"}},{"k":"recall_tooltip","v":{"s":"Practice: the labels are covered — walk the palace and recall what lives at each locus"}},{"k":"recall_expert_tooltip","v":{"s":"Expert mode: type each answer instead of picking from the bank (stronger retrieval practice; forgiving spelling)"}},{"k":"recall_hint","v":{"s":"🧠 The labels are covered — the image is your cue. Recall what lives at each locus; after two misses the mnemonic appears."}},{"k":"recall_start","v":{"s":"🧠 The labels are covered. Walk the palace and recall what lives at each locus!"}},{"k":"recall_q","v":{"s":"What belongs at this locus?"}},{"k":"recall_progress","v":{"s":"{done}/{total} recalled"}},{"k":"recall_answered","v":{"s":"Answered — walk on (▶) or pick another frame."}},{"k":"recall_at_entry","v":{"s":"Walk forward (▶ or →) to the first locus to begin recalling."}},{"k":"recall_type_placeholder","v":{"s":"Type what belongs here…"}},{"k":"recall_submit","v":{"s":"Check"}},{"k":"recall_reveal","v":{"s":"Reveal answer (no points)"}},{"k":"recall_retry","v":{"s":"Walk it again"}},{"k":"recall_exit","v":{"s":"Exit recall"}},{"k":"recall_perfect","v":{"s":"🏛✨ Perfect walk! Every locus recalled on the first try."}},{"k":"recall_summary","v":{"s":"Recalled {ok} of {total} ({first} on the first try)."}},{"k":"recall_points","v":{"s":"{points} points"}},{"k":"recall_empty","v":{"s":"Not enough loci to play yet."}},{"k":"review_due","v":{"s":"{count} loci are ready for review"}},{"k":"review_due_why","v":{"s":"— walk the palace again to strengthen the ones fading from memory."}},{"k":"review_now","v":{"s":"Review now"}}],"id":243}},{"k":"concept_space","v":{"o":[{"k":"hint","v":{"s":"Position carries meaning: left → right = sequence · higher = more abstract · depth = strand."}},{"k":"caption","v":{"s":"Drag to orbit · scroll to zoom · click a concept for details. Drag a concept to place it on its strand plane — position is saved with the resource."}},{"k":"art_panel_aria","v":{"s":"Concept art"}},{"k":"art_has_sculpture","v":{"s":"A sculpture floats above this concept."}},{"k":"art_has_image","v":{"s":"An image floats above this concept."}},{"k":"art_sculpt_auto","v":{"s":"Sculpt from this concept"}},{"k":"art_or_direct","v":{"s":"or describe your own:"}},{"k":"art_prompt_placeholder","v":{"s":"e.g. a glowing brain with gears"}},{"k":"art_checking","v":{"s":"… Checking your idea"}},{"k":"art_creating","v":{"s":"… Creating"}},{"k":"art_placed","v":{"s":"✨ Placed! Refine it, or click another concept."}},{"k":"art_failed","v":{"s":"Could not create that — try again."}},{"k":"art_remove","v":{"s":"Remove art"}},{"k":"art_removed","v":{"s":"Removed."}},{"k":"art_no_imagen","v":{"s":"Image generation is unavailable here — try a sculpture."}},{"k":"furnish","v":{"s":"Furnish all"}},{"k":"furnish_tooltip","v":{"s":"Teacher: generate a sculpture or illustration for every concept at once, the way the Memory Palace furnishes its loci"}},{"k":"furnish_panel_aria","v":{"s":"Furnish every concept"}},{"k":"furnish_heading","v":{"s":"Furnish every concept"}},{"k":"furnish_pending","v":{"s":"{n} still need art"}},{"k":"furnish_mode_label","v":{"s":"What to generate"}},{"k":"furnish_mode_sculpture","v":{"s":"Sculptures"}},{"k":"furnish_mode_image","v":{"s":"Images"}},{"k":"furnish_mnemonics","v":{"s":"Write a vivid memory image for each concept first (the method-of-loci step). One extra AI call, much stronger cues."}},{"k":"furnish_storage_note","v":{"s":"About {mb} MB of pictures would be saved with this resource ({n} images). Browser storage usually gives out near 5 MB, and each image costs a credit. Sculptures are about 1 KB each and cost none."}},{"k":"furnish_start","v":{"s":"Make art for {n} concepts"}},{"k":"furnishing","v":{"s":"Furnishing {done}/{total}…"}},{"k":"furnish_stop","v":{"s":"Stop"}},{"k":"furnish_stopped","v":{"s":"Stopped — {ok} made so far."}},{"k":"furnish_partial","v":{"s":"Made art for {ok} concepts; {fail} could not be generated."}},{"k":"furnish_done","v":{"s":"✨ Every concept furnished — orbit the space to meet them."}},{"k"