bered steps below, or describe one change. Every edit returns the workflow to draft review."}},{"k":"plan_edit_failed","v":{"s":"That edit could not be applied. The workflow is unchanged."}},{"k":"plan_closed","v":{"s":"The command workflow is closed."}},{"k":"command_closed","v":{"s":"The proposed command is closed."}},{"k":"header","v":{"s":"AI Guide & Assistant"}},{"k":"voice_mode","v":{"s":"Voice Mode"}},{"k":"voice_on","v":{"s":"Voice: ON"}},{"k":"voice_enable","v":{"s":"Enable Voice Mode (Talk to AI)"}},{"k":"voice_disable","v":{"s":"Disable Voice Mode"}},{"k":"save_chat","v":{"s":"Save Chat"}},{"k":"show_me","v":{"s":"Show Me"}},{"k":"show_me_on","v":{"s":"Show Me: ON"}},{"k":"autofill_label","v":{"s":"Blueprint Mode"}},{"k":"blueprint_mode_label","v":{"s":"Blueprint Mode"}},{"k":"blueprint_offer","v":{"s":"This sounds like a lesson build — want Blueprint Mode? It walks you from description to plan to build."}},{"k":"blueprint_offer_start","v":{"s":"Start Blueprint Mode"}},{"k":"blueprint_offer_keep_chatting","v":{"s":"Keep chatting"}},{"k":"blueprint_offer_dismissed","v":{"s":"Sure — we'll keep chatting."}},{"k":"collapse","v":{"s":"Collapse to a bar (keeps the conversation)"}},{"k":"restore","v":{"s":"Restore chat"}},{"k":"input_placeholder_showme","v":{"s":"Type what you want to find..."}},{"k":"input_placeholder_default","v":{"s":"Ask about differentiation..."}},{"k":"auto_send_on","v":{"s":"Auto: ON"}},{"k":"auto_send_off","v":{"s":"Auto: OFF"}},{"k":"auto_send_tooltip","v":{"s":"Automatically send message after a brief pause in speech"}},{"k":"show_me_enable_tooltip","v":{"s":"Enable Show Me Mode (Forces UI Navigation)"}},{"k":"show_me_disable_tooltip","v":{"s":"Disable Show Me Mode"}},{"k":"highlight_error","v":{"s":"Sorry, I couldn't highlight that element. It may have been removed or is currently hidden."}},{"k":"showme_error","v":{"s":"Unable to demonstrate that feature right now. Please try clicking on the element directly."}},{"k":"cmd_generic","v":{"s":"run a command"}},{"k":"cmd_done","v":{"s":"Done."}},{"k":"cmd_failed","v":{"s":"I couldn't run that. Try the command menu (Ctrl+K)."}},{"k":"cmd_confirm_prompt","v":{"s":"It looks like you want to **{label}**. Run that, or keep chatting?"}},{"k":"cmd_confirm_do","v":{"s":"Do it"}},{"k":"cmd_confirm_skip","v":{"s":"Just chat"}},{"k":"cmd_confirm_aria","v":{"s":"That looks like a command. Confirm to run it, or keep chatting."}},{"k":"flow","v":{"o":[{"k":"fetching_source","v":{"s":"Fetching source content... please wait."}},{"k":"url_error","v":{"s":"I couldn't parse that URL. Please try pasting it again."}},{"k":"topic_detected","v":{"s":"Topic detected: \"{topic}\". Generating comprehensive source text..."}},{"k":"source_prompt","v":{"s":"Please paste a URL or type a Topic to continue."}},{"k":"running_analysis","v":{"s":"Running Analysis... (Verifying facts and difficulty)."}},{"k":"skipping_analysis","v":{"s":"Skipping analysis. Should we create a **Glossary** instead?"}},{"k":"offer_analysis","v":{"s":"I can analyze the text for you. Say 'Yes' to start, or 'Skip'."}},{"k":"generating_glossary","v":{"s":"Generating Glossary & Icons (this may take a moment)..."}},{"k":"no_langs_warning","v":{"s":"I notice no target languages are selected. Would you like to add one (e.g., 'Spanish') before I generate the Glossary?"}},{"k":"added_lang","v":{"s":"Added {lang}. Generating Glossary..."}},{"k":"offer_glossary","v":{"s":"Ready to make the Glossary? (Yes/Skip)"}},{"k":"adapting_text","v":{"s":"Adapting text for {grade}..."}},{"k":"interest_check","v":{"s":"Ready to adapt the text. Would you like to weave in a specific student interest (e.g., 'Minecraft', 'Soccer') to make it more engaging?"}},{"k":"integrating_interest","v":{"s":"Integrating \"{interest}\". Generating text..."}},{"k":"offer_text","v":{"s":"Should I adapt the text for {grade}? (Yes/Skip)"}},{"k":"skipping_text","v":{"s":"Skipping text adaptation. Want a **Visual Organizer**?"}},{"k":"generating_text","v":{"s":"Understood. Generating text for {grade}..."}},{"k":"generating_visual","v":{"s":"Dreaming up a visual diagram... (Using Imagen)."}},{"k":"creating_worksheet","v":{"s":"Creating fill-in-the-blank worksheet visual..."}},{"k":"skipping_visual","v":{"s":"Skipping visual. How about an **FAQ List**?"}},{"k":"offer_visual","v":{"s":"Ready for visuals. Should I generate a standard 'Diagram' or a 'Worksheet' with fill-in-the-blank boxes?"}},{"k":"initial_prompt_context","v":{"s":"I've detected source material (\"{snippet}\").\n\nHow would you like to proceed?\n\n1. **{option_step}:** We build resources one by one together.\n2. **{option_pack}:** I analyze the text and generate a complete lesson pack instantly.\n\n(Type '{keyword_step}' or '{keyword_pack}')"}},{"k":"initial_prompt_cold","v":{"s":"Let's build your lesson sequentially. First step: **Source Material**.\n\nDo you have a **Link** to an article, or a **Topic** you'd like to generate text for?"}},{"k":"option_step","v":{"s":"Step-by-Step"}},{"k":"option_pack","v":{"s":"Full Pack"}},{"k":"keyword_step","v":{"s":"Step"}},{"k":"keyword_pack","v":{"s":"Pack"}},{"k":"highlight_confirm","v":{"s":"Sure! I've highlighted that section for you."}},{"k":"highlight_error","v":{"s":"I can't find that element right now. It might be hidden."}},{"k":"independent_welcome","v":{"s":"Welcome! I'm here to help you learn. You can generate texts, quizzes, and games to master this topic at your own pace."}},{"k":"save_actionable_loading","v":{"s":"Summarizing..."}},{"k":"save_actionable_btn","v":{"s":"Save Actionable Steps"}},{"k":"advice_saved","v":{"s":"Advice saved to history!"}},{"k":"history_saved_toast","v":{"s":"Full conversation saved to history!"}},{"k":"advice_title","v":{"s":"Differentiation Strategy"}},{"k":"advice_saved_raw","v":{"s":"Advice saved (raw)."}},{"k":"start_scratch","v":{"s":"I see we're starting from scratch! What kind of lesson would you like to build?\n\nTell me the **Topic**, **Grade Level**, and **Style** (e.g., 'A funny story about Gravity for 1st Graders' or 'A rigorous article on The Civil War for High School').\n\nI'll configure the source generator for you."}}],"id":359}},{"k":"blueprint","v":{"o":[{"k":"analyzing","v":{"s":"Analyzing context and designing a lesson blueprint... (You'll be able to review and modify the plan before we generate the resources)."}},{"k":"presented","v":{"s":"Here is your Lesson Blueprint. You can modify it by typing below (e.g., 'Add a quiz', 'Change grade to 5th') or click Generate Plan."}},{"k":"updated","v":{"s":"Blueprint updated! You can suggest more changes or type 'Go' to start."}},{"k":"error","v":{"s":"I couldn't generate a blueprint. Let's do it step-by-step."}},{"k":"change_fail","v":{"s":"I couldn't make that change. Try saying 'Add Quiz' or 'Remove Timeline'."}},{"k":"complete","v":{"s":"The lesson pack is complete! Let me know if you need to refine anything."}},{"k":"reset","v":{"s":"I'm not sure where we are in the flow. Let's reset to source selection."}},{"k":"auto_fill_stop","v":{"s":"Auto-fill flow stopped."}},{"k":"edit_prompt","v":{"s":"What should I change? Tell me what to add, remove, or swap."}},{"k":"question_prompt","v":{"s":"Go ahead. I'll answer without touching the plan."}},{"k":"question_fail","v":{"s":"I couldn't answer that one. The plan is unchanged."}},{"k":"still_pending","v":{"s":"The plan above is unchanged. Ready when you are."}}],"id":360}},{"k":"pack","v":{"o":[{"k":"count_selection","v":{"s":"Understood. How extensive should this lesson be?\n\n- **Auto:** AI decides best fit.\n- **All:** Generate everything.\n- **Custom:** Type a number (e.g. '10')."}},{"k":"designing","v":{"s":"Designing a {count}-resource lesson blueprint... You'll be able to suggest revisions to the plan once I generate it."}},{"k":"error","v":{"s":"I encountered an error designing the blueprint. Let's try Step-by-Step instead."}},{"k":"comprehensive","v":{"s":"comprehensive"}}],"id":361}},{"k":"chips","v":{"o":[{"k":"yes","v":{"s":"Yes"}},{"k":"skip","v":{"s":"Skip"}},{"k":"or_type","v":{"s":"...or just type your answer below."}},{"k":"count_auto","v":{"s":"Auto"}},{"k":"count_auto_hint","v":{"s":"AI picks the best fit"}},{"k":"count_all","v":{"s":"All"}},{"k":"count_all_hint","v":{"s":"Generate everything"}},{"k":"count_custom","v":{"s":"Custom..."}},{"k":"count_custom_hint","v":{"s":"Type a number (1-20)"}},{"k":"quiz_default_hint","v":{"s":"Default"}},{"k":"add_language","v":{"s":"Add a language..."}},{"k":"add_language_hint","v":{"s":"Type a language name (e.g. 'Spanish')"}},{"k":"english_only","v":{"s":"English only"}},{"k":"add_interest","v":{"s":"Add an interest..."}},{"k":"add_interest_hint","v":{"s":"Type an interest (e.g. 'Soccer')"}},{"k":"no_thanks","v":{"s":"No thanks"}},{"k":"org_outline","v":{"s":"Outline"}},{"k":"org_flow","v":{"s":"Flow Chart"}},{"k":"org_venn","v":{"s":"Venn Diagram"}},{"k":"org_map","v":{"s":"Concept Map"}},{"k":"org_cause","v":{"s":"Cause & Effect"}},{"k":"visual_diagram","v":{"s":"Diagram"}},{"k":"visual_worksheet","v":{"s":"Worksheet"}},{"k":"visual_worksheet_hint","v":{"s":"Fill-in-the-blank version"}},{"k":"frames_starters","v":{"s":"Sentence Starters"}},{"k":"frames_paragraph","v":{"s":"Paragraph Frames"}},{"k":"frames_discussion","v":{"s":"Discussion Prompts"}},{"k":"adv_choice","v":{"s":"Multiple Choice"}},{"k":"adv_debate","v":{"s":"Debate"}},{"k":"bp_generate","v":{"s":"Generate it"}},{"k":"bp_generate_hint","v":{"s":"Build every resource in the plan"}},{"k":"bp_change","v":{"s":"Change something"}},{"k":"bp_change_hint","v":{"s":"Add, remove, or swap a resource"}},{"k":"bp_ask","v":{"s":"Ask about this plan"}},{"k":"bp_ask_hint","v":{"s":"The plan stays exactly as it is"}}],"id":362}},{"k":"advice_saved","v":{"s":"Advice saved!"}},{"k":"advice_saved_raw","v":{"s":"Advice saved to notes"}},{"k":"highlight_confirm","v":{"s":"Highlight confirmed"}},{"k":"history_saved_toast","v":{"s":"Chat history saved!"}},{"k":"independent_welcome","v":{"s":"Welcome! Ask me anything about the content."}},{"k":"save_actionable_btn","v":{"s":"Save Actionable"}},{"k":"save_actionable_loading","v":{"s":"Saving..."}},{"k":"more_actions","v":{"s":"More chat options"}},{"k":"pause","v":{"s":"Pause"}},{"k":"pause_tooltip","v":{"s":"Pause AlloBot command listening and release its microphone session"}},{"k":"plan_busy","v":{"s":"A plan is still running — say “stop” to end it after the current step, or wait for it to finish."}},{"k":"plan_confirm","v":{"s":"That takes a few steps. Here is my plan:"}},{"k":"plan_confirm_aria","v":{"s":"I proposed a multi-step plan. Confirm to run it, or keep chatting."}},{"k":"plan_confirm2","v":{"s":"Dry run passed. Run all steps, edit the workflow, or keep chatting."}},{"k":"plan_done","v":{"s":"All steps finished."}},{"k":"plan_failed","v":{"s":"The plan stopped early."}},{"k":"plan_resume","v":{"s":"Resume"}},{"k":"plan_resume_exact","v":{"s":"The finished steps are kept. You can resume the exact remaining sequence without re-entering it."}},{"k":"plan_resume_hint","v":{"s":"The finished steps are kept."}},{"k":"plan_run","v":{"s":"Run all"}},{"k":"plan_running","v":{"s":"Running the plan — I’ll report each step here."}},{"k":"plan_skip","v":{"s":"Just chat"}},{"k":"plan_stop","v":{"s":"Stop after current step"}},{"k":"plan_stopping","v":{"s":"Stopping after the current step finishes — nothing is cut off mid-generation."}},{"k":"plan_timeout_wait","v":{"s":"Wait for the current background task to finish before starting another command."}},{"k":"plan_undo","v":{"s":"Undo plan (restore content & settings)"}},{"k":"plan_undo_failed","v":{"s":"The undo didn’t fully apply — check your content before continuing."}},{"k":"plan_undo_none","v":{"s":"There’s nothing from a plan to undo right now."}},{"k":"plan_undone","v":{"s":"Restored your content and settings to the moment before the plan ran."}},{"k":"resume","v":{"s":"Resume"}},{"k":"resume_tooltip","v":{"s":"Resume AlloBot command listening"}},{"k":"show_me_desc","v":{"s":"Asking “where is…” always points, with or without this."}},{"k":"talk","v":{"s":"Talk"}},{"k":"talk_hint","v":{"s":"Listening for app commands. You can also ask a question or describe a multi-step request; proposed actions appear in a plan card you review before anything runs. Try “open the learning hub”, “read this page”, or “where is the export button?” Say “pause listening” to pause or “stop listening” to finish. Privacy note: this uses your selected recognition engine. On-device Whisper keeps recognition audio on this device; a browser speech service may send command audio to its provider; Gemini cloud transcription sends each completed spoken turn to Gemini only when you explicitly select it."}},{"k":"talk_on","v":{"s":"Listening"}},{"k":"talk_paused","v":{"s":"Paused"}},{"k":"talk_start_tooltip","v":{"s":"Start AlloBot command listening"}},{"k":"talk_stop_paused_tooltip","v":{"s":"Stop the paused AlloBot voice session"}},{"k":"talk_stop_tooltip","v":{"s":"Stop AlloBot command listening"}},{"k":"choices_group","v":{"s":"Suggested replies"}},{"k":"command_details","v":{"s":"Command details"}},{"k":"transcript_aria","v":{"s":"Conversation transcript"}},{"k":"input_aria","v":{"s":"Ask the UDL guide a question"}},{"k":"send_aria","v":{"s":"Send message"}},{"k":"send_showme_aria","v":{"s":"Show me where this is on screen"}}],"id":358}},{"k":"student_dashboard","v":{"o":[{"k":"level_progress","v":{"s":"Level Progress"}},{"k":"level_abbr","v":{"s":"Lvl"}},{"k":"total_xp","v":{"s":"Total XP"}},{"k":"no_activities","v":{"s":"No activities completed yet."}}],"id":363}},{"k":"prompts","v":{"o":[{"k":"verified_correct","v":{"s":"**Verified Correct Answer:**"}},{"k":"actual_correct","v":{"s":"**Actual Correct Answer:**"}},{"k":"correction_warning","v":{"s":"**CORRECTION / WARNING:**"}},{"k":"why_incorrect","v":{"s":"**Why other options are incorrect:**"}}],"id":364}},{"k":"project_settings","v":{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Student Project Settings"}},{"k":"enable_dictation","v":{"s":"Enable Dictation in Student Mode"}},{"k":"dictation_desc","v":{"s":"Allow students to use voice-to-text input."}},{"k":"enable_socratic","v":{"s":"Enable Socratic Tutor"}},{"k":"socratic_desc","v":{"s":"Allow students to ask AI for hints."}},{"k":"socratic_instructions_label","v":{"s":"Socratic Tutor Guidance (this lesson)"}},{"k":"socratic_instructions_desc","v":{"s":"Optional. Tell the tutor what to focus on for this lesson. It is added to the tutor's rules — it never replaces them, so the tutor still won't give away answers. Students don't see this."}},{"k":"socratic_instructions_placeholder","v":{"s":"e.g. Keep them focused on the causes of the Civil War. Nudge toward the timeline rather than dates. Keep replies to one short, concrete sentence."}},{"k":"enable_free_response","v":{"s":"Allow Adventure Free Response"}},{"k":"free_response_desc","v":{"s":"Let students type actions instead of just Multiple Choice."}},{"k":"enable_persona_free","v":{"s":"Allow Interview Free Response"}},{"k":"persona_free_desc","v":{"s":"Let students type questions instead of just selecting options."}},{"k":"unlock_xp","v":{"s":"Global XP to Unlock Adventure"}},{"k":"unlock_xp_desc","v":{"s":"Require XP from other activities (e.g. Matching, Quiz) to start."}},{"k":"base_xp","v":{"s":"Base XP Per Level"}},{"k":"base_xp_desc","v":{"s":"Sets the difficulty curve. (Default: 100 XP)"}},{"k":"storybook_xp","v":{"s":"Adventure XP to Unlock Storybook"}},{"k":"storybook_xp_desc","v":{"s":"XP earned *inside* the Adventure required to export."}},{"k":"permissions_header","v":{"s":"Adventure Permissions"}},{"k":"enable_adventure","v":{"s":"Include Adventure in this assignment"}},{"k":"enable_adventure_desc","v":{"s":"Off hides the Adventure panel from students. Use this when the lesson has no adventure."}},{"k":"perm_difficulty","v":{"s":"Allow Difficulty Change"}},{"k":"perm_mode","v":{"s":"Allow Mode Switching"}},{"k":"perm_custom","v":{"s":"Allow Custom Prompting"}},{"k":"perm_visuals","v":{"s":"Allow Visuals Toggle"}},{"k":"perm_lock_all","v":{"s":"Lock All Adventure Settings"}},{"k":"portal_qr_aria","v":{"s":"Educator Evaluation district portal QR code"}},{"k":"portal_qr_label","v":{"s":"Portal QR code"}},{"k":"portal_qr_title","v":{"s":"Open the district evaluation portal on another device"}},{"k":"qr_unavailable_build","v":{"s":"The QR generator is not available in this build."}}],"id":365}},{"k":"bot","v":{"o":[{"k":"assistant_landmark","v":{"s":"AlloBot assistant"}},{"k":"move_instructions","v":{"s":"Use the arrow keys to move AlloBot. Hold Shift with an arrow key for a larger step."}},{"k":"mood_idle","v":{"s":"I'm Allo! Need help?"}},{"k":"mood_happy","v":{"s":"Ready to learn!"}},{"k":"mood_thinking","v":{"s":"Thinking..."}},{"k":"mood_sad","v":{"s":"Oh no..."}},{"k":"sleep_title","v":{"s":"Sleep (Minimize)"}},{"k":"sleep_aria","v":{"s":"Minimize Assistant"}},{"k":"chat_title","v":{"s":"Voice & Audio Settings"}},{"k":"chat_aria","v":{"s":"Open voice and TTS settings"}},{"k":"mute_on_title","v":{"s":"Mute Voice"}},{"k":"mute_on_aria","v":{"s":"Mute Voice"}},{"k":"mute_off_title","v":{"s":"Unmute Voice"}},{"k":"mute_off_aria","v":{"s":"Unmute Voice"}},{"k":"mic_stop_title","v":{"s":"Stop Listening"}},{"k":"mic_stop_aria","v":{"s":"Stop Listening"}},{"k":"mic_start_title","v":{"s":"Voice Input"}},{"k":"mic_start_aria","v":{"s":"Voice Input"}},{"k":"mic_live_announce","v":{"s":"Microphone on. AlloBot is listening."}},{"k":"mic_off_announce","v":{"s":"Microphone off. AlloBot has stopped listening."}},{"k":"wake_title","v":{"s":"Click to Wake"}},{"k":"summon_msg","v":{"s":"I'm here! Click me to open the guide."}},{"k":"aria_sleeping","v":{"s":"AlloBot (Asleep). Press Enter to wake."}},{"k":"aria_active","v":{"s":"AlloBot AI Assistant"}},{"k":"sleeping","v":{"s":"Zzz..."}}],"id":366}},{"k":"error","v":{"o":[{"k":"syntax_scramble","v":{"s":"Syntax Scramble encountered an error."}}],"id":367}},{"k":"profiles","v":{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Student Profiles"}},{"k":"import_tooltip","v":{"s":"Import Profiles JSON"}},{"k":"export_tooltip","v":{"s":"Export Profiles JSON"}},{"k":"active_profile","v":{"s":"Active"}},{"k":"select_label","v":{"s":"Select Student Profile"}},{"k":"select_default","v":{"s":"-- Select Group / Profile --"}},{"k":"delete_tooltip","v":{"s":"Delete Profile"}},{"k":"saved","v":{"s":"Profile \"{name}\" saved!"}},{"k":"loaded","v":{"s":"Loaded profile: {name}"}},{"k":"deleted","v":{"s":"Profile deleted."}},{"k":"import_success","v":{"s":"{count} profiles loaded!"}},{"k":"import_error","v":{"s":"Failed to import profiles."}},{"k":"export_success","v":{"s":"Profiles exported!"}},{"k":"new_profile_label","v":{"s":"New Profile Name"}},{"k":"new_profile_placeholder","v":{"s":"e.g. ESL Group A (3rd Grade)"}},{"k":"save_helper","v":{"s":"Saves current Grade, Language, Interests, DOK & Standards."}},{"k":"save_tooltip","v":{"s":"Save current configuration as new profile"}}],"id":368}},{"k":"chat","v":{"o":[{"k":"location_unknown","v":{"s":"I'm not sure where \"{target}\" is located in the interface."}},{"k":"generating_resource","v":{"s":"Understood. Generating the Adapted Text resource now..."}},{"k":"settings_updated","v":{"s":"I've updated your settings:\n- {changes}\n\nReady to generate?"}},{"k":"settings_failed","v":{"s":"I understood you wanted to change settings, but I couldn't detect specific values. Please try again."}},{"k":"find_feature_error","v":{"s":"Couldn't find that feature."}}],"id":369}},{"k":"toolbar","v":{"o":[{"k":"show_bot","v":{"s":"Show AI Assistant"}},{"k":"hide_bot","v":{"s":"Hide AI Assistant"}},{"k":"stickers_label","v":{"s":"Stickers"}},{"k":"stickers_tooltip","v":{"s":"Toggle Sticker Mode"}},{"k":"start_tour","v":{"s":"Start Tour"}},{"k":"start_tour_aria","v":{"s":"Start guided tour"}},{"k":"about_label","v":{"s":"About"}},{"k":"about_aria","v":{"s":"Open about modal"}},{"k":"clear_stickers","v":{"s":"Clear Stickers"}},{"k":"student_tools_open","v":{"s":"Open Student Tools"}},{"k":"student_tools_close","v":{"s":"Close Student Tools"}},{"k":"dictation_toggle","v":{"s":"Toggle Voice Input"}},{"k":"dictation_start","v":{"s":"Start Voice Input"}},{"k":"dictation_stop","v":{"s":"Stop Voice Input"}},{"k":"rerun_wizard","v":{"s":"Re-run Setup Wizard"}},{"k":"rerun_wizard_aria","v":{"s":"Re-run the QuickStart setup wizard"}},{"k":"setup_options","v":{"s":"Setup and Guided Mode"}},{"k":"setup_options_aria","v":{"s":"Open setup and Guided Mode options"}},{"k":"setup_options_title","v":{"s":"Choose a setup path"}},{"k":"setup_options_desc","v":{"s":"Restart the setup wizard or turn on Guided Mode for step-by-step lesson building."}},{"k":"quickstart_setup_desc","v":{"s":"Set grade, source material, standards, languages, and personalization."}},{"k":"guided_mode_setup_desc","v":{"s":"Highlight one tool at a time and build a resource pack with prompts, examples, and progress checks."}},{"k":"guided_mode_resume","v":{"s":"Resume Guided Mode"}},{"k":"guided_mode_resume_desc","v":{"s":"Continue your lesson from your saved step."}},{"k":"guided_mode_start_over","v":{"s":"Restart Guided Mode from step 1"}},{"k":"back_to_start","v":{"s":"Back to Start"}},{"k":"back_to_start_desc","v":{"s":"Choose another pathway from the Start page. Your current workspace stays saved."}},{"k":"start_setup","v":{"s":"Start & setup"}},{"k":"start_setup_aria","v":{"s":"Open Start and setup options"}},{"k":"start_setup_desc","v":{"s":"Return to Start, adjust setup, or use Guided Mode. Your current workspace stays saved."}},{"k":"start_setup_title","v":{"s":"Start & setup"}}],"id":370}},{"k":"about","v":{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"About AlloFlow v1.0"}},{"k":"tab_about","v":{"s":"About UDL"}},{"k":"tab_atlas","v":{"s":"Atlas"}},{"k":"tab_features","v":{"s":"Feature Guide"}},{"k":"tab_privacy","v":{"s":"Privacy"}},{"k":"tab_opensource","v":{"s":"Open Source"}},{"k":"atlas_title","v":{"s":"The AlloFlow Atlas"}},{"k":"atlas_intro","v":{"s":"A structured map of AlloFlow’s cataloged hubs and launch surfaces. Choose a region for its visual guide, areas, searchable entries, and source notes."}},{"k":"atlas_footer","v":{"s":"Registry-backed sections are generated from current catalogs; curated and mixed sections are labeled in the map. Counts are searchable catalog entries, not unique-tool totals. An automated freshness check flags generated-data drift."}},{"k":"privacy_title","v":{"s":"Privacy & student data"}},{"k":"privacy_intro","v":{"s":"AlloFlow is designed for privacy-conscious classroom use. Data location depends on the storage, session transport, and AI provider you choose; this map helps your school review each path."}},{"k":"privacy_footer","v":{"s":"This is a plain-language product summary, not legal advice or a compliance certification. Your institution remains responsible for its FERPA and privacy determinations, provider agreements, configuration, consent, retention, and deletion practices. Provider terms can change; review the linked current policies."}},{"k":"a11y_title","v":{"s":"Accessibility"}},{"k":"a11y_intro","v":{"s":"Accessibility isn’t a feature here — it’s the whole point. AlloFlow is designed toward WCAG 2.2 AA (a target, not a certification). Automated axe-core and IBM Equal Access checks are available in relevant interface and document workflows. The PDF pipeline can run veraPDF validation against PDF/UA-1 (ISO 14289-1); AlloFlow withholds a conformance claim unless the available checks support it."}},{"k":"a11y_footer","v":{"s":"Found a barrier? Tell us — accessibility bugs jump the queue."}},{"k":"oss_credits_title","v":{"s":"Built on open source"}},{"k":"oss_credits_intro","v":{"s":"AlloFlow is free and open source (AGPL-3.0), built on the generous work of the projects below. Thank you to their authors and communities. The projects highlighted first are ones you can explore directly inside AlloFlow."}},{"k":"oss_featured_header","v":{"s":"Learning tools we integrate"}},{"k":"oss_full_list_header","v":{"s":"Libraries and open resources we integrate"}},{"k":"oss_credits_footer","v":{"s":"Hosted AI features use the provider configured in AI settings (such as Gemini, OpenAI, Claude, or an OpenAI-compatible endpoint); those services are not bundled software. Full license texts ship with the source. Spot something we should credit or correct? Let us know."}},{"k":"approach_header","v":{"s":"The AlloFlow Approach"}},{"k":"allo_acronym_label","v":{"s":"ALLO:"}},{"k":"allo_acronym_def","v":{"s":"Adaptive Levels, Layers, & Outputs"}},{"k":"flow_acronym_label","v":{"s":"FLOW:"}},{"k":"flow_acronym_def","v":{"s":"Flexible Learning Options for Whole-Student Education"}},{"k":"what_is_udl","v":{"s":"What is UDL?"}},{"k":"udl_definition","v":{"s":"Universal Design for Learning (UDL) is a framework to improve and optimize teaching and learning for all people based on scientific insights into how humans learn."}},{"k":"how_help_header","v":{"s":"How does this tool help?"}},{"k":"how_help_desc","v":{"s":"This tool uses AI to instantly create diverse entry points for your curriculum, ensuring you address the three core principles of UDL:"}},{"k":"rep_title","v":{"s":"Representation:"}},{"k":"rep_desc","v":{"s":"Presenting information in different ways (e.g., Adapted Text, Visual Supports, Glossaries)."}},{"k":"action_title","v":{"s":"Action & Expression:"}},{"k":"action_desc","v":{"s":"Providing options for students to demonstrate what they know (e.g., Scaffolds, Quizzes)."}},{"k":"engage_title","v":{"s":"Engagement:"}},{"k":"engage_desc","v":{"s":"Tapping into interests to challenge and motivate (e.g., Interest-based analogies)."}},{"k":"ai_guide_tip","v":{"s":"Use the \"AI UDL & Alignment Guide\" button in the sidebar to chat with an expert pedagogical bot for specific strategy advice."}},{"k":"cast_link_text","v":{"s":"View Full UDL Guidelines (CAST.org)"}},{"k":"reset_wizard","v":{"s":"Reset Quick Start Wizard"}},{"k":"support_kofi","v":{"s":"Support on Ko-fi"}},{"k":"features_list","v":{"o":[{"k":"categories","v":{"o":[{"k":"creation","v":{"s":"Plan & Create"}},{"k":"activities","v":{"s":"Engage & Play"}},{"k":"assessment","v":{"s":"Assess & Support"}},{"k":"platform","v":{"s":"Manage & Adapt"}}],"id":373}},{"k":"items","v":{"a":[{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Analyze Source"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Search"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Extract reading levels, key concepts, and accuracy checks from any source text."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"blue"}}],"id":375},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Adapted Text"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"BookOpen"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Adapt text complexity from kindergarten through college, with side-by-side multilingual views."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"indigo"}}],"id":376},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Lesson Plan"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ClipboardList"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Synthesize all resources into a standard-aligned lesson plan or study guide."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"violet"}}],"id":377},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Visual Organizer"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Layout"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Generate Flow Charts, Venn Diagrams, and structured outlines."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"cyan"}}],"id":378},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Brainstorm"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Lightbulb"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Generate hands-on activity ideas and real-world connections."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"yellow"}}],"id":379},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"FAQ Generator"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"FileQuestion"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Anticipate student misconceptions with auto-generated Q&A lists."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"teal"}}],"id":380},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Interview Mode"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"History"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Chat with historical figures, fictional characters, or experts. Uncover hidden secrets."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"amber"}}],"id":381},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Adventure Mode"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"MapIcon"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Interactive 'Choose Your Own Adventure' simulation and roleplay scenarios."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"purple"}}],"id":382},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Game Arcade"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Gamepad2"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Auto-generate Bingo, Memory Match, Word Search, and Crosswords."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"pink"}}],"id":383},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Sequence Builder"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ListOrdered"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Drag-and-drop timeline activity for chronological events or process steps."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"rose"}}],"id":384},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Concept Sort"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Filter"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Categorize terms and concepts into buckets. Great for distinguishing similar ideas."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"orange"}}],"id":385},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Socratic Tutor"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"MessageCircleQuestion"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"AI guide that asks guiding questions instead of giving answers."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"fuchsia"}}],"id":386},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Exit Ticket"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"CheckSquare"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Create quizzes. Launch 'Live Quiz' mode for real-time class results."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"emerald"}}],"id":387},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Writing Scaffolds"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Quote"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Sentence starters and paragraph frames with built-in rubrics."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"orange"}}],"id":388},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Lesson Images"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ImageIcon"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"AI diagrams and illustrations. Use image editing to refine or remove text."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"purple"}}],"id":389},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Math & STEM"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Calculator"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Step-by-step solvers, graph generation, and similar practice problems."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"blue"}}],"id":390},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Standard Audit"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ShieldCheck"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Review alignment with selected educational standards and flag potential rigor gaps for educator judgment."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"slate"}}],"id":391},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Oral Fluency"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Mic"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Listen to students read aloud and calculate WCPM and accuracy."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"rose"}}],"id":392},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Teacher Dashboard"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Layout"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Track student progress, view analytics, and export gradebooks."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"indigo"}}],"id":393},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Live Sessions"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Wifi"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Host synchronized classes, run Democracy Mode voting, and manage live quizzes."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"rose"}}],"id":394},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Student Profiles"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Users"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Save differentiation settings (Language, Interests) for different groups."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"cyan"}}],"id":395},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Accessibility"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Ear"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Immersive Reader, Line Focus, Dictation, and Text-to-Speech tools."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"teal"}}],"id":396},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Export Suite"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Download"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Export to PDF, PowerPoint, Canvas QTI, HTML Bundles, or Braille (.brf)."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"blue"}}],"id":397},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Gemini Bridge"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Terminal"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Generate prompts to build custom interactive apps in Gemini Canvas."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"slate"}}],"id":398},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Smart Glossary"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"BookOpen"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Visual vocabulary cards with audio, bilingual translations, and 5 vocabulary games (crossword, bingo, memory match, word search, scramble)."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"purple"}}],"id":399},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Immersive Reader"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Ear"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Multi-mode reading support: RSVP speed reading, karaoke highlighting, bionic reading, line-focus ruler, grammar overlays."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"blue"}}],"id":400},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Word Sounds Studio"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Mic"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Phonemic awareness practice across 8 activity types — blending, segmenting, rhyming, mapping, isolation, spelling, families, sight & spell."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"amber"}}],"id":401},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"StoryForge"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Quote"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Six-phase scaffolded creative writing with AI illustrations, narration, custom rubrics, and 18-language support."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"rose"}}],"id":402},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"AlloBot"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Sparkles"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Always-available AI tutor and platform guide. Answers content questions, navigates AlloFlow, and auto-configures settings on request."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"indigo"}}],"id":403},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Escape Room"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"MapIcon"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Team-based puzzle challenges built from your lesson content. Teacher-controlled hints, timed escape tracking, multi-stage rooms."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"orange"}}],"id":404},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"SEL Hub"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Heart"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"A live social-emotional learning catalog across CASEL competencies and beyond—coping cards, restorative circles, self-advocacy rehearsal, skills practice, and more."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"rose"}}],"id":405},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"BehaviorLens"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ShieldCheck"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"FBA/BIP suite: ABC data collection, frequency/interval tracking, IOA calculator (6 methods), preference assessments, and intervention templates."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"indigo"}}],"id":406},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Report Writer"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ClipboardList"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"10-step wizard for psychoeducational reports: 17 assessment presets, fact-chunk verification, triangulated drafting, dual-pass accuracy audit."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"purple"}}],"id":407},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Dynamic Assessment"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Filter"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Vygotsky/Feuerstein/Lidz test-teach-retest probes with 4-level prompt ladders, modifiability scoring, IEP goal + accommodation generation."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"blue"}}],"id":408},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Student Analytics"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Layout"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Automated RTI Tier 1/2/3 classification with aimline monitoring, CBM probe history, anomaly flagging, class screening reports."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"emerald"}}],"id":409},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"PDF Accessibility"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Download"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Review and remediate PDF or document content with multi-pass checks, diff views, axe-core, and tagged PDF/HTML/audio export; human review remains part of the workflow."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"cyan"}}],"id":410},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Symbol Studio"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ImageIcon"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Full AAC platform: AI-generated PCS symbols, board builder, visual schedules, social stories, Symbol Quest games, Word Garden vocabulary tracking."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"fuchsia"}}],"id":411},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"STEAM Lab"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Layers"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"A live catalog of browser-based interactive tools across math, science, computing, engineering, life skills/CTE, and creative design—from DNA labs to physics sandboxes."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"teal"}}],"id":412},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"DBQ Generator"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"FileQuestion"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Document-Based Question sets for source analysis — DOK-tiered prompts with sourcing/contextualization/corroboration scaffolds + rubric."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"amber"}}],"id":413},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Note Taking Templates"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ListOrdered"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Cornell notes, two-column compare/contrast, sketchnote prompts, mindmaps, and summary scaffolds — pre-filled or blank."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"blue"}}],"id":414},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Anchor Charts"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Layout"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Printable classroom-poster anchor charts with iconography, color-coded sections, AI imagery, and differentiated complexity levels."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"rose"}}],"id":415},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Annotation Suite"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Quote"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Overlay annotations on any AlloFlow resource — highlights, sticky notes, voice notes, drawings — with color-coded layers and exportable PDFs."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"purple"}}],"id":416},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Reading Library"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"BookOpen"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Hundreds of openly licensed leveled picture books (StoryWeaver) across dozens of languages — read in-app with the Immersive Reader, translate, and use as oral-reading-fluency passages."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"cyan"}}],"id":417},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Document Hub"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Layout"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Build and refine differentiated documents in a WYSIWYG editor, then run the pipeline to remediate and export — the home for accessible document creation."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"creation"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"blue"}}],"id":418},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Memory Palace"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"MapIcon"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"3D spatial-memory tool — place facts along a walkable route, then recall them, with spaced repetition, WebXR/VR, and decoration modes."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"violet"}}],"id":419},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Whiteboard"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ImageIcon"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Private, device-local infinite whiteboard (Excalidraw) for sketching diagrams, brainstorming, and hand-drawn explanations."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"activities"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"blue"}}],"id":420},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Accessibility Lab"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ShieldCheck"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Review the student experience with preview-as-student, keyboard-only tours, screen-reader labels, axe-core checks, and disability simulators."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"assessment"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"emerald"}}],"id":421},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Research Hub"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Search"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Guided inquiry across three lanes — Scientific Inquiry, Engineering Design (Constraint Forge), and Humanities (Inquiry Studio) — with lateral source evaluation and claim-evidence-warrant scaffolds."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"indigo"}}],"id":422},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Video Studio"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ImageIcon"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Turn a lesson or document into narrated video — screen recording, AI narration, and multi-scene composition."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"rose"}}],"id":423},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Page Designer"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Sparkles"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Visual editor for flyers, worksheets, posters, and slide decks — AI drafts on request, every export born-accessible, PowerPoint in and out."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"fuchsia"}}],"id":424},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Guided Mode"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"ListOrdered"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"“Help me build a lesson” — a step-by-step co-author that walks you through creating a full differentiated lesson pack."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"amber"}}],"id":425},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Community Catalog"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Users"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"Browse and share teacher-made lesson packs and tools with the AlloFlow community."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"green"}}],"id":426},{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Professional Development"}},{"k":"icon","v":{"s":"Lightbulb"}},{"k":"desc","v":{"s":"In-app professional learning — short modules on UDL, differentiation, and getting the most out of AlloFlow’s tools."}},{"k":"category","v":{"s":"platform"}},{"k":"color","v":{"s":"purple"}}],"id":427}],"id":374}}],"id":372}},{"k":"media_guardrails_intro","v":{"s":"Video Studio can track stock/open media credits in each project. We do not treat every free-stock site as open source: each asset needs its own license, source URL, and attribution record before sharing."}},{"k":"media_guardrails_title","v":{"s":"Open/free media guardrails"}}],"id":371}},{"k":"fluency","v":{"o":[{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Oral Fluency Check"}},{"k":"instruction","v":{"s":"Read the text aloud to test accuracy."}},{"k":"accuracy_score","v":{"s":"Accuracy Score"}},{"k":"hearing_label","v":{"s":"Hearing:"}},{"k":"listening","v":{"s":"Listening..."}},{"k":"processing","v":{"s":"Analyzing..."}},{"k":"complete","v":{"s":"Analysis Complete"}},{"k":"prompt","v":{"s":"Tap or Press Space to Record"}},{"k":"try_again","v":{"s":"Try Again"}},{"k":"analysis_key","v":{"s":"Analysis Key"}},{"k":"legend_word","v":{"s":"Word"}},{"k":"legend_correct","v":{"s":"Correct"}},{"k":"legend_hesitation","v":{"s":"Hesitation / Self-Correction"}},{"k":"legend_missed","v":{"s":"Missed / Mispronounced"}},{"k":"tool_label","v":{"s":"Oral Fluency Check Tool"}},{"k":"reset_label","v":{"s":"Reset and Try Again"}},{"k":"close_label","v":{"s":"Close Fluency Tool"}},{"k":"stop_recording","v":{"s":"Stop Recording"}},{"k":"start_recording","v":{"s":"Start Recording"}},{"k":"rate_label","v":{"s":"Rate"}},{"k":"wcpm_label","v":{"s":"WCPM"}},{"k":"format_error","v":{"s":"Content format not supported for fluency check. Use Adapted Text."}},{"k":"time_limit","v":{"s":"Time Limit"}},{"k":"time_limit_none","v":{"s":"None"}},{"k":"time_limit_seconds","v":{"s":"{seconds} sec"}},{"k":"time_remaining","v":{"s":"Time Remaining"}},{"k":"time_expired","v":{"s":"Time Expired!"}},{"k":"running_record","v":{"s":"Running Record"}},{"k":"substitutions","v":{"s":"Substitutions"}},{"k":"omissions","v":{"s":"Omissions"}},{"k":"insertions_label","v":{"s":"Insertions"}},{"k":"self_corrections","v":{"s":"Self-Corrections"}},{"k":"error_rate","v":{"s