ngine_is_still_loading","v":{"s":"The inspection engine is still loading."}},{"k":"sr_conservative_local_repair_is_available_for_an_imp","v":{"s":"Conservative local repair is available for an imported STL."}},{"k":"sr_the_conservative_repair_candidate_is_now_the_loca","v":{"s":"The conservative repair candidate is now the local working copy. Its analysis remains advisory."}},{"k":"sr_the_repaired_candidate_hash_could_not_be_calculat","v":{"s":"The repaired candidate hash could not be calculated."}},{"k":"sr_downloaded_the_conservative_repair_candidate_it_i","v":{"s":"Downloaded the conservative repair candidate. It is not certified watertight or ready to print."}},{"k":"sr_the_local_inspection_engine_is_still_loading","v":{"s":"The local inspection engine is still loading."}},{"k":"sr_import_inspected_locally_confirm_scale_and_review","v":{"s":"Import inspected locally. Confirm scale and review Preflight before submitting."}},{"k":"sr_the_local_metadata_reader_is_still_loading","v":{"s":"The local metadata reader is still loading."}},{"k":"sr_reading_allowlisted_g_code_comments_locally_toolp","v":{"s":"Reading allowlisted G-code comments locally. Toolpath commands will not be interpreted."}},{"k":"sr_slicer_comment_metadata_imported_locally_no_g_cod","v":{"s":"Slicer comment metadata imported locally. No G-code command was stored or executed."}},{"k":"sr_ai_assistance_is_not_configured_manual_primitive","v":{"s":"AI assistance is not configured. Manual primitive tools remain available."}},{"k":"sr_describe_what_you_want_the_modeling_assistant_to","v":{"s":"Describe what you want the modeling assistant to do."}},{"k":"sr_ai_assisted_recipe_ready_review_every_part_and_ru","v":{"s":"AI-assisted recipe ready. Review every part and run Preflight."}},{"k":"sr_complete_model_analysis_before_creating_a_job_tic","v":{"s":"Complete model analysis before creating a job ticket."}},{"k":"sr_import_comment_metadata_from_the_approved_school","v":{"s":"Import comment metadata from the approved school slicer for this exact model, scale, material, and printer profile before creating a job ticket."}},{"k":"sr_the_reviewed_slicer_handoff_must_include_a_positi","v":{"s":"The reviewed slicer handoff must include a positive material mass in grams before creating a job ticket."}},{"k":"sr_confirm_the_reviewed_material_and_printer_profile","v":{"s":"Confirm the reviewed material and printer profile first."}},{"k":"sr_created_a_privacy_minimized_local_job_ticket_it_c","v":{"s":"Created a privacy-minimized local job ticket. It contains no G-code commands and does not authorize printing."}},{"k":"sr_downloaded_the_versioned_job_ticket_for_staff_rev","v":{"s":"Downloaded the versioned job ticket for staff review."}},{"k":"sr_create_a_reviewed_job_ticket_before_using_the_sim","v":{"s":"Create a reviewed job ticket before using the simulator."}},{"k":"sr_queued_a_simulation_only_job_no_printer_was_conta","v":{"s":"Queued a simulation-only job. No printer was contacted."}},{"k":"sr_advanced_simulated_telemetry_only_no_physical_act","v":{"s":"Advanced simulated telemetry only. No physical action occurred."}},{"k":"sr_create_a_job_ticket_before_planning_capacity","v":{"s":"Create a job ticket before planning capacity."}},{"k":"sr_planned_a_deterministic_three_copy_example_across","v":{"s":"Planned a deterministic three-copy example across two simulated printers."}},{"k":"sr_the_handoff_engine_is_still_loading","v":{"s":"The handoff engine is still loading."}},{"k":"sr_resolve_blocking_preflight_items_before_creating","v":{"s":"Resolve blocking preflight items before creating a handoff."}},{"k":"sr_downloaded_a_privacy_minimized_staff_review_hando","v":{"s":"Downloaded a privacy-minimized staff-review handoff. The model file itself was not embedded."}},{"k":"sr_run_preflight_and_resolve_blocking_items_before_e","v":{"s":"Run preflight and resolve blocking items before exporting STL."}},{"k":"sr_stl_exported_re_open_it_in_the_school_s_slicer_to","v":{"s":"STL e