You don’t need a lawyer to file an ADA Title II / III complaint. Department of Justice (ada.gov), Section 508 (section508.gov), and state AG offices all accept civilian complaints — and inaccessible gov sites are illegal."}},{"k":"history_your_audit_trail","v":{"s":"History — your audit trail"}},{"k":"past_audits_saved_here_so_you_can_trac","v":{"s":"Past audits saved here so you can track which sites improved (or regressed) over time. Aggregate metrics let you make a sharable case to school IT or a vendor."}},{"k":"badges_audit_milestones","v":{"s":"Badges — audit milestones"}},{"k":"first_audit_5_audits_10_audits_critica","v":{"s":"First Audit, 5 Audits, 10 Audits, Critical Issue Hunter, POUR Master, etc. Recognition for the unglamorous work of catching issues *before* they reach disabled users."}},{"k":"what_would_you_like_to_audit","v":{"s":"What would you like to audit?"}},{"k":"website","v":{"s":"Website"}},{"k":"screenshot","v":{"s":"Screenshot"}},{"k":"social_media","v":{"s":"Social Media"}},{"k":"website_url","v":{"s":"Website URL"}},{"k":"website_url_to_audit","v":{"s":"Website URL to audit"}},{"k":"the_ai_will_analyze_the_website_s_acce","v":{"s":"The AI will analyze the website’s accessibility based on its known structure and common patterns."}},{"k":"paste_html_code","v":{"s":"Paste HTML Code"}},{"k":"html_head_title_my_page_title_head_bod","v":{"s":"<html>\n  <head><title>My Page</title></head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Hello World</h1>\n    <img src=\"photo.jpg\">\n  </body>\n</html>"}},{"k":"html_code_to_audit","v":{"s":"HTML code to audit"}},{"k":"paste_any_html_code_from_a_school_proj","v":{"s":"Paste any HTML code — from a school project, a webpage, or generated by a coding tool. The AI will check it for accessibility issues."}},{"k":"upload_a_pdf_document_to_check_its_acc","v":{"s":"Upload a PDF document to check its accessibility"}},{"k":"the_ai_will_check_for_tagged_structure","v":{"s":"The AI will check for: tagged structure, reading order, alt text 