_actual","v":{"s":"When is AI doing 90% of the work actually the right call? (Hint: error cost low, novelty low, time-pressured production.)"}},{"k":"how_would_you_design_a_class_where_ai_","v":{"s":"How would you design a class where AI is allowed but doesn't short-circuit learning?"}},{"k":"i_can_explain_why_this_ai_effort_novel","v":{"s":"I can explain why this AI/effort/novelty/cost combo yields this state."}},{"k":"explain_in_your_own_words","v":{"s":"Explain in your own words..."}},{"k":"inquiry_widget_no_score_no_reveal_no_a","v":{"s":"Inquiry widget — no score, no reveal, no answer dump. \"Learning gain\" is a heuristic; real measures need pre/post assessment, transfer tasks, retention checks. AI assist effects vary by domain (creative vs technical vs reflective)."}},{"k":"loadout","v":{"s":"Loadout"}},{"k":"choose_your_spells","v":{"s":"Choose your spells"}},{"k":"equip_up_to_3_spells_you_can_only_cast","v":{"s":"Equip up to 3 spells. You can only cast equipped spells on this Expedition."}},{"k":"choose_your_challenge_level","v":{"s":"Choose your challenge level"}},{"k":"challenge_level","v":{"s":"⚙️ Challenge level"}},{"k":"pick_what_fits_today_you_can_change_th","v":{"s":"Pick what fits today. You can change this any expedition. Harder difficulty = bigger essence reward."}},{"k":"loadout_presets","v":{"s":"Loadout presets"}},{"k":"save_current","v":{"s":"+ Save current"}},{"k":"no_presets_yet_build_a_loadout_you_lik","v":{"s":"No presets yet. Build a loadout you like and click \"Save current\" to keep it for next time."}},{"k":"ai_question_banks","v":{"s":"AI question banks"}},{"k":"infinite_question_bank","v":{"s":"✨ Infinite Question Bank"}},{"k":"static_questions_never_run_out_gemini_","v":{"s":"Static questions never run out — Gemini generates fresh ones on top."}},{"k":"ai_generated_questions_can_be_wrong_ev","v":{"s":"⚠️ AI-generated questions can be wrong (even the marked answer) — if one looks off, tell your teacher."}},{"k":"pre_load","v":{"s":"✨