"v":{"s":"Aquarium Lab — keep a closed ecosystem alive"}},{"k":"ph_ammonia_nitrite_nitrate_the_nitroge","v":{"s":"pH, ammonia, nitrite, nitrate — the nitrogen cycle is the entire game. Bacteria on filter media convert toxic NH₃ → NO₂⁻ → NO₃⁻. Cycle a tank for 4-6 weeks BEFORE adding fish; the bacteria need time."}},{"k":"ocean_ecology_the_planet_s_biggest_bio","v":{"s":"Ocean Ecology — the planet’s biggest biome"}},{"k":"oceans_cover_71_of_earth_hold_97_of_wa","v":{"s":"Oceans cover 71% of Earth, hold 97% of water, produce ~50% of atmospheric O₂ (phytoplankton). Acidification (CO₂ + H₂O → H₂CO₃) has dropped surface pH 0.1 since 1900 — 30% more acidic in chemistry terms."}},{"k":"marine_science_careers_research_method","v":{"s":"Marine Science — careers + research methods"}},{"k":"marine_biology_oceanography_fisheries_","v":{"s":"Marine biology, oceanography, fisheries, conservation. CTD profilers measure conductivity/temperature/depth. Acoustic surveys count whales by song. Tagging studies follow sharks across oceans — most science you’ll never see."}},{"k":"learn_long_form_curriculum","v":{"s":"Learn — long-form curriculum"}},{"k":"deep_dive_articles_on_cycling_water_ch","v":{"s":"Deep-dive articles on cycling, water chemistry, plants, breeding, saltwater, biotopes, disease, and aquascaping. Pick a topic from the sidebar; read at your pace."}},{"k":"quiz_lab_50_question_test_bank","v":{"s":"Quiz Lab — 50-question test bank"}},{"k":"multiple_choice_across_chemistry_cycli","v":{"s":"Multiple choice across chemistry, cycling, stocking, plants, equipment, health, saltwater, marine biology, and conservation. Filter by category, retry, build a score."}},{"k":"water_chemistry_simulator","v":{"s":"Water Chemistry Simulator"}},{"k":"adjust_ph_kh_gh_tds_do_temp_co_sliders","v":{"s":"Adjust pH / KH / GH / TDS / DO / temp / CO₂ sliders and see live diagnosis. Load scenarios (new tank, old tank, planted, reef, overstocked) to inspect parameters and recommended actions."}},{"k":