ts or water changes."}},{"k":"real_world_this_takes_4_6_weeks_to_est","v":{"s":"Real-world: this takes 4-6 weeks to establish from scratch. In this sim the bacteria are pre-seeded so you can play, but you still have to "}},{"k":"not_overwhelm_them","v":{"s":"not overwhelm them"}},{"k":"your_key_actions","v":{"s":"🛠 Your key actions"}},{"k":"fish_need_food_but_extra_food_becomes_","v":{"s":": fish need food, but extra food becomes ammonia. Feed about once per day."}},{"k":"25_water_change","v":{"s":"25% water change"}},{"k":"dilutes_ammonia_nitrate_by_50_in_one_m","v":{"s":": dilutes ammonia + nitrate by ~50% in one move. Use when chemistry trends red."}},{"k":"plants","v":{"s":"Plants"}},{"k":"absorb_nitrate_and_produce_oxygen_by_d","v":{"s":": absorb nitrate and produce oxygen by day. Bioload check: don't stock more fish than the bar allows."}},{"k":"speed_control","v":{"s":"Speed control"}},{"k":"pause_to_read_run_1_5_to_watch_the_cyc","v":{"s":": pause to read, run 1×-5× to watch the cycle unfold. Days advance every tick."}},{"k":"tip_click_any_chemistry_card_below_for","v":{"s":"Tip: click any chemistry card below for its safe range + 'what to do' guide. The cards turn amber or red when a value drifts out of the safe zone."}},{"k":"back","v":{"s":"Back"}},{"k":"back_2","v":{"s":"← Back"}},{"k":"speed","v":{"s":"⏱ Speed:"}},{"k":"pause","v":{"s":"Pause"}},{"k":"normal_2s_tick","v":{"s":"Normal (2s/tick)"}},{"k":"fast_1s_tick","v":{"s":"Fast (1s/tick)"}},{"k":"turbo_0_4s_tick","v":{"s":"Turbo (0.4s/tick)"}},{"k":"light_2","v":{"s":"💡 Light:"}},{"k":"day","v":{"s":"☀️ Day"}},{"k":"moonlight","v":{"s":"🔵 Moonlight"}},{"k":"night","v":{"s":"🌙 Night"}},{"k":"water_chemistry","v":{"s":"🧪 Water Chemistry"}},{"k":"tap_any_card_for_details","v":{"s":"Tap any card for details"}},{"k":"temp","v":{"s":"Temp"}},{"k":"salt","v":{"s":"Salt"}},{"k":"what_is_it","v":{"s":"📖 What is it?"}},{"k":"safe_range","v":{"s":"✅ Safe Range"}},{"k":"why_it_s_dangerous","v":{"s":"⚠️ Why It's Dangerous"}},{"k":"current_math","v":{"s":"🧮 Current Math"}},{"k":"how_to_fix","v":{"s":"💡 How to Fix"}},{"k":"nitrosomonas_2","v":{"s":"Nitrosomonas"}},{"k":"nitrobacter_2","v":{"s":"Nitrobacter"}},{"k":"nitrogen_cycle","v":{"s":"(Nitrogen Cycle)"}},{"k":"no_plants_yet_add_some_to_boost_o_and_","v":{"s":"🌾 No plants yet — add some to boost O₂ and absorb nitrates!"}},{"k":"remove_plant","v":{"s":"Remove plant"}},{"k":"remove_plant_2","v":{"s":"Remove plant"}},{"k":"add_a_plant","v":{"s":"➕ Add a Plant:"}},{"k":"ecosystem_tip","v":{"s":"Ecosystem Tip: "}},{"k":"plants_produce_o_during_the_day_via_ph","v":{"s":"Plants produce O₂ during the day via photosynthesis but consume it at night. Balance fish load with plant biomass to keep dissolved oxygen stable. Too many nutrients without enough plants can trigger algae blooms!"}},{"k":"breeding_status","v":{"s":"💞 Breeding Status"}},{"k":"breeding_tip","v":{"s":"Breeding Tip: "}},{"k":"keep_water_clean_stress_low_and_fish_w","v":{"s":"Keep water clean, stress low, and fish well-fed. Plants provide hiding spots for fry, boosting survival. Predators in the tank will eat vulnerable fry!"}},{"k":"bioload","v":{"s":"Bioload"}},{"k":"add_fish","v":{"s":"➕ Add Fish"}},{"k":"add_fish_2","v":{"s":"Add Fish"}},{"k":"click_to_remove","v":{"s":"Click to remove"}},{"k":"toggle_aquarium_simulation","v":{"s":"Toggle aquarium simulation"}},{"k":"water","v":{"s":"Water"}},{"k":"water_2","v":{"s":"💧 Water"}},{"k":"flake","v":{"s":"Flake"}},{"k":"flake_2","v":{"s":"🍽️ Flake"}},{"k":"live","v":{"s":"Live"}},{"k":"live_2","v":{"s":"🦐 Live"}},{"k":"toggle_lights","v":{"s":"Toggle Lights"}},{"k":"medicate_fish","v":{"s":"Medicate Fish"}},{"k":"clean_glass","v":{"s":"Clean Glass"}},{"k":"feeding_report","v":{"s":"Feeding Report"}},{"k":"fish_fed","v":{"s":"Fish Fed"}},{"k":"hunger","v":{"s":"Hunger ↓"}},{"k":"nh","v":{"s":"NH₃ ↑"}},{"k":"tank_health","v":{"s":"Tank Health"}},{"k":"fish_hunger_status","v":{"s":"🍽️ Fish Hunger Status"}},{"k":"what_do_you_do","v":{"s":"⚖️ What do you do?"}},{"k":"resolve_a_i_event","v":{"s":"Resolve A I Event"}},{"k":"ai_is_analyzing_your_tank_conditions","v":{"s":"🤖 AI is analyzing your tank conditions..."}},{"k":"how_fisheries_management_works_click_t","v":{"s":"📜 How fisheries management works (click to toggle)"}},{"k":"what_you_re_doing","v":{"s":"🎯 What you're doing"}},{"k":"you_re_a_fisheries_manager_each_year_y","v":{"s":"You're a fisheries manager. Each year you set policy: how much to harvest, how much ocean to protect, what mesh size to require. Three species (sardines, tuna, sharks) grow on logistic curves and prey on each other. Push too hard and the population crashes; harvest too little and fishers leave town. Find the balance."}},{"k":"the_four_control_knobs","v":{"s":"🐟 The four control knobs"}},{"k":"harvest_rate","v":{"s":"Harvest rate"}},{"k":"of_population_you_fish_each_year_above","v":{"s":": % of population you fish each year. Above 50% = red zone, collapse risk."}},{"k":"marine_protected_area_mpa","v":{"s":"Marine Protected Area (MPA) %"}},{"k":"fraction_of_the_ocean_closed_to_fishin","v":{"s":": fraction of the ocean closed to fishing. Acts as a population reservoir; high MPAs prevent collapse."}},{"k":"mesh_size","v":{"s":"Mesh size"}},{"k":"small_mesh_catches_juveniles_bycatch_l","v":{"s":": small mesh catches juveniles + bycatch; large mesh only catches mature fish. Larger = more sustainable, fewer non-target species caught."}},{"k":"season","v":{"s":"Season"}},{"k":"open_closed_closed_seasons_let_breeder","v":{"s":": Open / Closed. Closed seasons let breeders spawn before harvest resumes."}},{"k":"collapse_the_failure_mode","v":{"s":"📉 Collapse: the failure mode"}},{"k":"when_a_species_drops_below_10_of_its_c","v":{"s":"When a species drops below 10% of its carrying capacity (K), it has collapsed. Real-world example: Atlantic cod (1992 Newfoundland) collapsed from over-fishing and hasn't recovered 30+ years later. Sharks below 10% of K is also catastrophic because they're the top predator, and removing them cascades down the food web."}},{"k":"tip_try_free_play_first_to_see_how_the","v":{"s":"Tip: try Free Play first to see how the populations move year over year. Then take a scenario (Feed the Town, Recovery Plan, Balanced Eco) for a target."}},{"k":"feed_the_town","v":{"s":"🏆 Feed the Town"}},{"k":"sustain_a_productive_harvest_for_10_ye","v":{"s":"Sustain a productive harvest for 10 years without any species collapsing."}},{"k":"recovery_plan","v":{"s":"🛠 Recovery Plan"}},{"k":"stocks_have_collapsed_rebuild_sharks_b","v":{"s":"Stocks have collapsed. Rebuild sharks back to at least 50 individuals."}},{"k":"balanced_eco","v":{"s":"⚖ Balanced Eco"}},{"k":"keep_all_three_species_above_50_of_the","v":{"s":"Keep ALL THREE species above 50% of their carrying capacity."}},{"k":"free_play","v":{"s":"🌊 Free Play"}},{"k":"experiment_freely_no_win_condition","v":{"s":"Experiment freely. No win condition."}},{"k":"free_play_2","v":{"s":"🌊 Free Play"}},{"k":"manage_fisheries_freely","v":{"s":"Manage fisheries freely"}},{"k":"feed_the_town_2","v":{"s":"🏆 Feed the Town"}},{"k":"sustain_harvest_for_10_years","v":{"s":"Sustain harvest for 10 years"}},{"k":"recovery_plan_2","v":{"s":"🛠️ Recovery Plan"}},{"k":"rebuild_collapsed_stocks","v":{"s":"Rebuild collapsed stocks"}},{"k":"balanced_eco_2","v":{"s":"⚖️ Balanced Eco"}},{"k":"keep_all_species_above_50","v":{"s":"Keep all species above 50"}},{"k":"population_history","v":{"s":"📈 Population History"}},{"k":"sardines_2","v":{"s":"● Sardines"}},{"k":"tuna_2","v":{"s":"● Tuna"}},{"k":"sharks_2","v":{"s":"● Sharks"}},{"k":"k_carrying_capacity","v":{"s":"- - K = Carrying Capacity"}},{"k":"fishery_controls","v":{"s":"⚙️ Fishery Controls"}},{"k":"harvest_rate_2","v":{"s":"🎣 Harvest Rate"}},{"k":"marine_protected_area","v":{"s":"🏝️ Marine Protected Area"}},{"k":"mesh_size_2","v":{"s":"🩺 Mesh Size"}},{"k":"season_2","v":{"s":"📅 Season"}},{"k":"year","v":{"s":"Year"}},{"k":"revenue","v":