"}},{"k":"process_lineage_help","v":{"s":"Each indentation shows where an idea branched. Compare a variation with its parent to isolate what changed."}},{"k":"process_shelf_title","v":{"s":"Process Shelf"}},{"k":"process_recover_title","v":{"s":"Recover archived studies"}},{"k":"process_review_title","v":{"s":"See how the idea changed"}},{"k":"process_empty_title","v":{"s":"Save the work between decisions"}},{"k":"process_archive_help","v":{"s":"Archived work stays intact until you choose to restore it."}},{"k":"process_review_help","v":{"s":"Compare checkpoints, fork a setup, and notice what you carried forward."}},{"k":"process_empty_help","v":{"s":"Save a study from any lab. A small preview and the editable setup will appear here."}},{"k":"process_close_label","v":{"s":"Close Process Shelf"}},{"k":"process_close","v":{"s":"Close"}},{"k":"process_undo_archive","v":{"s":"Undo archive"}},{"k":"process_scope_label","v":{"s":"Choose which Art Studio studies to show"}},{"k":"process_no_archived","v":{"s":"No archived studies."}},{"k":"process_no_view_studies","v":{"s":"No studies are in this view yet."}},{"k":"process_first_study","v":{"s":"Your first study will become a checkpoint."}},{"k":"process_archive_empty_help","v":{"s":"Archive an active study when you want to clear space without losing it."}},{"k":"process_choose_view_help","v":{"s":"Choose another view above, or save a new checkpoint for this project."}},{"k":"process_save_first_help","v":{"s":"Close this shelf, make one deliberate change, then choose Save study."}},{"k":"process_studies_label","v":{"s":"Saved Art Studio studies in the selected view"}},{"k":"process_reflection_change","v":{"s":"Change"}},{"k":"process_reflection_wonder","v":{"s":"Wonder"}},{"k":"process_reflection_keep","v":{"s":"Keep"}},{"k":"process_preview_missing","v":{"s":"Visual preview unavailable — the saved setup is still here."}},{"k":"process_keep_default","v":{"s":"A decision worth carrying forward."}},{"k":"process_change_default","v":{"s":"A decision to revise next."}},{"k":"process_wonder_default","v":{"s":"A question to keep exploring."}},{"k":"process_restore_button","v":{"s":"Restore to shelf"}},{"k":"process_fork_button","v":{"s":"Fork variation"}},{"k":"process_archive_button","v":{"s":"Archive study"}},{"k":"process_comparison_title","v":{"s":"Branch comparison"}},{"k":"process_comparison_prompt","v":{"s":"What stayed consistent? What became clearer? Which decision better serves your intention?"}},{"k":"process_finish_thread","v":{"s":"✓ Finish thread"}},{"k":"guide_simple_artistExplorer_try","v":{"s":"Choose one artist. Find a color, shape, or material they use."}},{"k":"guide_simple_artistExplorer_notice","v":{"s":"How does that choice help tell a story?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_artistExplorer_stretch","v":{"s":"Use a related idea to make something of your own."}},{"k":"guide_simple_artistExplorer_term","v":{"s":"Artistic choice"}},{"k":"guide_simple_artistExplorer_definition","v":{"s":"A decision about color, shape, material, or meaning."}},{"k":"guide_simple_colorWheel_try","v":{"s":"Pick a color. Make a bright version and a dull version."}},{"k":"guide_simple_colorWheel_notice","v":{"s":"What changes when you move lightness?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_colorWheel_stretch","v":{"s":"Choose one color to stand out."}},{"k":"guide_simple_colorWheel_term","v":{"s":"Hue"}},{"k":"guide_simple_colorWheel_definition","v":{"s":"The color family, such as red, green, or blue."}},{"k":"guide_simple_mixer_try","v":{"s":"Choose two colors. Try mixing them as paint and as light."}},{"k":"guide_simple_mixer_notice","v":{"s":"Do both mixtures look the same?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_mixer_stretch","v":{"s":"Guess the next mixture before changing the amounts."}},{"k":"guide_simple_mixer_term","v":{"s":"Pigment"}},{"k":"guide_simple_mixer_definition","v":{"s":"The material that gives paint its color."}},{"k":"guide_simple_watercolor_try","v":{"s":"Use one paint color. Try one wet mark and one dry mark."}},{"k":"guide_simple_watercolor_notice","v":{"s":"Watch the edges as the paint moves."}},{"k":"guide_simple_watercolor_stretch","v":{"s":"Make three marks with different amounts of water."}},{"k":"guide_simple_watercolor_term","v":{"s":"Wash"}},{"k":"guide_simple_watercolor_definition","v":{"s":"A layer of paint spread with water."}},{"k":"guide_simple_pixel_try","v":{"s":"Start with a small grid. Draw the outside shape first."}},{"k":"guide_simple_pixel_notice","v":{"s":"Which squares make the shape easy to recognize?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_pixel_stretch","v":{"s":"Use only four colors. Look at the small preview."}},{"k":"guide_simple_pixel_term","v":{"s":"Silhouette"}},{"k":"guide_simple_pixel_definition","v":{"s":"The outside shape of an object, without its inside details."}},{"k":"guide_simple_symmetry_try","v":{"s":"Draw one mark away from the center."}},{"k":"guide_simple_symmetry_notice","v":{"s":"Watch how the tool repeats your mark."}},{"k":"guide_simple_symmetry_stretch","v":{"s":"Try another symmetry mode. Compare the patterns."}},{"k":"guide_simple_symmetry_term","v":{"s":"Symmetry"}},{"k":"guide_simple_symmetry_definition","v":{"s":"A match between parts of a shape after a flip or turn."}},{"k":"guide_simple_spirograph_try","v":{"s":"Change one circle size. Keep the other settings the same."}},{"k":"guide_simple_spirograph_notice","v":{"s":"How does the loop pattern change?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_spirograph_stretch","v":{"s":"Find two settings that make similar shapes."}},{"k":"guide_simple_spirograph_term","v":{"s":"Ratio"}},{"k":"guide_simple_spirograph_definition","v":{"s":"A way to compare two amounts, such as two circle sizes."}},{"k":"guide_simple_generative_try","v":{"s":"Choose Same seed. Press +100 steps."}},{"k":"guide_simple_generative_notice","v":{"s":"Look at where the particles gather."}},{"k":"guide_simple_generative_stretch","v":{"s":"Keep the seed. Change one setting and compare at the same step."}},{"k":"guide_simple_generative_term","v":{"s":"Seed"}},{"k":"guide_simple_generative_definition","v":{"s":"A starting number that lets the tool repeat its random choices."}},{"k":"guide_simple_spinArt_try","v":{"s":"Put paint near the center, then near the edge."}},{"k":"guide_simple_spinArt_notice","v":{"s":"How does the paint spread in each place?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_spinArt_stretch","v":{"s":"Use the same colors to make a calm area and a busy area."}},{"k":"guide_simple_spinArt_term","v":{"s":"Rotation"}},{"k":"guide_simple_spinArt_definition","v":{"s":"Turning around a center point."}},{"k":"guide_simple_stringArt_try","v":{"s":"Connect every third point. Then try every fifth point."}},{"k":"guide_simple_stringArt_notice","v":{"s":"Where do the straight lines seem to make a curve?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_stringArt_stretch","v":{"s":"Compare two different patterns."}},{"k":"guide_simple_stringArt_term","v":{"s":"Curve"}},{"k":"guide_simple_stringArt_definition","v":{"s":"A line that bends instead of staying straight."}},{"k":"guide_simple_opArt_try","v":{"s":"Repeat a pattern. Change the spaces between its parts."}},{"k":"guide_simple_opArt_notice","v":{"s":"Does any part look as if it is moving?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_opArt_stretch","v":{"s":"Try softer color differences. Compare what you notice."}},{"k":"guide_simple_opArt_term","v":{"s":"Contrast"}},{"k":"guide_simple_opArt_definition","v":{"s":"A visible difference between nearby colors or shapes."}},{"k":"guide_simple_tessellation_try","v":{"s":"Repeat one tile to fill the space."}},{"k":"guide_simple_tessellation_notice","v":{"s":"Look for the shapes between the tiles."}},{"k":"guide_simple_tessellation_stretch","v":{"s":"Repeat colors in a new order."}},{"k":"guide_simple_tessellation_term","v":{"s":"Tile"}},{"k":"guide_simple_tessellation_definition","v":{"s":"One shape used again and again to make a pattern."}},{"k":"guide_simple_fractal_try","v":{"s":"Make a small change to one setting. Zoom toward an edge."}},{"k":"guide_simple_fractal_notice","v":{"s":"What details appear as you zoom?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_fractal_stretch","v":{"s":"Save two views. Find a shape they have in common."}},{"k":"guide_simple_fractal_term","v":{"s":"Scale"}},{"k":"guide_simple_fractal_definition","v":{"s":"How large or small something is shown."}},{"k":"guide_simple_gradient_try","v":{"s":"Choose three color stops. Move the middle one."}},{"k":"guide_simple_gradient_notice","v":{"s":"Which color takes up more space now?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_gradient_stretch","v":{"s":"Make one part of the blend stand out."}},{"k":"guide_simple_gradient_term","v":{"s":"Color stop"}},{"k":"guide_simple_gradient_definition","v":{"s":"A chosen color at one position in a blend."}},{"k":"guide_simple_stereogram_try","v":{"s":"Choose a simple depth shape and a repeating pattern."}},{"k":"guide_simple_stereogram_notice","v":{"s":"Look for the hidden shape, or explore the depth map."}},{"k":"guide_simple_stereogram_stretch","v":{"s":"Try a smaller depth difference. Compare both versions."}},{"k":"guide_simple_stereogram_term","v":{"s":"Depth"}},{"k":"guide_simple_stereogram_definition","v":{"s":"How near or far a part of a picture seems to be."}},{"k":"guide_simple_sculpt3d_try","v":{"s":"Put three shapes together. Turn the view."}},{"k":"guide_simple_sculpt3d_notice","v":{"s":"How does the outside shape change as you turn?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_sculpt3d_stretch","v":{"s":"Choose a different view. Adjust one shape."}},{"k":"guide_simple_sculpt3d_term","v":{"s":"Viewpoint"}},{"k":"guide_simple_sculpt3d_definition","v":{"s":"The position from which you look at something."}},{"k":"guide_simple_contrast_try","v":{"s":"Choose a text color and a background color."}},{"k":"guide_simple_contrast_notice","v":{"s":"Check the result. Change just the text color."}},{"k":"guide_simple_contrast_stretch","v":{"s":"Keep a pair that meets the target and suits your artwork."}},{"k":"guide_simple_contrast_term","v":{"s":"Contrast ratio"}},{"k":"guide_simple_contrast_definition","v":{"s":"A number comparing how light or dark two colors are."}},{"k":"guide_simple_harmonyHunt_try","v":{"s":"Compare two sound or color combinations."}},{"k":"guide_simple_harmonyHunt_notice","v":{"s":"Which parts seem to fit together?"}},{"k":"guide_simple_harmonyHunt_stretch","v":{"s":"Use one combination to inspire a visual pattern."}},{"k":"guide_simple_harmonyHunt_term","v":{"s":"Frequency"}},{"k":"guide_simple_harmonyHunt_definition","v":{"s":"How many times something repeats in one second."}},{"k":"compare_seed_unknown","v":{"s":"The seed or step was not saved for one of these studies. Save new studies to make a controlled comparison."}},{"k":"guide_wording","v":{"s":"Guide wording"}},{"k":"guide_wording_simple","v":{"s":"Simple wording"}},{"k":"guide_wording_detailed","v":{"s":"More detail"}},{"k":"guide_simple_notice_label","v":{"s":"Look for"}},{"k":"guide_simple_stretch_label","v":{"s":"Try next"}},{"k":"guide_word_to_explore","v":{"s":"Word to explore"}},{"k":"artist_search_help","v":{"s":"Accents are optional. Each search word can match anywhere in a profile."}},{"k":"artist_selected_announcement","v":{"s":"Selected {name} in Artists and Traditions Explorer"}},{"k":"process_search_label","v":{"s":"Search saved studies"}},{"k":"process_search_clear","v":{"s":"Clear study search"}},{"k":"process_search_clear_button","v":{"s":"Clear"}},{"k":"process_search_help","v":{"s":"Find titles, notes, intentions, or labs in this view."}},{"k":"process_sort_label","v":{"s":"Sort studies"}},{"k":"process_sort_project","v":{"s":"Project order"}},{"k":"process_sort_newest","v":{"s":"Newest first"}},{"k":"process_sort_oldest","v":{"s":"Oldest first"}},{"k":"process_sort_title","v":{"s":"Title A–Z"}},{"k":"process_search_results","v":{"s":"{shown} of {total} studies in {scope}"}},{"k":"process_compare_choose_second","v":{"s":"Choose one more study to compare."}},{"k":"process_compare_ready","v":{"s":"Two studies ready to compare."}},{"k":"process_compare_remove",