ndor, Wild Turkey, Eastern Bluebird. Conservation works."}},{"k":"decline","v":{"s":"⬇️ Decline: "}},{"k":"causes","v":{"s":"⚠️ Causes: "}},{"k":"action_2","v":{"s":"🎯 Action: "}},{"k":"result","v":{"s":"✓ Result: "}},{"k":"maine_21","v":{"s":"📍 Maine: "}},{"k":"wind_energy_birds_2","v":{"s":"⚡ Wind Energy + Birds"}},{"k":"menu_68","v":{"s":"← Menu"}},{"k":"wind_turbines_kill_birds_bats_climate_","v":{"s":"Wind turbines kill birds + bats. Climate change kills far more. The complex science + ethics of renewable energy + bird conservation."}},{"k":"research_3","v":{"s":"🔬 Research: "}},{"k":"maine_22","v":{"s":"📍 Maine: "}},{"k":"bird_research_technology_2","v":{"s":"🔬 Bird Research Technology"}},{"k":"menu_69","v":{"s":"← Menu"}},{"k":"10_research_methods_modern_ornithologi","v":{"s":"10 research methods modern ornithologists use to study birds. From bands to AI sound recognition to citizen science apps."}},{"k":"purpose","v":{"s":"🎯 Purpose: "}},{"k":"maine_23","v":{"s":"📍 Maine: "}},{"k":"maine_birding_events_festivals_2","v":{"s":"🎉 Maine Birding Events + Festivals"}},{"k":"menu_70","v":{"s":"← Menu"}},{"k":"10_maine_birding_events_festivals_year","v":{"s":"10 Maine birding events + festivals year-round. From Acadia Birding Festival to Christmas Bird Counts to weekly Maine Audubon walks."}},{"k":"audience","v":{"s":"👥 Audience: "}},{"k":"cost_2","v":{"s":"💰 Cost: "}},{"k":"30_common_maine_backyard_birds","v":{"s":"🏡 30 Common Maine Backyard Birds"}},{"k":"menu_71","v":{"s":"← Menu"}},{"k":"maine_s_30_most_commonly_seen_backyard","v":{"s":"Maine's 30 most-commonly-seen backyard + feeder birds. Season, visit frequency, recommended feeder + food."}},{"k":"species_5","v":{"s":"Species"}},{"k":"season_2","v":{"s":"Season"}},{"k":"visit_frequency","v":{"s":"Visit Frequency"}},{"k":"recommended_feeder","v":{"s":"Recommended Feeder"}},{"k":"maine_monthly_bird_calendar","v":{"s":"📅 Maine Monthly Bird Calendar"}},{"k":"menu_72","v":{"s":"← Menu"}},{"k":"12_months_of_maine_b