he chokka squid Loligo reynaudii"}},{"k":"a_framework_for_k_12_science_education_2","v":{"s":"A Framework for K-12 Science Education: Practices, Crosscutting Concepts, and Core Ideas"}},{"k":"a_note_on_trophic_complexity_and_commu","v":{"s":"A note on trophic complexity and community stability"}},{"k":"primary_production_required_to_sustain","v":{"s":"Primary production required to sustain global fisheries"}},{"k":"reconfigurable_infrared_camouflage_coa","v":{"s":"Reconfigurable infrared camouflage coatings from a cephalopod protein"}},{"k":"reversing_the_life_cycle_medusae_trans","v":{"s":"Reversing the life cycle: medusae transforming into polyps and cell transdifferentiation in Turritopsis nutricula"}},{"k":"bioinspired_polarization_vision_enable","v":{"s":"Bioinspired polarization vision enables underwater geolocalization"}},{"k":"the_emerging_role_of_rna_editing_in_pl","v":{"s":"The emerging role of RNA editing in plasticity"}},{"k":"a_second_site_occupied_by_octopus_tetr","v":{"s":"A second site occupied by Octopus tetricus at high densities, with notes on their ecology and behavior"}},{"k":"cuttlefish_exert_self_control_in_a_del","v":{"s":"Cuttlefish exert self-control in a delay of gratification task"}},{"k":"the_chicxulub_asteroid_impact_and_mass","v":{"s":"The Chicxulub asteroid impact and mass extinction at the Cretaceous-Paleogene boundary"}},{"k":"elevated_thermal_tolerance_in_a_deep_s","v":{"s":"Elevated thermal tolerance in a deep-sea octopus from a vent system"}},{"k":"the_vertical_lobe_of_cephalopods_an_at","v":{"s":"The vertical lobe of cephalopods: an attractive brain structure for understanding the evolution of advanced learning and memory"}},{"k":"complex_prey_handling_of_octopus_by_bo","v":{"s":"Complex prey handling of octopus by bottlenose dolphins (Tursiops aduncus)"}},{"k":"lens_crystallins_of_invertebrates_dive","v":{"s":"Lens crystallins of invertebrates: diversity and recruitment from detoxification enzymes and novel proteins"}},{"k":"cl