 "}},{"k":"the_first_is_the_x_coordinate_how_far_","v":{"s":"The first is the x-coordinate (how far horizontal from origin: right is +, left is −). The second is the y-coordinate (how far vertical: up is +, down is −)."}},{"k":"the_order_matters","v":{"s":"The order MATTERS. "}},{"k":"3_2_is_not_the_same_point_as_2_3_the_f","v":{"s":"(3, 2) is NOT the same point as (2, 3). The first number always pairs with x, the second always with y. Memory hook: \"x comes first\" alphabetically."}},{"k":"four_quadrants_four_sign_combinations","v":{"s":"Four quadrants = four sign combinations. "}},{"k":"q_i_both_positive_top_right_q_ii_x_is_","v":{"s":"Q I both positive (top-right). Q II x is negative (top-left). Q III both negative (bottom-left). Q IV y is negative (bottom-right). The roman numerals go counterclockwise from top-right."}},{"k":"reflection_flips_signs","v":{"s":"Reflection flips signs. "}},{"k":"across_the_x_axis_y_flips_across_the_y","v":{"s":"Across the x-axis: y flips. Across the y-axis: x flips. Through the origin: both flip. It is the simplest transformation in coordinate geometry."}},{"k":"chess_board_notation","v":{"s":"Chess board notation. "}},{"k":"columns_files_are_letters_a_h_rows_ran","v":{"s":"Columns (files) are letters a-h. Rows (ranks) are numbers 1-8. Every square has a letter+number coordinate. The white queen starts at d1, the black king at e8."}},{"k":"type_a_square","v":{"s":"Type a square:"}},{"k":"type_a_chess_square_like_e4","v":{"s":"Type a chess square like e4"}},{"k":"practice_mode_translate_squares_to_not","v":{"s":"🎯 Practice mode — translate squares to notation"}},{"k":"start_a_challenge","v":{"s":"▶ Start a challenge"}},{"k":"e_g_f6","v":{"s":"e.g. f6"}},{"k":"type_the_chess_notation_for_the_highli","v":{"s":"Type the chess notation for the highlighted square"}},{"k":"check","v":{"s":"✔ Check"}},{"k":"next_challenge","v":{"s":"➡ Next challenge"}},{"k":"alternates_two_directions_see_the_squa","v":{"s":"Alternates two directions: see-t