thing here — what you spotted, what to try next round. Saved for your reflection at campaign's end."}},{"k":"undo_the_last_defense_you_played","v":{"s":"Undo the last defense you played"}},{"k":"request_a_hint_for_1_budget","v":{"s":"Request a hint for 1 budget"}},{"k":"quit_this_campaign","v":{"s":"Quit this campaign"}},{"k":"mitigated","v":{"s":"🛡️ Mitigated"}},{"k":"attack_blocked_before_damage_strong_de","v":{"s":"Attack blocked before damage. Strong defense."}},{"k":"detected_alert_raised","v":{"s":"🟡 Detected (alert raised)"}},{"k":"attack_visible_containment_depends_on_","v":{"s":"Attack visible. Containment depends on response speed."}},{"k":"attack_succeeded_2","v":{"s":"🔴 Attack succeeded"}},{"k":"initial_breach_containment_slow","v":{"s":"Initial breach. Containment slow."}},{"k":"compromise_data_lost","v":{"s":"⚫ Compromise (data lost)"}},{"k":"defenses_insufficient_major_incident","v":{"s":"Defenses insufficient. Major incident."}},{"k":"hypothesis_which_is_the_strongest_defe","v":{"s":"Predict what happens when one capability becomes the weakest link."}},{"k":"explain_how_detection_response_and_tra","v":{"s":"Use evidence from at least two logged observations."}},{"k":"back_to_stem_tools","v":{"s":"Back to STEM tools"}},{"k":"back","v":{"s":"Back"}},{"k":"15_characters","v":{"s":"15+ characters (single factor)"}},{"k":"20_characters","v":{"s":"20+ characters is even stronger"}},{"k":"a_24_hour_or_else_deadline_is_designed","v":{"s":"A 24-hour \"or else\" deadline is designed to make you act before you think"}},{"k":"a_concrete_time_change_with_a_mundane_","v":{"s":"A concrete time change with a mundane reason — nothing asked of you except showing up"}},{"k":"a_new_sign_in_on_chrome_on_windows_we_","v":{"s":"A new sign-in on Chrome on Windows. We noticed a new sign-in to your Google Account. If this was you, you don't need to do anything. If not, we'll help you secure your account."}},{"k":"a_payment_page_over_plain_http_no_carr","v":{"s":"A payment page over plain HTTP — no real carrier does that"}},{"k":"a_vague_quick_favor_from_an_authority_","v":{"s":"A vague \"quick favor\" from an authority figure pressures you to comply before checking"}},{"k":"accounts_google_com_ends_at_google_com","v":{"s":"accounts.google.com ends at google.com — no extra domain glued on after it"}},{"k":"all_checks_pass_and_the_return_path_ma","v":{"s":"All checks pass and the Return-Path matches the sender exactly."}},{"k":"all_three_checks_pass_and_align_with_g","v":{"s":"All three checks pass and align with google.com — and the content asks nothing of you."}},{"k":"are_you_free_right_now_i_need_you_to_p","v":{"s":"Are you free right now? I need you to pick up some gift cards for a staff surprise. Keep this between us for now — reply as soon as you see this and I'll tell you which cards."}},{"k":"cipher_type","v":{"s":"Cipher type"}},{"k":"congratulations_player_you_qualify_for","v":{"s":"Congratulations player! You qualify for 10,000 FREE V-Bucks. Just sign in with your account name and password on our claim page and the V-Bucks will be added instantly!"}},{"k":"copied_alert_wording","v":{"s":"Copied Alert Wording"}},{"k":"deadline_pressure","v":{"s":"Deadline Pressure"}},{"k":"dmarc_fails_against_google_com_and_the","v":{"s":"DMARC fails against google.com and the Return-Path is the scammer's own domain."}},{"k":"every_authentication_check_fails_and_t","v":{"s":"Every authentication check fails and the Return-Path is a bulk-mail domain."}},{"k":"exact_real_domain","v":{"s":"Exact Real Domain"}},{"k":"expected_context","v":{"s":"Expected Context"}},{"k":"forms_office_com_is_microsoft_s_real_f","v":{"s":"forms.office.com is Microsoft's real Forms domain — automated notices from it are normal"}},{"k":"free_game_currency_is_the_most_common_","v":{"s":"Free game currency is the most common lure aimed at students — real giveaways happen inside the game, not by email"}},{"k":"free_stuff_bait","v":{"s":"Free Stuff Bait"}},{"k":"freemail_impersonation","v":{"s":"Freemail Impersonation"}},{"k":"genuine_service_domain","v":{"s":"Genuine Service Domain"}},{"k":"gift_cards_plus_secrecy","v":{"s":"Gift Cards + Secrecy"}},{"k":"header_alignment_13","v":{"s":"Header Alignment"}},{"k":"header_alignment_14","v":{"s":"Header Alignment"}},{"k":"header_alignment_15","v":{"s":"Header Alignment"}},{"k":"header_alignment_16","v":{"s":"Header Alignment"}},{"k":"header_alignment_17","v":{"s":"Header Alignment"}},{"k":"hi_team_practice_this_thursday_moves_f","v":{"s":"Hi team! Practice this Thursday moves from 3pm to 4pm because the field is being mowed. Same place, bring water. See you there! - Coach Rivera"}},{"k":"http_payment_page","v":{"s":"HTTP Payment Page"}},{"k":"https_is_not_safety","v":{"s":"HTTPS ≠ Safe"}},{"k":"https_to_known_service","v":{"s":"HTTPS To Known Service"}},{"k":"https_www_scholastic_com_is_the_real_s","v":{"s":"https://www.scholastic.com is the real site — the domain in the link matches the sender"}},{"k":"it_announces_dates_and_invites_you_to_","v":{"s":"It announces dates and invites you to browse — no account, payment, or personal info requested"}},{"k":"it_asks_you_to_sign_in_with_your_passw","v":{"s":"It asks you to \"sign in\" with your password on their page — that IS the theft"}},{"k":"known_school_sender","v":{"s":"Known School Sender"}},{"k":"learning_modes","v":{"s":"Cyber Defense learning modes"}},{"k":"lookalike_carrier_domain","v":{"s":"Lookalike Domain"}},{"k":"lookalike_game_domain","v":{"s":"Lookalike Domain"}},{"k":"micro_fee_trick","v":{"s":"Micro-Fee Trick"}},{"k":"ms_lopez_shared_the_form_science_museu","v":{"s":"Ms. Lopez shared the form \"Science Museum Field Trip - Permission\" with you. Your teacher mentioned this form in class today. Open it to fill in your parent contact details."}},{"k":"myaccount_google_com_is_google_s_genui","v":{"s":"myaccount.google.com is Google's genuine account page, reachable by typing it yourself"}},{"k":"myschool_edu_matches_your_real_school_","v":{"s":"myschool.edu matches your real school domain and the coach you know"}},{"k":"no_action_demanded","v":{"s":"No Action Demanded"}},{"k":"no_forced_action","v":{"s":"No Forced Action"}},{"k":"no_links_at_all","v":{"s":"No Links"}},{"k":"no_links_no_attachments_nothing_to_cli","v":{"s":"No links, no attachments, nothing to click — nothing to steal with"}},{"k":"official_https_link","v":{"s":"Official HTTPS Link"}},{"k":"official_org_domain","v":{"s":"Official Org Domain"}},{"k":"operation","v":{"s":"Operation"}},{"k":"packet_capture","v":{"s":"Packet capture"}},{"k":"passing_headers_trap","v":{"s":"Passing Headers Trap"}},{"k":"password_request","v":{"s":"Password Request"}},{"k":"phishing_difficulty","v":{"s":"Phishing case difficulty"}},{"k":"read_domains_right_to_left_accounts_go","v":{"s":"Read domains right-to-left: accounts.google.com.verify-session.net really belongs to verify-session.net"}},{"k":"real_destination_check","v":{"s":"Real Destination"}},{"k":"real_security_alerts_say_if_this_was_y","v":{"s":"Real security alerts say \"if this was you, do nothing\" — scams always demand action"}},{"k":"return_path_lives_on_notify_batch_04_t","v":{"s":"Return-Path lives on notify-batch-04.top — nothing to do with the postal service."}},{"k":"sample_strength","v":{"s":"Sample strength"}},{"k":"scholastic_com_is_the_company_s_real_d","v":{"s":"scholastic.com is the company's real domain, matching the Return-Path"}},{"k":"specific_expected_details","v":{"s":"Specific Details"}},{"k":"spf_dkim_and_dmarc_all_pass_for_the_re","v":{"s":"SPF, DKIM, and DMARC all pass for the real Microsoft service."}},{"k":"spf_dkim_dmarc_pass_and_the_return_pat","v":{"s":"SPF/DKIM/DMARC pass and the Return-Path matches scholastic.com."}},{"k":"spf_dkim_pass_because_gmail_really_sen","v":{"s":"SPF/DKIM pass because Gmail really sent it — authentication proves the mailbox, NOT the person. The wrong domain is the tell"}},{"k":"subdomain_disguise","v":{"s":"Subdomain Disguise"}},{"k":"the_0_30_isn_t_the_point_entering_your","v":{"s":"The $0.30 isn't the point — entering your card number is. Real carriers don't collect fees this way"}},{"k":"the_link_goes_to_the_same_official_dom","v":{"s":"The link goes to the same official domain the email came from, over HTTPS"}},{"k":"the_padlock_only_means_the_connection_","v":{"s":"The padlock only means the connection is encrypted — scammers get HTTPS certificates too"}},{"k":"the_real_company_uses_epicgames_com_no","v":{"s":"The real company uses epicgames.com, not fortnite-vbucks-free.com"}},{"k":"the_real_postal_service_is_usps_com_no","v":{"s":"The real postal service is usps.com, not usps-redelivery-center.info"}},{"k":"the_scholastic_book_fair_arrives_at_yo","v":{"s":"The Scholastic Book Fair arrives at your school October 12-16 in the library. Browse this year's catalog online, and ask your teacher about volunteer sign-ups. Happy reading!"}},{"k":"the_text_is_copied_from_real_google_al","v":{"s":"The text is copied from real Google alerts — polished wording is not proof of a real sender"}},{"k":"training_environment_active","v":{"s":"Training environment active"}},{"k":"urgent_gift_cards_and_keep_this_betwee","v":{"s":"Urgent gift cards and \"keep this between us\" is the signature move of impersonation scams"}},{"k":"vague_urgent_favor","v":{"s":"Vague Urgent Favor"}},{"k":"we_attempted_to_deliver_your_package_t","v":{"s":"We attempted to deliver your package today but no one was home. Pay a $0.30 redelivery fee within 24 hours or the package will be returned to sender."}},{"k":"we_detected_a_new_sign_in_to_your_goog","v":{"s":"We detected a new sign-in to your Google Account on a Windows device. If this wasn't you, your account may be at risk. Review your recent activity now to secure your account."}},{"k":"your_principal_writes_from_the_school_","v":{"s":"Your principal writes from the school domain. Anyone can make \"principal.smith\" at gmail.com"}},{"k":"your_teacher_announced_this_form_in_cl","v":{"s":"Your teacher announced this form in class — expected messages are far more trustworthy than surprises"}}],"id":507}},{"k":"data_plot","v":{"o":[{"k":"correct","v":{"s":"✅ Correct! "}},{"k":"it","v":{"s":"❌ It\\"}}],"id":508}},{"k":"dataLab","v":{"o":[{"k":"popup_blocked","v":{"s":"The Data Lab window was blocked. Allow pop-ups for this page, then try again."}},{"k":"opened_sr","v":{"s":"Opened the Data Lab in a new window."}},{"k":"returned_catalog_sr","v":{"s":"Returned to the STEAM Lab tools."}},{"k":"back_to_tools","v":{"s":"Back to STEAM Lab tools"}},{"k":"title","v":{"s":"📊 Data Lab — real data science, Socratic style"}},{"k":"blurb","v":{"s":"Build tables, drag out graphs, and explore real datasets in CODAP — the Concord Consortium’s open data workspace used in classrooms worldwide. An AlloFlow thinking partner sits beside it: it can see the SHAPE of your work (column names and counts — never your values) and asks you questions instead of giving answers."}},{"k":"privacy1","v":{"s":"Your data values never leave the workspace — the tutor only sees names and counts."}},{"k":"privacy2","v":{"s":"Tutor chats are not saved anywhere."}},{"k":"ai_on","v":{"s":"AI tutor is ON — it will answer through this window while it stays open."}},{"k":"ai_off","v":{"s":"AI hints are off — the Data Lab still works, with built-in thinking prompts instead of the AI tutor."}},{"k":"open_title","v":{"s":"Open the Data Lab in a new window (CODAP workspace with the AlloFlow tutor)"}},{"k":"open","v":{"s":"📊 Open Data Lab"}},{"k":"opening_note","v":{"s":"Opening Data Lab. If it does not appear, check your pop-up settings."}},{"k":"blocked_note","v":{"s":"Pop-up blocked — allow pop-ups for this page and try again."}},{"k":"open_note","v":{"s":"Data Lab is open. Keep this AlloFlow window open too — it powers the AI tutor."}},{"k":"closed_note","v":{"s":"Data Lab was closed. You can reopen it whenever you are ready."}},{"k":"credit","v":{"s":"CODAP is free and open source (MIT) from the Concord Consortium. The workspace loads from codap.concord.org, so the Data Lab needs internet; an offline School Box copy is on the roadmap."}}],"id":509}},{"k":"dataplot","v":{"o":[{"k":"a11y_local_analytical_sql_query","v":{"s":"Local analytical SQL query"}},{"k":"estimate_the_r_for_this_scatter_plot","v":{"s":"Estimate the R² for this scatter plot"}},{"k":"back","v":{"s":"Back"}},{"k":"data_plotter","v":{"s":"📊 Data Plotter"}},{"k":"set_tool_snapshots","v":{"s":"Set Tool Snapshots"}},{"k":"keyboard_shortcuts","v":{"s":"⌨️ Keyboard Shortcuts"}},{"k":"undo","v":{"s":"Undo"}},{"k":"remove_last","v":{"s":"Remove last"}},{"k":"toggle_grid","v":{"s":"Toggle grid"}},{"k":"toggle_labels","v":{"s":"Toggle labels"}},{"k":"toggle_residuals","v":{"s":"Toggle residuals"}},{"k":"toggle_outliers","v":{"s":"Toggle outliers"}},{"k":"toggle_ci_band","v":{"s":"Toggle CI band"}},{"k":"step_next","v":{"s":"Step next"}},{"k":"badges","v":{"s":"🏅 Badges"}},{"k":"stop","v":{"s":"Stop"}},{"k":"stop_2","v":{"s":"✖ Stop"}},{"k":"or_press","v":{"s":"(or press →)"}},{"k":"data_plot_sections","v":{"s":"Data Plot sections"}},{"k":"chart_pick_the_right_visualization","v":{"s":"Chart — pick the right visualization"}},{"k":"scatter_for_relationships_line_for_tim","v":{"s":"Scatter for relationships, line for time, bar for categories, histogram for distribution shape, box plot for spread + outliers, ogive for cumulative. Choosing the wrong chart type usually misleads more than it informs."}},{"k":"statistics_center_spread_shape","v":{"s":"Statistics — center, spread, shape"}},{"k":"mean_vs_median_median_wins_for_skewed_","v":{"s":"Mean vs median (median wins for skewed data), standard deviation vs IQR (IQR wins for non-normal), correlation vs causation (low correlation does NOT prove no causal link)."}},{"k":"quiz_practice_apply","v":{"s":"Quiz — practice + apply"}},{"k":"ap_stats_data_literacy_items_each_ques","v":{"s":"AP Stats / data-literacy items. Each question links back to th