ional only. Real emergencies → "}},{"k":"get_certified","v":{"s":". Get certified → "}},{"k":"recognize","v":{"s":"Recognize"}},{"k":"visual_signs_of_12_emergencies_quiz_at","v":{"s":"Visual signs of 12 emergencies. Quiz at the end."}},{"k":"call_911_988","v":{"s":"Call (911 + 988)"}},{"k":"what_to_say_text_to_911_when_988_vs_91","v":{"s":"What to say. Text-to-911. When 988 vs 911."}},{"k":"cpr_aed","v":{"s":"CPR + AED"}},{"k":"hands_only_rhythm_trainer_aed_walkthro","v":{"s":"Hands-only rhythm trainer. AED walkthrough."}},{"k":"stop_the_bleed","v":{"s":"Stop the Bleed"}},{"k":"pressure_packing_tourniquet","v":{"s":"Pressure → packing → tourniquet."}},{"k":"choking","v":{"s":"Choking"}},{"k":"infant_child_adult_pregnant_alone","v":{"s":"Infant, child, adult, pregnant, alone."}},{"k":"disability_aware_response","v":{"s":"Disability-aware response"}},{"k":"deaf_hoh_autistic_epilepsy_hidden_disa","v":{"s":"Deaf/HoH, autistic, epilepsy, hidden disability."}},{"k":"scenario_sim","v":{"s":"Scenario sim"}},{"k":"multi_step_branching_emergency_decisio","v":{"s":"Multi-step branching emergency decisions."}},{"k":"first_action_sleuth","v":{"s":"First Action Sleuth"}},{"k":"10_vignettes_pick_the_first_action_fro","v":{"s":"10 vignettes. Pick the FIRST action from 6 options (call EMS, CPR, AED, pressure, abdominal thrusts, recovery position). Builds the decision reflex."}},{"k":"ai_practice","v":{"s":"AI Practice"}},{"k":"novel_scenes_you_write_the_response_ai","v":{"s":"Novel scenes — you write the response, AI critiques."}},{"k":"responder_mastery","v":{"s":"Responder Mastery"}},{"k":"cross_attempt_log_of_every_first_actio","v":{"s":"Cross-attempt log of every First Action scenario you have nailed, plus per-action coverage."}},{"k":"resources","v":{"s":"Resources"}},{"k":"every_org_cited_in_this_tool_tap_to_ca","v":{"s":"Every org cited in this tool. Tap to call or visit."}},{"k":"first_response_lab","v":{"s":"🚑 First Response Lab"}},{"k":"pick_a_module_start_with","v":{"s":"