d, altitude, AoA — discover the stall envelope."}},{"k":"aerodynamics_lessons","v":{"s":"📚 Aerodynamics Lessons"}},{"k":"flight_challenges","v":{"s":"🏆 Flight Challenges"}},{"k":"hyperjet_geography_sprint","v":{"s":"🚀 HyperJet Geography Sprint"}},{"k":"fly_at_mach_3_on_autopilot_name_countr","v":{"s":"Fly at Mach 3 on autopilot — name countries, capitals, and cities as you zoom past! Press 1-4 to answer before you fly by."}},{"k":"back_to_menu","v":{"s":"← Back to Menu"}},{"k":"formula","v":{"s":"Formula"}},{"k":"try_it_free_flight","v":{"s":"✈️ Try It — Free Flight"}},{"k":"flight_simulator_cockpit_view_w_s_pitc","v":{"s":"Flight simulator cockpit view. W/S pitch, A/D bank, Shift/Ctrl throttle, brackets control flaps, X wheel brakes, Q quiz, F forces, Space pause, I info."}},{"k":"exit","v":{"s":"✕ Exit"}},{"k":"toggle_fullscreen_flight_view","v":{"s":"Toggle fullscreen flight view"}},{"k":"fullscreen","v":{"s":"⛶ Fullscreen"}},{"k":"on_approach","v":{"s":"🛬 On Approach"}},{"k":"dismiss_landing_tutorial","v":{"s":"Dismiss landing tutorial"}},{"k":"1_reduce_throttle","v":{"s":"1. Reduce throttle: "}},{"k":"hold","v":{"s":"Hold "}},{"k":"ctrl","v":{"s":"Ctrl"}},{"k":"to_spool_the_engine_down_to_30_speed_w","v":{"s":" to spool the engine down to ~30%. Speed will bleed off."}},{"k":"2_hold_the_glideslope","v":{"s":"2. Hold the glideslope: "}},{"k":"aim_for_a","v":{"s":"Aim for a "}},{"k":"3_descent","v":{"s":"3° descent"}},{"k":"the_papi_lights_show_2_white_2_red_whe","v":{"s":". The PAPI lights show 2 white + 2 red when you're on slope."}},{"k":"3_approach_speed","v":{"s":"3. Approach speed: "}},{"k":"keep_speed_at","v":{"s":"Keep speed at ~"}},{"k":"65_kts","v":{"s":"65 kts"}},{"k":"1_3_stall_speed_faster_float_past_runw","v":{"s":" (1.3 × stall speed). Faster = float past runway. Slower = stall."}},{"k":"4_flare","v":{"s":"4. Flare: "}},{"k":"just_above_the_runway_10_ft_gently_pul","v":{"s":"Just above the runway (~10 ft), gently pull "}},{"k":"to_raise_the_nose_target","v":{"s":" to raise the nose. Target "}},{"k":"200_fpm","v":{"s":"< 200 fpm"}},{"k":"descent_at_touchdown","v":{"s":" descent at touchdown."}},{"k":"the_science","v":{"s":"🔬 The Science"}},{"k":"energy_mv_kinetic_mgh_potential_to_des","v":{"s":"Energy = ½mv² (kinetic) + mgh (potential). To descend safely, you trade altitude for distance — letting drag bleed off speed. The flare converts forward velocity into a brief lift increase that breaks the descent rate just before the wheels touch."}},{"k":"ready_for_takeoff","v":{"s":"🛫 Ready for Takeoff"}},{"k":"dismiss_takeoff_tutorial","v":{"s":"Dismiss takeoff tutorial"}},{"k":"you_re_parked_on_the_runway_here_s_how","v":{"s":"You're parked on the runway. Here's how to get airborne:"}},{"k":"1_add_throttle","v":{"s":"1. Add throttle: "}},{"k":"hold_2","v":{"s":"Hold "}},{"k":"shift","v":{"s":"Shift"}},{"k":"to_spool_up_the_engine_to_100_watch_yo","v":{"s":" to spool up the engine to 100%. Watch your speed (kts) climb."}},{"k":"2_build_airspeed","v":{"s":"2. Build airspeed: "}},{"k":"roll_down_the_runway_don_t_pull_up_yet","v":{"s":"Roll down the runway. Don't pull up yet. Wait for "}},{"k":"3_rotate","v":{"s":"3. Rotate: "}},{"k":"press","v":{"s":"Press "}},{"k":"or_to_pitch_the_nose_up_gently_about_1","v":{"s":" (or ↑) to pitch the nose up gently — about 10°. The plane will lift off naturally."}},{"k":"4_climb","v":{"s":"4. Climb: "}},{"k":"keep_nose_up_5_10_to_maintain_a_steady","v":{"s":"Keep nose up ~5–10° to maintain a steady climb. Don't over-rotate or you'll stall."}},{"k":"the_science_2","v":{"s":"🔬 The Science"}},{"k":"lift_air_density_velocity_wing_area_c","v":{"s":"Lift = ½ × air density × velocity² × wing area × C"}},{"k":"lift_grows_with_the_square_of_speed_do","v":{"s":". Lift grows with the SQUARE of speed. Doubling airspeed = 4× the lift. At ~55 kts with a small angle of attack, your wings produce just enough lift to overcome the plane's weight (2,550 lbs for a Cessna 172)."}},{"k":"flight_debrief","v":{"s":"FLIGHT DEBRIEF"}},{"k":"flight_path","v":{"s":"🗺️ Flight Path"}},{"k":"flightsim_interactive_visualization","v":{"s":"Flightsim interactive visualization"}},{"k":"flightsim_visualization","v":{"s":"Flightsim visualization"}},{"k":"export_flight_data_csv","v":{"s":"📊 Export Flight Data (CSV)"}},{"k":"what_you_learned_this_flight","v":{"s":"💡 What You Learned This Flight"}},{"k":"you_exceeded_400_kts_at_these_speeds_c","v":{"s":"💨 You exceeded 400 kts! At these speeds, compressibility effects start to matter — air can no longer be treated as incompressible."}},{"k":"back_to_menu_2","v":{"s":"🏠 Back to Menu"}},{"k":"fly_again","v":{"s":"🛫 Fly Again"}},{"k":"the_four_forces","v":{"s":"The Four Forces"}},{"k":"aerodynamics","v":{"s":"Aerodynamics"}},{"k":"cockpit_instruments","v":{"s":"Cockpit Instruments"}},{"k":"aircraft_anatomy","v":{"s":"Aircraft Anatomy"}},{"k":"famous_aircraft","v":{"s":"Famous Aircraft"}},{"k":"aviation_pioneers","v":{"s":"Aviation Pioneers"}},{"k":"weather_flight","v":{"s":"Weather & Flight"}},{"k":"navigation","v":{"s":"Navigation"}},{"k":"pilot_training_paths","v":{"s":"Pilot Training Paths"}},{"k":"aviation_careers","v":{"s":"Aviation Careers"}},{"k":"atmosphere_altitude","v":{"s":"Atmosphere & Altitude"}},{"k":"famous_flights","v":{"s":"Famous Flights"}},{"k":"history_timeline","v":{"s":"History Timeline"}},{"k":"student_faq","v":{"s":"Student FAQ"}},{"k":"lesson_plans","v":{"s":"Lesson Plans"}},{"k":"aviation_math","v":{"s":"Aviation Math"}},{"k":"drone_deep_dive","v":{"s":"Drone Deep Dive"}},{"k":"pilot_mnemonics","v":{"s":"Pilot Mnemonics"}},{"k":"aviation_glossary","v":{"s":"Aviation Glossary"}},{"k":"inquiry_prompts","v":{"s":"Inquiry Prompts"}},{"k":"airport_types","v":{"s":"Airport Types"}},{"k":"atc_phraseology","v":{"s":"ATC Phraseology"}},{"k":"engines_deep_dive","v":{"s":"Engines Deep Dive"}},{"k":"pressurization_o2","v":{"s":"Pressurization + O2"}},{"k":"wake_turbulence","v":{"s":"Wake Turbulence"}},{"k":"runway_lighting",