has 1/4 of a pizza. Together you have more than 1/2 of a whole pizza. Why?"}},{"k":"visualize_it_1_2_1_4","v":{"s":"Visualize it: 1/2 + 1/4 = ?"}},{"k":"three_thirds","v":{"s":"Three thirds"}},{"k":"sarah_ate_1_3_of_a_pie_tom_ate_1_3_of_","v":{"s":"Sarah ate 1/3 of a pie. Tom ate 1/3 of the same pie. How much of the pie is left?"}},{"k":"the_pie_started_as_3_3_1","v":{"s":"The pie started as 3/3 = 1."}},{"k":"mystery_fraction","v":{"s":"Mystery fraction"}},{"k":"a_fraction_has_these_properties_its_nu","v":{"s":"A fraction has these properties: its numerator is 1 less than its denominator, and it equals 0.8. What fraction is it?"}},{"k":"if_the_denominator_is_d_the_numerator_","v":{"s":"If the denominator is d, the numerator is d - 1. So (d - 1) / d = 0.8."}},{"k":"shrinking_fractions","v":{"s":"Shrinking fractions"}},{"k":"i_take_1_2_of_a_cake_then_i_take_1_2_o","v":{"s":"I take 1/2 of a cake. Then I take 1/2 of what's left. Then 1/2 of what's STILL left. How much have I taken total?"}},{"k":"take_1_2_leaves_1_2_take_1_2_of_that_1","v":{"s":"Take 1/2, leaves 1/2. Take 1/2 of that = 1/4. Then 1/2 of remaining 1/4 = 1/8."}},{"k":"fraction_magic_square","v":{"s":"Fraction magic square"}},{"k":"fill_in_this_3x3_magic_square_so_each_","v":{"s":"Fill in this 3x3 magic square so each row, column, and diagonal sums to 3/2. One cell shows 1/2."}},{"k":"in_a_magic_square_the_middle_cell_equa","v":{"s":"In a magic square the middle cell equals the magic sum ÷ 3. Each row sums to 3/2."}},{"k":"half_of_half_of_half","v":{"s":"Half of half of half"}},{"k":"half_of_half_of_half_is_what_fraction","v":{"s":"Half of half of half is what fraction?"}},{"k":"1_2_1_2_1_2","v":{"s":"1/2 × 1/2 × 1/2."}},{"k":"rope_sharing","v":{"s":"Rope sharing"}},{"k":"5_friends_share_3_ropes_equally_how_mu","v":{"s":"5 friends share 3 ropes equally. How much rope does each friend get?"}},{"k":"3_divided_by_5","v":{"s":"3 divided by 5."}},{"k":"the_slow_runner","v":{"s":"The slow runner"}},{"k":"in_a_race_you_have_run_3_8_of_the_dist","v":{"s":"In a race, you have run 3/8 of the distance. Your friend has run 1/3 less than you. How much has your friend run?"}},{"k":"your_friend_ran_3_8_1_3_of_the_distanc","v":{"s":"Your friend ran 3/8 − 1/3 of the distance."}},{"k":"piecewise_problem","v":{"s":"Piecewise problem"}},{"k":"a_pizza_is_cut_into_12_slices_1_4_of_t","v":{"s":"A pizza is cut into 12 slices. 1/4 of the pizza has pepperoni. 1/3 has mushrooms. 1/6 has both. The rest has just cheese. What fraction has just cheese?"}},{"k":"inclusion_exclusion_pepperoni_mushroom","v":{"s":"Inclusion-exclusion: pepperoni + mushrooms − both = total with toppings. The rest is cheese only."}},{"k":"infinite_series","v":{"s":"Infinite series"}},{"k":"compute_1_2_1_4_1_8_1_16_1_32_continui","v":{"s":"Compute: 1/2 + 1/4 + 1/8 + 1/16 + 1/32 + ... (continuing forever)."}},{"k":"each_term_is_half_the_previous_this_is","v":{"s":"Each term is half the previous. This is a geometric series."}},{"k":"brain_teasers_2","v":{"s":"🧠 Brain teasers"}},{"k":"10_fraction_puzzles_ranging_from_easy_","v":{"s":"10 fraction puzzles ranging from easy to hard. Each has a hint and a worked solution."}},{"k":"hint","v":{"s":"💡 Hint"}},{"k":"solution","v":{"s":"🎓 Solution"}},{"k":"show_hint","v":{"s":"💡 Show hint"}},{"k":"show_solution_2","v":{"s":"🎓 Show solution"}},{"k":"help_2","v":{"s":"❓ Help"}},{"k":"quick_guide_to_using_alloflow_fraction","v":{"s":"Quick guide to using AlloFlow Fraction Lab."}},{"k":"navigation","v":{"s":"🗺 Navigation"}},{"k":"mode_tabs","v":{"s":"Mode tabs "}},{"k":"learn_practice_apply_teacher_group_rel","v":{"s":"(Learn, Practice, Apply, Teacher) group related work."}},{"k":"tab_strip","v":{"s":"Tab strip "}},{"k":"within_each_mode_lets_you_pick_specifi","v":{"s":"within each mode lets you pick specific tools."}},{"k":"header","v":{"s":"Header "}},{"k":"shows_your_score_and_streak_across_all","v":{"s":"shows your score and streak across all tabs."}},{"k":"ai_tutor","v":{"s":"AI tuto