{"k":"five_sliders_for_level_parameters_widg","v":{"s":"Five sliders for level parameters. Widget classifies overall difficulty into 5 discrete tiers and renders the difficulty progression curve. No score on your tuning — the inquiry is in finding what shapes the curve."}},{"k":"game_progress_0_100","v":{"s":"Game progress 0% → 100%"}},{"k":"difficulty","v":{"s":"Difficulty"}},{"k":"expert_2","v":{"s":"Expert"}},{"k":"medium_2","v":{"s":"Medium"}},{"k":"easy_2","v":{"s":"Easy"}},{"k":"curve_shows_difficulty_ramping_over_ga","v":{"s":"Curve shows difficulty ramping over game progress. Compare different parameter combinations."}},{"k":"log","v":{"s":"📋 Log"}},{"k":"reset","v":{"s":"↺ Reset"}},{"k":"hypothesis_free_text_no_right_answer_w","v":{"s":"Hypothesis (free text — no right answer): Which slider has the biggest effect on difficulty? Does the curve change shape, or just height?"}},{"k":"stuck_show_open_prompts_no_answers","v":{"s":"🤔 Stuck — show open prompts (no answers)"}},{"k":"open_prompts_investigate_by_manipulati","v":{"s":"Open prompts — investigate by manipulating:"}},{"k":"hold_4_sliders_steady_move_1_watch_the","v":{"s":"Hold 4 sliders steady. Move 1. Watch the curve. Repeat with each."}},{"k":"find_two_combinations_that_yield_the_s","v":{"s":"Find two combinations that yield the same tier. What do they share?"}},{"k":"what_player_friendly_design_choices_lo","v":{"s":"What player-friendly design choices (lots of coins, lots of health) compensate for high enemy count?"}},{"k":"real_games_use_difficulty_curves_that_","v":{"s":"Real games use \"difficulty curves\" that ramp slowly then plateau. Investigate why."}},{"k":"log_4_5_medium_observations_look_at_co","v":{"s":"Log 4-5 \"medium\" observations. Look at composite score — is there a single threshold?"}},{"k":"i_think_i_understand_difficulty_tuning","v":{"s":"I think I understand difficulty tuning now — let me explain it in my own words"}},{"k":"explain_in_your_own_words_how_do_the_5","v":{"s":"Explain in your own words: how do the 5 parameters jointly determine difficulty? What player-experience metric does each map to?"}},{"k":"saved_notice_nobody_checked_your_answe","v":{"s":"✓ Saved. Notice — nobody checked your answer. That is what learner-driven inquiry looks like."}},{"k":"design_note_discrete_5_tier_difficulty","v":{"s":"Design note: discrete 5-tier difficulty marker; SVG curve shows shape not score; no \"right\" tuning revealed — by design."}},{"k":"back_to_tools","v":{"s":"Back to Tools"}},{"k":"back_to_tools_2","v":{"s":"← Back to Tools"}},{"k":"gameloop_desc","v":{"s":"How every game processes a single frame"}},{"k":"leveldesign_desc","v":{"s":"Pacing, flow, and teaching through play"}},{"k":"collision_desc","v":{"s":"How games know when objects touch"}},{"k":"enemyai_desc","v":{"s":"Making enemies feel alive and challenging"}},{"k":"feedback_desc","v":{"s":"Making your game feel satisfying and responsive"}},{"k":"playtesting_desc","v":{"s":"The secret to making great games"}},{"k":"first_steps_desc","v":{"s":"Create your first playable level with a player, coins, and a goal."}},{"k":"first_steps_hint","v":{"s":"Place a Player, at least 3 Coins, and a Flag on your map. Keep it simple!"}},{"k":"maze_builder_desc","v":{"s":"Build a walled maze with walls around the border and internal walls."}},{"k":"maze_builder_hint","v":{"s":"Surround your map with walls, then add internal walls to create corridors. Don't forget a player and flag!"}},{"k":"danger_zone_desc","v":{"s":"Design a level with hazards (lava/spikes) and safe paths around them."}},{"k":"danger_zone_hint","v":{"s":"Place lava or spikes as obstacles, then make sure there's always a safe path for the player. Add coins near danger for risk/reward!"}},{"k":"key_master_desc","v":{"s":"Create a puzzle where the player must find keys to unlock doors."}},{"k":"key_master_hint","v":{"s":"Place doors that block the path and keys the player must collect first. The player needs a key in inventory to pass through a door!"}},{"k":"enemy_gauntlet_desc","v":{"s":"Create a level packed with enemies! Include safe zones between enemy groups."}},{"k":"enemy_gauntlet_hint","v":{"s":"Place 5+ enemies but also create safe zones (areas with no enemies nearby) so the player can rest. Add hearts for extra lives!"}},{"k":"master_designer_desc","v":{"s":"Create a complex level using at least 8 different tile types with all key mechanics."}},{"k":"master_designer_hint","v":{"s":"Use a wide variety of tiles: walls, hazards, keys, doors, enemies, coins, hearts, NPCs, and portals. Show mastery of all game design concepts!"}},{"k":"action_param_label","v":{"s":"Action parameter"}},{"k":"curve_img","v":{"s":"Difficulty curve chart"}},{"k":"explanation_input","v":{"s":"Difficulty curve explanation"}},{"k":"hypothesis_input","v":{"s":"Difficulty curve hypothesis"}},{"k":"trigger_param_label","v":{"s":"Trigger parameter"}}],"id":532}},{"k":"geo","v":{"o":[{"k":"sr_the_country_outlines_are_still_loading","v":{"s":"The country outlines are still loading."}},{"k":"sr_the_crosshair_is_over_water_pan_with_the_arrow_ke","v":{"s":"The crosshair is over water. Pan with the arrow keys until it is over land, then press Enter."}},{"k":"great_wall_of_china","v":{"s":"Great Wall of China"}},{"k":"over_13_000_miles_long_built_over_2_00","v":{"s":"Over 13,000 miles long, built over 2,000 years"}},{"k":"eiffel_tower","v":{"s":"Eiffel Tower"}},{"k":"built_in_1889_1_083_feet_tall","v":{"s":"Built in 1889, 1,083 feet tall"}},{"k":"taj_mahal","v":{"s":"Taj Mahal"}},{"k":"mughal_mausoleum_built_1632_1653","v":{"s":"Mughal mausoleum built 1632–1653"}},{"k":"machu_picchu","v":{"s":"Machu Picchu"}},{"k":"15th_century_inca_citadel_at_7_970_ft_","v":{"s":"15th-century Inca citadel at 7,970 ft elevation"}},{"k":"great_pyramid_of_giza","v":{"s":"Great Pyramid of Giza"}},{"k":"built_2560_bc_only_surviving_ancient_w","v":{"s":"Built ~2560 BC, only surviving Ancient Wonder"}},{"k":"statue_of_liberty","v":{"s":"Statue of 