ive Geometry Lab in a new window."}},{"k":"open_immersive","v":{"s":"🌐 Stretch Lab ↗"}},{"k":"sculpt_editing","v":{"s":"Editing by hand"}},{"k":"sculpt_edit","v":{"s":"Edit by hand"}},{"k":"sculpt_scratch","v":{"s":"Build from scratch"}},{"k":"sculpt_undo","v":{"s":"Undo"}},{"k":"sculpt_parts","v":{"s":"Parts — tap one to select, then shape it"}},{"k":"sculpt_add","v":{"s":"Add:"}},{"k":"sculpt_selected","v":{"s":"Selected part"}},{"k":"sculpt_part_bigger","v":{"s":"Make part bigger"}},{"k":"sculpt_part_smaller","v":{"s":"Make part smaller"}},{"k":"sculpt_part_rotate","v":{"s":"Rotate part"}},{"k":"sculpt_part_recolor","v":{"s":"Recolor part"}},{"k":"sculpt_part_reshape","v":{"s":"Change part shape"}},{"k":"sculpt_shape","v":{"s":"shape"}},{"k":"sculpt_part_delete","v":{"s":"Delete selected part"}},{"k":"sculpt_gallery","v":{"s":"Saved sculpts"}},{"k":"sculpt_save","v":{"s":"Save this sculpt"}},{"k":"sculpt_save_2","v":{"s":"Save"}},{"k":"sculpt_gallery_empty","v":{"s":"No saved sculpts yet — make one, then press Save."}},{"k":"sculpt_load","v":{"s":"Load"}},{"k":"sculpt_delete","v":{"s":"Delete"}},{"k":"sr_height","v":{"s":"height"}},{"k":"sr_at_origin","v":{"s":"at the origin"}},{"k":"sr_point_added","v":{"s":"Point added"}},{"k":"sr_point_next","v":{"s":"Select an axis and stretch to create a segment."}},{"k":"sr_select_first","v":{"s":"Select an object first"}},{"k":"verb_taper_word","v":{"s":"Taper"}},{"k":"verb_revolve_word","v":{"s":"Revolve"}},{"k":"sr_needs_rectangle","v":{"s":"needs a rectangle — stretch up to one first"}},{"k":"sr_already_solid","v":{"s":"That is already a solid — there is no fourth dimension to stretch into"}},{"k":"spin_crosses_axis","v":{"s":"The rectangle straddles the spin axis, so it would sweep through itself. Pappus’s theorem needs the whole face on one side of the axis."}},{"k":"spin_axis_off_plane","v":{"s":"That axis is not in the rectangle’s plane, so spinning around it sweeps no solid at all."}},{"k":"spin_try_axis","v":{"s":"Try"}},{"k":"spin_no_axis","v":{"s":"No X, Y or Z axis lies in this rectangle’s plane — build it against an axis first."}},{"k":"ai_unreachable","v":{"s":"Could not reach the AI just now. Check the connection and try again."}},{"k":"ai_not_connected","v":{"s":"AI is not connected, so this needs building by hand — the part buttons below all work without it."}},{"k":"ai_still_loading","v":{"s":"The sculpting module is still loading. Try again in a moment."}},{"k":"ai_unbuildable","v":{"s":"The AI did not send back a sculpture that could be built. Try describing it more simply, like “a snowman” or “a rocket”."}},{"k":"ai_refine_failed","v":{"s":"The AI could not apply that change. Try one change at a time, like “make the head bigger”."}},{"k":"mission_done","v":{"s":"Mission complete: "}},{"k":"export_stl","v":{"s":"Export current shape as STL"}},{"k":"ai_analyzing_scene","v":{"s":"Analyzing the current geometry scene..."}},{"k":"apply_sculpt_refinement","v":{"s":"Apply sculpture refinement"}},{"k":"sculpt_math","v":{"s":"🧮 Sculpt math"}},{"k":"sculpt_math_intro","v":{"s":"Click a part in the 3D sculpt or this list to connect its shape, formulas, cross-section, and net"}},{"k":"at_scale","v":{"s":"at scale"}},{"k":"sculpt_total_upper","v":{"s":"Upper-bound sum of parts"}},{"k":"sculpt_overlap_note","v":{"s":"Upper bound: overlapping pieces are counted separately. The actual union can have less volume and less exposed surface area."}},{"k":"dim0","v":{"s":"Point"}},{"k":"dim1","v":{"s":"Line"}},{"k":"dim2","v":{"s":"Plane"}},{"k":"dim3","v":{"s":"Solid"}},{"k":"dimension_journey","v":{"s":"Dimension journey"}},{"k":"reached","v":{"s":"reached"}},{"k":"predict_mode","v":{"s":"Predict mode: guess the result before each stretch"}},{"k":"predict_before_reveal","v":{"s":"🔮 Predict before reveal"}},{"k":"build_challenge","v":{"s":"Build Challenge"}},{"k":"build_challenge_intro","v":{"s":"Get a target and build a shape that hits it — stretch to the right length, area, or volume."}},{"k":"level_length","v":{"s":"Length"}},{"k":"level_area","v":{"s":"Area"}},{"k":"level_volume","v":{"s":"Volume"}},{"k":"build_solved_count","v":{"s":"{n} solved"}},{"k":"hint","v":{"s":"Hint"}},{"k":"new_challenge","v":{"s":"New"}},{"k":"click_to_place_toggle","v":{"s":"Click in the 3D view to place a point"}},{"k":"placing_active","v":{"s":"🎯 Placing…"}},{"k":"click_place","v":{"s":"🎯 Click-place"}},{"k":"click_place_hint","v":{"s":"Click empty space in the 3D view to drop a point (snaps to the grid)."}},{"k":"click_place_hint_raised","v":{"s":"Taps land at height"}},{"k":"click_place_hint_floor","v":{"s":"set Y back to 0 to drop points on the floor."}},{"k":"place_x","v":{"s":"X"}},{"k":"place_x_aria","v":{"s":"Point X position"}},{"k":"place_z","v":{"s":"Z"}},{"k":"place_z_aria","v":{"s":"Point Z position"}},{"k":"place_y","v":{"s":"Y ↑"}},{"k":"place_y_aria","v":{"s":"Point height above the grid"}},{"k":"place_at_xyz","v":{"s":"Place a point at the entered X, Z and height Y"}},{"k":"place","v":{"s":"Place"}},{"k":"snap","v":{"s":"Snap:"}},{"k":"snap_off","v":{"s":"off"}},{"k":"snap_grid","v":{"s":"Snap grid"}},{"k":"build_action","v":{"s":"Build action:"}},{"k":"build_action_2","v":{"s":"Build action"}},{"k":"verb_stretch","v":{"s":"⤴ Stretch"}},{"k":"verb_taper","v":{"s":"🔺 Taper"}},{"k":"verb_revolve","v":{"s":"🌀 Revolve"}},{"k":"taper_hint","v":{"s":"Taper a rectangle → shrinks the top toward a point. Top 0 = pyramid (⅓ the box!), 1 = box."}},{"k":"revolve_hint","v":{"s":"Revolve a rectangle around a world axis (through the origin) → a cylinder when an edge sits on the axis, a ring when you place it further out. Volume by Pappus: V = θ·R̄·A."}},{"k":"top_size","v":{"s":"Top size"}},{"k":"pyramid","v":{"s":"pyramid"}},{"k":"box","v":{"s":"box"}},{"k":"frustum","v":{"s":"frustum"}},{"k":"top_size_aria","v":{"s":"Taper top size"}},{"k":"sweep_angle","v":{"s":"Sweep angle"}},{"k":"full_turn","v":{"s":"full turn"}},{"k":"sweep_angle_aria","v":{"s":"Revolution sweep angle in degrees"}},{"k":"revolve_axis_note","v":{"s":"Uses the axis picker below as the spin axis (through the origin). Edge on the axis → solid cylinder; placed further out → a ring."}},{"k":"revolve_profile","v":{"s":"Profile to spin"}},{"k":"profile_rect","v":{"s":"▭ Rectangle → cylinder"}},{"k":"profile_tri","v":{"s":"◺ Triangle → cone"}},{"k":"cone_note","v":{"s":"Spinning a right triangle gives a cone — and Pappus lands exactly on V = ⅓πr²h."}},{"k":"spin_axis","v":{"s":"Spin axis:"}},{"k":"stretch_direction","v":{"s":"Stretch direction:"}},{"k":"axis_out_of_face","v":{"s":"Straight out of the face"}},{"k":"axis_normal_note","v":{"s":"A rectangle extrudes straight out of its own face — that perpendicular is the only direction that adds a third dimension."}},{"k":"axis_no_selection_note","v":{"s":"Select an object to see which way it will stretch."}},{"k":"axis_parallel_note","v":{"s":"That axis runs along the segment, so stretching there would only make it longer. It will use"}},{"k":"axis_parallel_note_2","v":{"s":"instead, to open out a rectangle."}},{"k":"axis_spin_note","v":{"s":"This is the line the rectangle spins around, not a stretch direction."}},{"k":"stretch_length_exact","v":{"s":"Exact stretch length"}},{"k":"oblique_toggle","v":{"s":"Oblique (slanted) stretch"}},{"k":"oblique","v":{"s":"◣ Oblique (slant)"}},{"k":"slant_amount","v":{"s":"Slant amount"}},{"k":"cavalieri_note","v":{"s":"Cavalieri: slanting keeps the base and height — so area/volume don't change, only the surface does."}},{"k":"predict_the","v":{"s":"Predict the"}},{"k":"of_the_result","v":{"s":"of the result"}},{"k":"your_prediction","v":{"s":"Your prediction"}},{"k":"reveal_build","v":{"s":"Reveal & build"}},{"k":"cancel_prediction","v":{"s":"Cancel prediction"}},{"k":"btn_start_with_point","v":{"s":"Start with a point — add one above"}},{"k":"btn_select_first","v":{"s":"Select an object first"}},{"k":"btn_taper_pyramid","v":{"s":"Taper rectangle → pyramid (3D)"}},{"k":