ooter","v":{"s":"🩺 \"Why did my X fail?\" Troubleshooter"}},{"k":"the_most_common_cooking_failures_their","v":{"s":"The most common cooking failures + their likely causes. Most cooking problems are some combination of these — work through the list, fix the ones that apply, try again."}},{"k":"sources_further_reading","v":{"s":"📜 Sources + Further Reading"}},{"k":"kitchen_lab_content_is_anchored_in_pub","v":{"s":"Kitchen Lab content is anchored in publicly available food-safety guidance + culinary science references. Where temperatures or rules appear, the cited source is the authoritative one for the US:"}},{"k":"usda_fsis","v":{"s":"USDA FSIS"}},{"k":"fda_food_code_2022","v":{"s":"FDA Food Code 2022"}},{"k":"cdc_foodsafety_gov","v":{"s":"CDC Foodsafety.gov"}},{"k":"who_12_step_handwash","v":{"s":"WHO 12-step handwash"}},{"k":"harold_mcgee_on_food_and_cooking_2nd_e","v":{"s":"Harold McGee, \"On Food and Cooking\" (2nd ed.)"}},{"k":"modernist_cuisine_myhrvold","v":{"s":"Modernist Cuisine (Myhrvold)"}},{"k":"kenji_l_pez_alt_the_food_lab","v":{"s":"Kenji López-Alt, \"The Food Lab\""}},{"k":"servsafe_instructor_guide","v":{"s":"ServSafe instructor guide"}},{"k":"iarc_monographs","v":{"s":"IARC monographs"}},{"k":"no_reaction","v":{"s":"⚪ No reaction"}},{"k":"below_threshold_no_maillard_activity","v":{"s":"Below threshold — no Maillard activity."}},{"k":"browning_begins","v":{"s":"🟡 Browning begins"}},{"k":"light_tan_color_mild_aroma","v":{"s":"Light tan color, mild aroma."}},{"k":"active_maillard","v":{"s":"🟠 Active Maillard"}},{"k":"golden_brown_rich_aroma_compounds_form","v":{"s":"Golden-brown, rich aroma compounds forming."}},{"k":"deep_brown","v":{"s":"🟤 Deep brown"}},{"k":"strong_flavors_approaching_upper_limit","v":{"s":"Strong flavors. Approaching upper limit."}},{"k":"burnt_acrylamide_risk","v":{"s":"⚫ Burnt / acrylamide risk"}},{"k":"pyrolysis_bitter_potential_acrylamide_","v":{"s":"Pyrolysis. Bitter, potential acrylamide formation."}},{"k":"maillard_browning_d