v":{"s":"🧪 Try it: the same carrot, cut four ways, in one pan"}},{"k":"try_it_size_blurb","v":{"s":"Heat reaches the centre by conduction, and that time grows with the square of the thickness: double the size, four times the wait. The food model from the recipes, run for each cut."}},{"k":"pan_temperature_in_celsius","v":{"s":"Pan temperature in Celsius"}},{"k":"centre_reaches","v":{"s":"centre reaches "}},{"k":"mixed_cut","v":{"s":"A mixed cut: "}},{"k":"try_it_title","v":{"s":"🧪 Try it: "}},{"k":"try_it_in_the_pan_at_this_temperature","v":{"s":" in the pan at this temperature"}},{"k":"try_it_blurb","v":{"s":"Same physics as the recipes, run in one go. Pick a food, move the slider above, and read what this technique's usual time does to it. Log a run, move the slider, log another — then compare."}},{"k":"food_for_the_test","v":{"s":"Food for the test"}},{"k":"surface_after","v":{"s":"Surface after "}},{"k":"interior","v":{"s":"Interior"}},{"k":"sound_and_oil","v":{"s":"Sound + oil"}},{"k":"log_this_run","v":{"s":"📋 Log this run"}},{"k":"clear_runs","v":{"s":"Clear"}},{"k":"log_hint","v":{"s":"Log a run, then change the temperature and log another to compare."}},{"k":"food_surface_temperature_in_celsius","v":{"s":"Food surface temperature in Celsius"}},{"k":"try_it_golden","v":{"s":"🧪 Try it: how long until golden at this surface temperature?"}},{"k":"try_it_golden_blurb","v":{"s":"The browning rate the recipes run on doubles every 40°F above the ~280°F threshold. Pick a food, and the slider above sets the surface temperature."}},{"k":"golden_at","v":{"s":"Golden at "}},{"k":"never_below_threshold","v":{"s":"never — below the threshold"}},{"k":"golden_note","v":{"s":"Each 40°F step halves the time. That is why a sear is a race and a sauté is a wait — and why 40°F of pan temperature is the difference between golden and burnt with the same clock."}},{"k":"sr_paused_while_away","v":{"s":"Your cook was paused while you were away. Resume when you are ready."}},{"k":"sr_moved_the_chicken_crust_interrupted","v":{"s":"Moved the chicken. Crust interrupted."}},{"k":"sr_sizzle_sound_on","v":{"s":"Sizzle sound on."}},{"k":"sr_sizzle_sound_off","v":{"s":"Sizzle sound off."}},{"k":"recipe_kitchen_title","v":{"s":"The 3D Recipe Kitchen — two burners, one dish"}},{"k":"recipe_kitchen_blurb","v":{"s":"A pasta pot and a sauce pan on a 3D bench, advanced at your own pace: golden mushroom pasta or tomato and garlic pasta, for two or four. Same moisture-and-browning ideas as the recipes here, with replay and a downloadable evidence report."}},{"k":"open_recipe_kitchen_here","v":{"s":"▶ Open the Recipe Kitchen"}},{"k":"free_cook","v":{"s":"Free cook — no steps, no grade"}},{"k":"free_cook_blurb","v":{"s":"Pick a pan, an oil and a food. Heat, add, stir or leave it, pull it when you think it is right — then read what you made in the same terms the recipes are judged on. Good for testing one idea at a time."}},{"k":"food_to_cook","v":{"s":"Food to cook"}},{"k":"start_free_cook","v":{"s":"▶ Start free cook"}},{"k":"cooked","v":{"s":"✓ Cooked"}},{"k":"next_time_fix","v":{"s":"Next time: "}},{"k":"nothing_flagged_last_time","v":{"s":"Nothing flagged last time."}},{"k":"heat_off","v":{"s":"Heat off"}},{"k":"paused_while_away","v":{"s":"Paused while you were away — the clock stopped where you left it. Resume when you are ready."}},{"k":"surface_colour","v":{"s":"Surface colour"}},{"k":"your_pan","v":{"s":"Your pan"}},{"k":"pan_locked","v":{"s":"chosen — food is in it"}},{"k":"pan_choose_before_food","v":{"s":"choose before the first ingredient"}},{"k":"your_oil","v":{"s":"Your oil"}},{"k":"oil_locked","v":{"s":"in the pan"}},{"k":"oil_choose","v":{"s":"choose before adding it"}},{"k":"oil_smoking","v":{"s":"Oil smoking: "}},{"k":"sound_of_the_pan","v":{"s":"Sound of the pan: "}},{"k":"sizzle_sound_on","v":{"s":"🔊 Sizzle sound on"}},{"k":"sizzle_sound_off","v":{"s":"🔇 Sizzle sound off"}},{"k":"option_locked","v":{"s":"chosen"}},{"k":"option_choose","v":{"s"