The point is not just \"do laundry\" — it is knowing why each step prevents residue, dye transfer, shrinkage, odor, and dryer risk."}},{"k":"hourly_rate_dollars","v":{"s":"Hourly rate in dollars"}},{"k":"hours_worked_per_week","v":{"s":"Hours worked per week"}},{"k":"laundry_lab_title","v":{"s":"🧺 Laundry Lab"}},{"k":"start_here","v":{"s":"Start Here"}},{"k":"choose_a_path","v":{"s":"Choose a practical path, then jump into the first activity. This keeps Life Skills approachable while still letting students explore freely."}},{"k":"records_paperwork","v":{"s":"Records + paperwork"}},{"k":"records_paperwork_hint","v":{"s":"IDs, forms, receipts, health cards, deadlines, proof of payment, safe storage, and knowing when to ask before sharing or signing."}},{"k":"transportation_navigation","v":{"s":"Transportation + navigation"}},{"k":"transportation_navigation_hint","v":{"s":"Route choices, stops, transfers, time buffers, fare/payment, accessibility, safer waiting, backup plans, and asking official or trusted help when a trip changes."}},{"k":"job_readiness","v":{"s":"Job readiness + workplace basics"}},{"k":"job_readiness_hint","v":{"s":"Applications, resumes, availability, interviews, first-day plans, workplace communication, feedback, pay records, safety, respect, and asking clear questions."}},{"k":"resume_builder","v":{"s":"Resume builder + evidence review"}},{"k":"resume_builder_hint","v":{"s":"Role matching, truthful evidence bullets, clean sections, O*NET vocabulary, NACE career-readiness skills, privacy checks, and cautious AI/ATS review."}},{"k":"proof_locker","v":{"s":"Portfolio + proof locker"}},{"k":"proof_locker_hint","v":{"s":"Collect projects, certificates, work samples, volunteer proof, references, links, privacy checks, captions, and share-ready packets that support resume and interview claims."}},{"k":"interview_studio","v":{"s":"Interview practice studio"}},{"k":"interview_studio_hint","v":{"s":"Persona-style mock interview chat with guided/free response, suggested stems, read-aloud, calm rehearsal, question-to-proof matching, interview day run sheet, topic spark coaching, bite-size practice plans, STAR answers, prep packets, transcript save, reflection, and accessibility scripts."}},{"k":"communication_conflict","v":{"s":"Communication + conflict"}},{"k":"communication_conflict_hint","v":{"s":"Pausing, listening, clarifying, I-statements, boundaries, message tone, repair attempts, apologies, and getting trusted support when conflict is unsafe or too big."}},{"k":"time_management","v":{"s":"Time management + planning"}},{"k":"time_management_hint","v":{"s":"Task capture, priorities, realistic estimates, buffers, reminders, calendars, checklists, focus tools, and recovery plans when the day changes."}},{"k":"dental_care","v":{"s":"Dental care"}},{"k":"daily_oral_health_habits","v":{"s":"Daily prevention, brushing and between-teeth cleaning, snack choices, dental plan math, and knowing when symptoms need a dentist. Educational practice only - not a diagnosis."}},{"k":"body_care_ergonomics","v":{"s":"Body care + ergonomics"}},{"k":"body_care_fit_task","v":{"s":"Comfort checks, workspace fit, movement resets, accessibility options, and knowing when to ask for support. The goal is flexible comfort, not one perfect posture."}},{"k":"sleep_energy","v":{"s":"Sleep + energy"}},{"k":"sleep_energy_routines","v":{"s":"Wind-down routines, wake-time math, caffeine timing, screen boundaries, and energy supports. Educational practice only - persistent sleep problems deserve real support."}},{"k":"meds_labels","v":{"s":"Medication + labels"}},{"k":"medication_label_safety","v":{"s":"Mock label reading, active ingredients, directions, warnings, storage, expiration, and questions to ask. Practice only - real medication choices need label and professional guidance."}},{"k":"appointments_self_advocacy","v":{"s":"Appointments + self-advocacy"}},{"k":"appointment_prep","v":{"s":"Prepare what to bring, describe concerns clearly, ask questions, request support, and leave with a follow-up plan. Useful for health, school, work, and service meetings."}},{"k":"home_safety","v":{"s":"Home safety"}},{"k":"home_safety_prep","v":{"s":"Smoke and carbon monoxide alarms, exit plans, cleaning product safety, first-aid decision rules, emergency contacts, and calm response practice."}},{"k":"digital_safety","v":{"s":"Digital safety"}},{"k":"digital_safety_prep","v":{"s":"Phishing clues, passwords, two-factor login, privacy settings, respectful communication, and block/report/save-evidence plans."}},{"k":"food_confidence","v":{"s":"Food confidence"}},{"k":"food_confidence_hint","v":{"s":"Leftovers, storage, date-label judgment, budget meals, pantry backups, simple nutrition labels, and choosing safety when food is uncertain."}},{"k":"records_lab","v":{"s":"📁 Records & Paperwork Lab"}},{"k":"transportation_lab","v":{"s":"🚌 Transportation & Navigation Lab"}},{"k":"job_readiness_lab","v":{"s":"💼 Job Readiness & Workplace Basics Lab"}},{"k":"resume_builder_lab","v":{"s":"📄 Resume Builder & Evidence Review Lab"}},{"k":"proof_locker_lab","v":{"s":"🗂️ Portfolio & Proof Locker Lab"}},{"k":"interview_studio_lab","v":{"s":"🎤 Interview Practice Studio"}},{"k":"communication_lab","v":{"s":"💬 Communication & Conflict Basics Lab"}},{"k":"time_management_lab","v":{"s":"⏳ Time Management & Planning Lab"}},{"k":"dental_care_lab","v":{"s":"🦷 Dental Care Lab"}},{"k":"body_care_lab","v":{"s":"🧍 Body Care & Ergonomics Lab"}},{"k":"sleep_energy_lab","v":{"s":"🌙 Sleep & Energy Lab"}},{"k":"medication_labels_lab","v":{"s":"💊 Medication & Labels Lab"}},{"k":"appointments_lab","v":{"s":"📅 Appointments & Self-Advocacy Lab"}},{"k":"home_safety_lab","v":{"s":"🛡️ Home Safety Lab"}},{"k":"digital_safety_lab","v":{"s":"🔐 Digital Safety Lab"}},{"k":"food_confidence_lab","v":{"s":"🥗 Food Confidence Lab"}},{"k":"bar_img","v":{"s":"Budget proportion bar"}},{"k":"explanation_input","v":{"s":"Budget feasibility explanation"}},{"k":"home_question_lab