{"s":"Old Man Pete"}},{"k":"firefighter_sam","v":{"s":"Firefighter Sam"}},{"k":"little_timmy","v":{"s":"Little Timmy"}},{"k":"librarian_wells","v":{"s":"Librarian Wells"}},{"k":"power_s_out_cash_register_is_dead_cust","v":{"s":"Power's out. Cash register is dead. Customers need you to add the prices up — they're all rounded to nice numbers so you can practice clean."}},{"k":"power_s_out_cash_register_is_dead_cust_2","v":{"s":"Power's out. Cash register is dead. Customers need you to add it up in your head."}},{"k":"try_this_ignore_the_cents_round_each_p","v":{"s":"Try this: ignore the cents. Round each price up. Then estimate."}},{"k":"nice_flow_you_re_getting_fast","v":{"s":"Nice flow. You're getting fast."}},{"k":"housing","v":{"s":"🏠 Housing"}},{"k":"food","v":{"s":"🍞 Food"}},{"k":"transport","v":{"s":"🚗 Transport"}},{"k":"education","v":{"s":"📚 Education"}},{"k":"entertainment","v":{"s":"🎮 Entertainment"}},{"k":"savings","v":{"s":"💰 Savings"}},{"k":"other","v":{"s":"❤️ Other"}},{"k":"apples_2","v":{"s":"🍎 Apples"}},{"k":"bananas_2","v":{"s":"🍌 Bananas"}},{"k":"milk","v":{"s":"🥛 Milk"}},{"k":"juice","v":{"s":"🧃 Juice"}},{"k":"bread_2","v":{"s":"🍞 Bread"}},{"k":"cereal","v":{"s":"🍫 Cereal"}},{"k":"paper_towels","v":{"s":"🧻 Paper Towels"}},{"k":"coffee","v":{"s":"☕ Coffee"}},{"k":"total","v":{"s":"Total"}},{"k":"sale_price","v":{"s":"Sale Price"}},{"k":"amount_needed","v":{"s":"Amount Needed"}},{"k":"total_2","v":{"s":"Total"}},{"k":"gross_pay","v":{"s":"Gross Pay"}},{"k":"each_pays","v":{"s":"Each Pays"}},{"k":"1_000_1_07_1_967_compound_interest_gro","v":{"s":"$1,000 × (1.07)¹⁰ ≈ $1,967. Compound interest grows exponentially over time."}},{"k":"at_5_5yr_2_645_interest_at_3_10yr_3_17","v":{"s":"At 5%/5yr: ~$2,645 interest. At 3%/10yr: ~$3,174 interest. Lower rate but longer term costs more in total interest."}},{"k":"age_25_262k_age_35_122k_that_s_140k_di","v":{"s":"Age 25: ~$262K. Age 35: ~$122K. That's ~$140K difference! Time is the most powerful factor in investing."}},{"k":"at_25_month_and_22_apr_it_takes_about_","v":{"s":"At $25/month and 22% APR, it takes about 24 months and you pay ~$95 in interest. High-interest debt is expensive!"}},{"k":"72_6_12_years_the_rule_of_72_divide_72","v":{"s":"72 ÷ 6 = 12 years. The Rule of 72: divide 72 by your interest rate to estimate doubling time."}},{"k":"financial_advisors_recommend_3_6_month","v":{"s":"Financial advisors recommend 3-6 months of expenses. This covers most unexpected events like job loss or medical emergencies."}},{"k":"auto_loan","v":{"s":"🚗 Auto Loan"}},{"k":"student_loan","v":{"s":"🎓 Student Loan"}},{"k":"mortgage","v":{"s":"🏠 Mortgage"}},{"k":"credit_card","v":{"s":"💳 Credit Card"}},{"k":"car","v":{"s":"🚗 Car"}},{"k":"college_fund","v":{"s":"🎓 College Fund"}},{"k":"house_down_payment","v":{"s":"🏠 House Down Payment"}},{"k":"emergency_fund","v":{"s":"🛡️ Emergency Fund"}},{"k":"vacation","v":{"s":"✈️ Vacation"}},{"k":"custom_goal","v":{"s":"⭐ Custom Goal"}},{"k":"coins_bills","v":{"s":"🪙 Coins & Bills"}},{"k":"making_change","v":{"s":"💵 Making Change"}},{"k":"tips_discounts","v":{"s":"💳 Tips & Discounts"}},{"k":"grocery_store","v":{"s":"🛒 Grocery Store"}},{"k":"budget","v":{"s":"📊 Budget"}},{"k":"common_cents","v":{"s":"🪙 Common Cents"}},{"k":"word_problems","v":{"s":"📝 Word Problems"}},{"k":"currency_exchange","v":{"s":"🌍 Currency Exchange"}},{"k":"personal_finance","v":{"s":"💰 Personal Finance"}},{"k":"compound_inquiry","v":{"s":"🔬 Compound Inquiry"}},{"k":"money_math","v":{"s":"💵 Money Math"}},{"k":"master_coins_bills_change_budgeting_cu","v":{"s":"Master coins, bills, change, budgeting & currency exchange"}},{"k":"grade_level","v":{"s":"Grade level"}},{"k":"currency","v":{"s":"Currency"}},{"k":"money_tool_sections","v":{"s":"Money Tool sections"}},{"k":"coins_bills_2","v":{"s":"Coins & bills"}},{"k":"build_a_counting_board_coin_face_value","v":{"s":"Build a counting board. Coin face values are arbitrary — a quarter is worth 25¢ because we agree it is, not because of the metal."}},{"k":"making_change_2","v":{"s":"Making change"}},{"k":"count_up_from_the_price_to_the_amount_","v":{"s":"Count UP from the price to the amount paid — the way cashiers actually do it. Faster + more accurate than subtraction by hand."}},{"k":"tips_discounts_2","v":{"s":"Tips & discounts"}},{"k":"15_tip_10_move_decimal_half_of_that_20","v":{"s":"15% tip = 10% (move decimal) + half of that. 20% off = take the price, divide by 5, subtract. Mental-math shortcuts beat the calculator for sanity-checking."}},{"k":"grocery_store_2","v":{"s":"Grocery store"}},{"k":"unit_price_cost_per_ounce_or_item_is_t","v":{"s":"Unit price (cost per ounce or item) is the only honest comparison — package sizes are designed to defeat eyeball math."}},{"k":"budget_2","v":{"s":"Budget"}},{"k":"50_30_20_needs_wants_save_debt_most_pe","v":{"s":"50/30/20: needs / wants / save+debt. Most people misclassify recurring subscriptions as needs — if it auto-renews, it is a want until you opt back in."}},{"k":"common_cents_2","v":{"s":"Common cents"}},{"k":"quick_mental_shortcuts_25_4_1_10_5_1_1","v":{"s":"Quick mental shortcuts: 25¢ × 4 = $1, 10¢ + 5¢ + 1¢ = 16¢. Arithmetic with money is faster than the same arithmetic with abstract numbers because the unit is concrete."}},{"k":"word_problems_2","v":{"s":"Word problems"}},{"k":"translate_the_sentence_to_an_equation_","v":{"s":"Translate the sentence to an equation BEFORE computing. \"How much\" = an unknown variable. \"Total\" = sum. \"Each\" or \"per\" = multiplication."}},{"k":"currency_exchange_2","v":{"s":"Currency exchange"}},{"k":"exchange_rates_change_daily_cards_usua","v":{"s":"Exchange rates change daily. Cards usually beat cash for travel — cash exchange shops mark up 5–10% over interbank rates."}},{"k":"personal_finance_2","v":{"s":"Personal finance"}},{"k":"compound_interest_100_at_7_30_yrs_760_","v":{"s":"Compound interest: $100 at 7% × 30 yrs = $760. Pay credit-card statement balance in full each cycle = no interest. Carry a balance = APR roughly doubles your debt every 5 yrs."}},{"k":"compound_interest_inquiry","v":{"s":"Compound Interest Inquiry"}},{"k":"vary_the_principal_rate_and_time_and_w","v":{"s":"Vary the principal, rate, and time and watch how compound growth pulls ahead of the contributions alone. An open exploration — no score, no single right answer."}},{"k":"click_coins_to_add_them_to_your_counti","v":{"s":"Click coins to add them to your counting board."}},{"k":"counting_board","v":{"s":"🧮 Counting Board"}},{"k":"str","v":{"s":"🎯 ?"}},{"k":"clear","v":{"s":"Clear"}},{"k":"clear_2","v":{"s":"✕ Clear"}},{"k":"what_s_the_total_add_up_all_the_coins_","v":{"s":"🎯 What's the total? Add up all the coins and bills!"}},{"k":"check","v":{"s":"Check"}},{"k":"check_2","v":{"s":"✔ Check"}},{"k":"making_change_practice","v":{"s":"Making Change Practice"}},{"k":"generate_problem","v":{"s":"Generate Problem"}},{"k":"generate_problem_2","v":{"s":"✨ Generate Problem"}},{"k":"price","v":{"s":"Price"}},{"k":"customer_pays","v":{"s":"Customer pays"}},{"k":"change_due","v":{"s":"Change Due"}},{"k":"your_answer","v":{"s":"Your answer:"}},{"k":"check_3","v":{"s":"Check"}},{"k":"check_4","v":{"s":"✔ Check"}},{"k":"subtraction_step","v":{"s":"📐 Subtraction step"}},{"k":"next_problem","v":{"s":"Next Problem"}},{"k":"next_problem_2","v":{"s":"↻ Next Problem"}},{"k":"power_outage_cashier_rush","v":{"s":"Power Outage Cashier Rush"}},{"k":"registers_are_down_calculate_by_hand","v":{"s":"Registers are down! Calculate by hand!"}},{"k":"code_black_power_outage","v":{"s":"Code Black: Power Outage!"}},{"k":"the_registers_are_completely_dead_food","v":{"s":"The registers are completely dead. Food is starting to spoil. We need you to manually calculate customer totals as fast as you can. "}},{"k":"speed_and_accuracy","v":{"s":"Speed and accuracy"}},{"k":"are_everything_right_now","v":{"s":" are everything right now."}},{"k":"difficulty","v":{"s":"Difficulty"}},{"k":"easy","v":{"s":"🟢 Easy"}},{"k":"standa