emen","v":{"s":"Quantitative UV-sensitivity measurements across raptor species."}},{"k":"visual_acuity_measurements_vs_mammals","v":{"s":"Visual acuity measurements vs. mammals."}},{"k":"photoreceptor_density_in_the_central_a","v":{"s":"Photoreceptor density in the central and temporal foveas of raptors."}},{"k":"the_famous_total_darkness_barn_owl_str","v":{"s":"The famous total-darkness barn owl strike experiment. First demonstration of acoustic localization accurate to ~1° in pitch black."}},{"k":"detailed_morphometric_comparison_of_ow","v":{"s":"Detailed morphometric comparison of owl-feather silencing structures."}},{"k":"modern_review_of_comb_leading_edge_fri","v":{"s":"Modern review of comb leading edge + fringed trailing edge + velvet dorsal mechanisms."}},{"k":"quantitative_measurement_of_trailing_e","v":{"s":"Quantitative measurement of trailing-edge fringe structure."}},{"k":"comparative_review_of_grip_force_acros","v":{"s":"Comparative review of grip force across vertebrates including raptors."}},{"k":"why_some_species_have_one_outsized_kil","v":{"s":"Why some species have one outsized killing talon (hallux) and others have proportional talons."}},{"k":"snowy_owl_lemming_population_dynamics_","v":{"s":"Snowy owl + lemming population dynamics — basis for irruption-year predictions."}},{"k":"standard_textbook_on_raptor_demographi","v":{"s":"Standard textbook on raptor demographic limitation. Source for K-selected vs r-selected framework."}},{"k":"long_term_raptor_demographic_study_cit","v":{"s":"Long-term raptor demographic study cited in lifecycle survivorship curve."}},{"k":"the_definitive_history_of_the_peregrin","v":{"s":"The definitive history of the peregrine DDT-era recovery."}},{"k":"the_book_that_started_the_ddt_ban_move","v":{"s":"The book that started the DDT-ban movement + raptor recovery era."}},{"k":"complete_history_of_the_condor_decline","v":{"s":"Complete history of the condor decline + captive-breeding recovery."}},{"k":"the_4_bird_to_800_