ng scenarios. Click/tap as FAST as possible when you spot the hazard. Your reaction time is measured."}},{"k":"click_tap_now_to_brake_react","v":{"s":"👆 CLICK / TAP NOW to brake/react!"}},{"k":"menu_62","v":{"s":"← Menu"}},{"k":"insurance_cost_estimator","v":{"s":"Insurance Cost Estimator"}},{"k":"see_how_age_driving_record_and_vehicle","v":{"s":"See how age, driving record, and vehicle type affect your premium."}},{"k":"driver_age_in_years","v":{"s":"Driver age in years"}},{"k":"driving_record","v":{"s":"DRIVING RECORD"}},{"k":"vehicle_type","v":{"s":"VEHICLE TYPE"}},{"k":"estimated_annual_premium","v":{"s":"ESTIMATED ANNUAL PREMIUM"}},{"k":"how_your_choices_affect_cost","v":{"s":"💡 How your choices affect cost:"}},{"k":"one_at_fault_accident_stays_on_your_re","v":{"s":"• One at-fault accident stays on your record for 3-5 years"}},{"k":"a_dui_can_raise_rates_for_7_10_years_a","v":{"s":"• A DUI can raise rates for 7-10 years and may cause policy cancellation"}},{"k":"good_student_discount_b_average_typica","v":{"s":"• Good student discount (B average): typically 10-15% off"}},{"k":"completing_a_driver_s_ed_course_like_t","v":{"s":"• Completing a driver's ed course may qualify you for an insurer/state discount; verify with your insurer."}},{"k":"oil_lubricates_all_moving_engine_parts","v":{"s":"Oil lubricates all moving engine parts. Old oil = friction = engine damage. Synthetic lasts longer."}},{"k":"front_tires_wear_faster_they_steer_rot","v":{"s":"Front tires wear faster (they steer). Rotating extends life by 20%. Check tread depth at the same time."}},{"k":"a_clogged_air_filter_reduces_mpg_by_2_","v":{"s":"A clogged air filter reduces MPG by 2-10% and can reduce engine power."}},{"k":"pads_wear_down_to_metal_squealing_warn","v":{"s":"Pads wear down to metal. Squealing = warning. Grinding = too late. Replace ASAP if < 3mm."}},{"k":"brake_fluid_absorbs_moisture_over_time","v":{"s":"Brake fluid absorbs moisture over time, lowering its boiling point. Old fluid = soft pedal, longer stops."}},{"k":"coolant_prevents_overheating_and_freez","v":{"s":"Coolant prevents overheating AND freezing. Old coolant loses protection and can corrode the engine."}},{"k":"transmission_fluid_lubricates_gears_ne","v":{"s":"Transmission fluid lubricates gears. Neglect = rough shifting → transmission failure ($3,000+ repair)."}},{"k":"spark_plugs_ignite_the_fuel_air_mixtur","v":{"s":"Spark plugs ignite the fuel-air mixture. Worn plugs = misfires, rough idle, poor MPG."}},{"k":"powers_alternator_ac_power_steering_if","v":{"s":"Powers alternator, AC, power steering. If it snaps while driving, you lose all three instantly."}},{"k":"average_life_3_5_years_maine_winters_a","v":{"s":"Average life: 3-5 years. Maine winters are brutal on batteries. Test annually after year 3."}},{"k":"tread_wears_down_below_2_32_unsafe_ill","v":{"s":"Tread wears down. Below 2/32\" = unsafe + illegal in Maine. All-season lasts ~50K, winter tires ~40K."}},{"k":"menu_63","v":{"s":"← Menu"}},{"k":"vehicle_maintenance_schedule","v":{"s":"Vehicle Maintenance Schedule"}},{"k":"what_to_service_and_when_neglect_expen","v":{"s":"What to service and when. Neglect = expensive breakdowns."}},{"k":"your_current_mileage","v":{"s":"YOUR CURRENT MILEAGE"}},{"k":"vehicle_odometer_mileage","v":{"s":"Vehicle odometer mileage"}},{"k":"menu_64","v":{"s":"← Menu"}},{"k":"ai_driving_coach_3","v":{"s":"AI Driving Coach"}},{"k":"gemini_ai_analyzes_your_driving_data_a","v":{"s":"Gemini AI analyzes your driving data and gives personalized advice."}},{"k":"complete_a_drive_first_then_come_back_","v":{"s":"Complete a drive first, then come back for AI analysis."}},{"k":"your_last_drive_data_sent_to_ai","v":{"s":"Your last drive data (sent to AI):"}},{"k":"analyze_my_drive","v":{"s":"🤖 Analyze My Drive"}},{"k":"ai_coach_is_analyzing_your_driving","v":{"s":"AI coach is analyzing your driving..."}},{"k":"coach_s_analysis","v":{"s":"🤖 Coach's Analysis"}},{"k":"re_analyze","v":{"s":"🔄 Re-analyze"}},{"k":"menu_