apshot"}},{"k":"loading_semiconductor_lab","v":{"s":"Loading Semiconductor Lab…"}},{"k":"semiconductor_lab","v":{"s":"Semiconductor Lab"}},{"k":"semiconductor_lab_2","v":{"s":"Semiconductor Lab"}},{"k":"route_band_structure","v":{"s":"Band structure"}},{"k":"route_doping","v":{"s":"Doping"}},{"k":"route_junctions","v":{"s":"Junctions"}},{"k":"route_junctions_note","v":{"s":"Bias a diode or LED"}},{"k":"route_chip_logic","v":{"s":"Chip logic"}},{"k":"route_chip_logic_note","v":{"s":"Build gates and CMOS flow"}},{"k":"route_solar_led","v":{"s":"Solar + LED"}},{"k":"route_solar_led_note","v":{"s":"Turn photons into power and color"}},{"k":"route_practice","v":{"s":"Practice"}},{"k":"active","v":{"s":"Active"}},{"k":"ready","v":{"s":"Ready"}},{"k":"route_practice_note","v":{"s":"Challenge or Chip Defense"}},{"k":"command_kicker","v":{"s":"Chip lab bench"}},{"k":"command_copy","v":{"s":"Choose a question, change one variable, and use the diagram plus the live values to explain what happened."}},{"k":"status_material","v":{"s":"Material"}},{"k":"status_temperature","v":{"s":"Temperature"}},{"k":"status_workspace","v":{"s":"Workspace"}},{"k":"status_xp","v":{"s":"XP"}},{"k":"material","v":{"s":"Material"}},{"k":"material_help","v":{"s":"Choose a material, then compare its band gap and classification in the diagram."}},{"k":"how_challenge_works","v":{"s":"How Challenge works"}},{"k":"choose_one_answer_misses_unlock_a_hint","v":{"s":"Choose one answer. Misses unlock a hint; correct answers build your streak and XP."}},{"k":"how_chip_defense_works","v":{"s":"How Chip Defense works"}},{"k":"answer_to_damage_the_enemy","v":{"s":"Answer a round to damage the enemy. A miss costs chip HP, so use the prompt and take your time."}},{"k":"start_here_band_gap_energy","v":{"s":"Start here: Band Gap Energy"}},{"k":"open_one_card_then_test_the_idea","v":{"s":"Open one card to build the idea, then test it in the simulator. Band gap energy is the key that connects materials, light, and temp