der pressure"}},{"k":"metallic_hydrogen_2","v":{"s":"Metallic Hydrogen"}},{"k":"metallic_hydrogen_ocean_saturn_is_so_l","v":{"s":"Metallic hydrogen ocean — Saturn is so light it could float in water!"}},{"k":"rocky_core_7","v":{"s":"Rocky Core"}},{"k":"dense_ice_rock_core_9_22x_earth_mass","v":{"s":"Dense ice/rock core, 9-22x Earth mass"}},{"k":"methane_atmosphere","v":{"s":"Methane Atmosphere"}},{"k":"methane_absorbs_red_light_giving_uranu","v":{"s":"Methane absorbs red light, giving Uranus its cyan color. Tilted 97.8° on its side!"}},{"k":"h_he_envelope_3","v":{"s":"H₂/He Envelope"}},{"k":"hydrogen_helium_gas_transitioning_to_l","v":{"s":"Hydrogen-helium gas transitioning to liquid"}},{"k":"superionic_water_ice","v":{"s":"Superionic Water/Ice"}},{"k":"water_in_exotic_superionic_state_ice_t","v":{"s":"Water in exotic \"superionic\" state — ice that conducts electricity! Plus diamond rain"}},{"k":"rocky_core_8","v":{"s":"Rocky Core"}},{"k":"small_silicate_iron_core_about_1x_eart","v":{"s":"Small silicate/iron core, about 1x Earth mass"}},{"k":"methane_atmosphere_2","v":{"s":"Methane Atmosphere"}},{"k":"deepest_blue_in_the_solar_system_winds","v":{"s":"Deepest blue in the solar system. Winds reach 2,100 km/h — fastest in the solar system!"}},{"k":"h_he_envelope_4","v":{"s":"H₂/He Envelope"}},{"k":"hydrogen_helium_gas_with_extreme_press","v":{"s":"Hydrogen-helium gas with extreme pressure"}},{"k":"superionic_water_diamond_rain","v":{"s":"Superionic Water/Diamond Rain"}},{"k":"superionic_water_mantle_where_carbon_a","v":{"s":"Superionic water mantle where carbon atoms are crushed into literal diamonds that rain down"}},{"k":"rocky_core_9","v":{"s":"Rocky Core"}},{"k":"iron_silicate_core_1_2x_earth_mass_at_","v":{"s":"Iron-silicate core, ~1.2x Earth mass at 5,400°C"}},{"k":"nitrogen_ice_2","v":{"s":"Nitrogen Ice"}},{"k":"frozen_n_co_ch_on_the_surface_the_famo","v":{"s":"Frozen N₂, CO, CH₄ on the surface. The famous heart-shaped Tombaugh Regio is nitrogen ice"}},{"k":"wa