t of history rather than something to hide."}},{"k":"three_sisters_agriculture","v":{"s":"Three Sisters Agriculture"}},{"k":"corn_beans_squash_companion_planting_6","v":{"s":"Corn, beans, squash companion planting. +6 food/turn, +2% terraform."}},{"k":"the_three_sisters_corn_beans_squash_is","v":{"s":"The Three Sisters (corn, beans, squash) is an Indigenous agricultural system where each plant benefits the others — corn provides structure, beans fix nitrogen, squash shades soil."}},{"k":"sankofa_wisdom","v":{"s":"Sankofa Wisdom"}},{"k":"go_back_and_get_it_learning_from_the_p","v":{"s":"\"Go back and get it.\" Learning from the past to build the future. +8 science/turn."}},{"k":"sankofa_is_an_adinkra_symbol_meaning_i","v":{"s":"Sankofa is an Adinkra symbol meaning \"it is not taboo to go back for what you forgot.\" It teaches that wisdom from the past is essential for progress."}},{"k":"ayni_reciprocity","v":{"s":"Ayni Reciprocity"}},{"k":"sacred_reciprocity_with_the_land_5_wat","v":{"s":"Sacred reciprocity with the land. +5 water, +5 materials, +3% terraform."}},{"k":"ayni_is_the_andean_principle_of_recipr","v":{"s":"Ayni is the Andean principle of reciprocity — every exchange with nature or community must be balanced. The Inca built their entire economy on this concept."}},{"k":"griot_oral_tradition","v":{"s":"Griot Oral Tradition"}},{"k":"storytelling_preserves_knowledge_acros","v":{"s":"Storytelling preserves knowledge across generations. +10 science, +5 happiness."}},{"k":"griots_are_west_african_historians_sto","v":{"s":"Griots are West African historians, storytellers, and musicians who preserve knowledge orally. Some griot lineages stretch back over 800 years."}},{"k":"whakapapa_genealogy","v":{"s":"Whakapapa Genealogy"}},{"k":"ancestral_connection_to_land_and_sea_5","v":{"s":"Ancestral connection to land and sea. +5 water, +8 food, stronger settler bonds."}},{"k":"whakapapa_is_the_m_ori_concept_of_gene","v":{"s":"Whakapapa is the Māori concept of genealogical connection — linking people to ancestors, the land, and even the stars. It underpins Polynesian navigation."}},{"k":"songlines_navigation","v":{"s":"Songlines Navigation"}},{"k":"ancient_wayfinding_through_story_and_s","v":{"s":"Ancient wayfinding through story and song. Expeditions complete 1 turn faster."}},{"k":"aboriginal_songlines_are_navigational_","v":{"s":"Aboriginal Songlines are navigational paths across Australia encoded in songs, stories, and art. Some Songlines are over 10,000 years old — among the oldest knowledge systems on Earth."}},{"k":"bloom_season","v":{"s":"Bloom Season"}},{"k":"alien_flora_flourishes_2_food_turn","v":{"s":"Alien flora flourishes. +2 food/turn."}},{"k":"dry_season","v":{"s":"Dry Season"}},{"k":"arid_conditions_energy_production_up_w","v":{"s":"Arid conditions. Energy production up, water down."}},{"k":"storm_season","v":{"s":"Storm Season"}},{"k":"electromagnetic_storms_science_surges_","v":{"s":"Electromagnetic storms. Science surges, buildings at risk."}},{"k":"calm_season","v":{"s":"Calm Season"}},{"k":"stable_conditions_all_production_norma","v":{"s":"Stable conditions. All production normal."}},{"k":"fertile_plains","v":{"s":"Fertile Plains"}},{"k":"mountains","v":{"s":"Mountains"}},{"k":"volcanic","v":{"s":"Volcanic"}},{"k":"ice_fields","v":{"s":"Ice Fields"}},{"k":"desert","v":{"s":"Desert"}},{"k":"ocean","v":{"s":"Ocean"}},{"k":"radiation_zone","v":{"s":"Radiation Zone"}},{"k":"colony_base","v":{"s":"Colony Base"}},{"k":"dr_elena_vasquez","v":{"s":"Dr. Elena Vasquez"}},{"k":"cmdr_james_chen","v":{"s":"Cmdr. James Chen"}},{"k":"dr_aisha_okafor","v":{"s":"Dr. Aisha Okafor"}},{"k":"dr_yuki_tanaka","v":{"s":"Dr. Yuki Tanaka"}},{"k":"prof_raj_patel","v":{"s":"Prof. Raj Patel"}},{"k":"dr_marta_schmidt","v":{"s":"Dr. Marta Schmidt"}},{"k":"hydroponics_bay","v":{"s":"Hydroponics Bay"}},{"k":"grows_food_using_nutrient_rich_water_p","v":{"s":"Grows food using nutrient-rich water. Photosynthesis converts CO₂ and water into glucos