"k":"magnitude_explanation","v":{"s":"Explain dimensional reasoning across orders of magnitude"}},{"k":"action","v":{"s":"Action"}},{"k":"learning_steps","v":{"s":"Learning steps"}},{"k":"same_quantity","v":{"s":"Same quantity; different units"}},{"k":"zero_quantity","v":{"s":"Zero in either unit: neither bar is filled."}},{"k":"equal_length_explanation","v":{"s":"Both bars represent the same quantity. The unit changes how we name it, not how much there is. Divisions show equal tenths of that quantity."}},{"k":"predict_larger","v":{"s":"Larger"}},{"k":"predict_smaller","v":{"s":"Smaller"}},{"k":"predict_same","v":{"s":"The same"}},{"k":"predict_zero_reason","v":{"s":"Zero stays zero when changing between these units."}},{"k":"predict_same_reason","v":{"s":"These units have the same size, so the numerical value stays the same."}},{"k":"predict_smaller_unit_reason","v":{"s":"The new unit is smaller. More of those units are needed to name the same quantity, so the number is larger."}},{"k":"predict_larger_unit_reason","v":{"s":"The new unit is larger. Fewer of those units are needed to name the same quantity, so the number is smaller."}},{"k":"prediction_activity","v":{"s":"Conversion prediction"}},{"k":"predict_before_converting","v":{"s":"Predict before revealing the result"}},{"k":"predict_supported_quantities","v":{"s":"Choose a valid nonnegative quantity outside the temperature category to compare unit sizes."}},{"k":"predict_question","v":{"s":"Will the numerical value become larger, smaller, or stay the same? Think about the size of one unit."}},{"k":"your_prediction","v":{"s":"Your prediction"}},{"k":"check_prediction","v":{"s":"Compare with my prediction"}},{"k":"prediction_matches","v":{"s":"Your prediction matches. "}},{"k":"prediction_revisit","v":{"s":"Revisit your prediction. "}},{"k":"result_waiting","v":{"s":"Result hidden while you predict"}},{"k":"formula_after_prediction","v":{"s":"The equation will appear after you compare your prediction."}},{"k":"