","v":{"s":"cards"}},{"k":"vignettes","v":{"s":"vignettes"}},{"k":"m1_teaser","v":{"s":"The two dimensions under the famous four styles — and why \"correlates with\" is doing heavy lifting."}},{"k":"m2_open_sr","v":{"s":"Opened module two: attachment."}},{"k":"m2_title","v":{"s":"M2 — Attachment: the theory vs. the brand"}},{"k":"serves","v":{"s":"serves"}},{"k":"m2_teaser","v":{"s":"Bowlby and Ainsworth vs. the lifestyle brand that borrowed their name — plus the Serve & Return studio."}},{"k":"m3_open_sr","v":{"s":"Opened module three: the R C T core."}},{"k":"m3_title","v":{"s":"M3 — The RCT core"}},{"k":"moves","v":{"s":"moves"}},{"k":"m3_teaser","v":{"s":"PCIT, Incredible Years, PMT — the five skills they all share, and time-out said honestly."}},{"k":"m4_open_sr","v":{"s":"Opened module four: PRIDE skills studio."}},{"k":"m4_title","v":{"s":"M4 — PRIDE Skills Studio"}},{"k":"lines","v":{"s":"lines"}},{"k":"m4_teaser","v":{"s":"Five minutes where the child is the boss — label a play session line by line."}},{"k":"m5_open_sr","v":{"s":"Opened module five: A B C at home."}},{"k":"m5_title","v":{"s":"M5 — ABC at Home"}},{"k":"scenes","v":{"s":"scenes"}},{"k":"m5_teaser","v":{"s":"The checkout-line tantrum analyzed, the extinction burst, and the escalation trap that trains everyone."}},{"k":"m6_open_sr","v":{"s":"Opened module six: discipline evidence."}},{"k":"m6_title","v":{"s":"M6 — Discipline: what the evidence says"}},{"k":"claims","v":{"s":"claims"}},{"k":"m6_teaser","v":{"s":"The spanking consensus, what to use instead, reward charts done right, and the ratio."}},{"k":"m7_open_sr","v":{"s":"Opened module seven: myths versus literature."}},{"k":"m7_title","v":{"s":"M7 — Myths vs. literature"}},{"k":"m7_teaser","v":{"s":"Praise junkies, screen-time panic, self-esteem, birth order — badge the claims yourself."}},{"k":"m8_open_sr","v":{"s":"Opened module eight: adolescents."}},{"k":"m8_title","v":{"s":"M8 — Adolescents: autonomy and staying in the room"}},{"k":"m8_teaser","v":{"s":"The monitoring plot twist: knowledge flows from relationship, not surveillance."}},{"k":"m9_open_sr","v":{"s":"Opened module nine: getting help and partnering with school."}},{"k":"m9_title","v":{"s":"M9 — When to seek help + partnering with school"}},{"k":"prep","v":{"s":"prep items"}},{"k":"m9_teaser","v":{"s":"Red flags as four dials, therapy names decoded, IEP/504 in plain English, and the meeting-prep checklist."}},{"k":"serve_return_sr","v":{"s":"That is a return. Explanation shown below."}},{"k":"serve_miss_sr","v":{"s":"That one ends the rally. Explanation shown below."}},{"k":"serves_title","v":{"s":"Serve & Return studio"}},{"k":"serves_sub","v":{"s":"Each scene is a serve. Pick the response that returns it. Misses are universal in every family — this is practice, not scoring."}},{"k":"serves_next","v":{"s":"Next serve →"}},{"k":"serves_done","v":{"s":"All serves played. Repair counts as a return served late — and the RCT core module turns this loop into daily skills."}},{"k":"tag_hit_sr","v":{"s":"Correct tag. Explanation shown below."}},{"k":"tag_miss_sr","v":{"s":"Different tag than intended. Explanation shown below."}},{"k":"moves_title","v":{"s":"Tag the skill"}},{"k":"moves_sub","v":{"s":"Each scene shows one concrete parent move from the trial-supported programs. Which shared skill is it?"}},{"k":"moves_group","v":{"s":"Choose the skill"}},{"k":"moves_next","v":{"s":"Next move →"}},{"k":"moves_done","v":{"s":"All moves tagged. These five skills are the trial-supported core — small, practicable, and learnable by anyone."}},{"k":"pride_title","v":{"s":"Label the play session"}},{"k":"pride_sub","v":{"s":"A five-minute block session, one parent line at a time. Tag each line as a PRIDE skill or one of the three avoids. The avoids are normal parenting everywhere else — special time just practices switching them off."}},{"k":"pride_group","v":{"s":"Choose the label"}},{"k":"pride_next","v":{"s":"Next line →"}},{"k":"pride_done","v":{"s":"Transcript labeled. Five minutes of this daily is the opening move of the trial-supported programs — and the deposit the ABC module spends."}},{"k":"abc_title","v":{"s":"What job is the behavior doing?"}},{"k":"abc_sub","v":{"s":"Read each scene as an ABC: what sets the stage, what the child does, what the behavior earns. Then tag the job. Remember the fifth card: a function is a description, not a verdict."}},{"k":"abc_group","v":{"s":"Choose the function"}},{"k":"abc_next","v":{"s":"Next scene →"}},{"k":"abc_done","v":{"s":"All scenes analyzed. BehaviorLab teaches this science with full rigor; the School Behavior Toolkit shows the school side of the same triangle."}},{"k":"claims_title","v":{"s":"Tier the claims yourself"}},{"k":"claims_sub","v":{"s":"This module IS the badge system in action. Place each claim on the evidence tier it deserves."}},{"k":"claims_group","v":{"s":"Choose the evidence tier"}},{"k":"claims_next","v":{"s":"Next claim →"}},{"k":"claims_done","v":{"s":"All claims tiered. That skill — asking \"which tier is this?\" before \"should I do this?\" — is the one this lab most wants to send home."}},{"k":"myths_title","v":{"s":"Badge the claim"}},{"k":"myths_sub","v":{"s":"Headlines never carry evidence badges. Practice adding them yourself."}},{"k":"myths_group","v":{"s":"Choose the evidence tier"}},{"k":"myths_next","v":{"s":"Next claim →"}},{"k":"myths_done","v":{"s":"All claims badged. The pattern to keep: vivid and universal is not the same as true."}},{"k":"stance_title","v":{"s":"Support, control, or abdication?"}},{"k":"stance_sub","v":{"s":"Tag each response with the stance it embodies. Autonomy support keeps both the limit AND the relationship."}},{"k":"stance_group","v":{"s":"Choose the stance"}},{"k":"stance_next","v":{"s":"Next scene →"}},{"k":"stance_done","v":{"s":"All scenes tagged. The through-line since Module 2: the relationship is the channel everything else travels on."}},{"k":"prep_done_sr","v":{"s":"Every prep item checked. You are ready for the meeting."}},{"k":"prep_title","v":{"s":"Meeting-prep checklist"}},{"k":"prep_sub","v":{"s":"Check items as you prepare. This list saves with the tool — reset it before each new meeting by unchecking."}},{"k":"dials_match_sr","v":{"s":"Your ratings match the intended reading. Explanation shown below."}},{"k":"dials_differ_sr","v":{"s":"Your ratings differ from the intended reading. Explanation shown below."}},{"k":"dial_high","v":{"s":"High"}},{"k":"dial_low","v":{"s":"Low"}},{"k":"dial_depends","v":{"s":"Depends on context"}},{"k":"dials_title","v":{"s":"The Two Dials — rate each scene"}},{"k":"dials_sub","v":{"s":"Rate warmth and structure separately. The same scene can be high on both — that is the whole point of dials over boxes. One scene is a moment, not a style."}},{"k":"dial_warmth","v":{"s":"Warmth (responsiveness)"}},{"k":"dial_structure","v":{"s":"Structure (demandingness)"}},{"k":"dials_check","v":{"s":"Check my reading"}},{"k":"dials_match","v":{"s":"Your reading matches the intended one."}},{"k":"dials_differ","v":{"s":"A different reading — which is fine. Here is the intended one:"}},{"k":"dials_next","v":{"s":"Next scene →"}},{"k":"dials_done","v":{"s":"All scenes rated. The RCT core module (in expert review) picks up where the dials leave off: the specific skills with trial evidence."}},{"k":"saved_rules","v":{"s":"Rules I want to ask about"}},{"k":"saved_rules_sub","v":{"s":"Saved from the Education Law Navigator. Bring the citation, not a paraphrase."}}],"id":613}},{"k":"citylab","v":{"o":[{"k":"map_view","v":{"s":"Map view"}},{"k":"keyboard","v":{"s":"Keyboard"}},{"k":"close","v":{"s":"Close"}},{"k":"100_m_one_parcel_one_hectare","v":{"s":"100 m, one parcel, one hectare"}},{"k":"the_3d_model_is_not_available_on_this_","v":{"s":"The 3D model is not available on this device."}},{"k":"building_the_model","v":{"s":"Building the model..."}},{"k":"move_the_camera","v":{"s":"Move the camera"}},{"k":"the_river_is_terrain_not_zoning