nd marked a hard year."}},{"k":"memory_result_wide","v":{"s":"Carbon allocated to wood produced one of the wider rings in the years shown."}},{"k":"memory_result_wide_k2","v":{"s":"Plenty of carbon reached the wood, making one of the wider rings shown."}},{"k":"memory_ring_change","v":{"s":"Ring-width change"}},{"k":"memory_ring_width","v":{"s":"Ring width"}},{"k":"memory_selected","v":{"s":"Selected "}},{"k":"memory_showing","v":{"s":"Showing last "}},{"k":"memory_story_label","v":{"s":"What this year records"}},{"k":"memory_story_label_k2","v":{"s":"What this ring remembers"}},{"k":"memory_stress_year","v":{"s":"A stress year in the wood"}},{"k":"memory_surplus","v":{"s":"surplus"}},{"k":"memory_timeline_label","v":{"s":"Recent annual growth rings"}},{"k":"memory_title","v":{"s":"Tree Memory: a yearbook written in wood"}},{"k":"memory_title_k2","v":{"s":"The tree remembers every year"}},{"k":"memory_trend_baseline","v":{"s":"First recorded year"}},{"k":"memory_trend_baseline_k2","v":{"s":"The story starts here"}},{"k":"memory_trend_narrower","v":{"s":"A narrower ring"}},{"k":"memory_trend_narrower_k2","v":{"s":"Less wood than last year"}},{"k":"memory_trend_recovery","v":{"s":"Recovery after stress"}},{"k":"memory_trend_recovery_k2","v":{"s":"The tree bounced back"}},{"k":"memory_trend_setback","v":{"s":"A new stress signal"}},{"k":"memory_trend_setback_k2","v":{"s":"A harder year arrived"}},{"k":"memory_trend_steady","v":{"s":"A similar ring"}},{"k":"memory_trend_steady_k2","v":{"s":"A similar year"}},{"k":"memory_trend_wider","v":{"s":"A wider ring"}},{"k":"memory_trend_wider_k2","v":{"s":"More wood than last year"}},{"k":"memory_unknown_limit","v":{"s":"Unknown factor"}},{"k":"memory_years","v":{"s":" years"}},{"k":"metres_tall_short","v":{"s":"m tall"}},{"k":"mission_change","v":{"s":"Change one thing"}},{"k":"mission_change_k2","v":{"s":"Change sunlight or water"}},{"k":"mission_change_note","v":{"s":"Shape the conditions or carbon split."}},{"k":"mission_change_note_k2","v":{"s":"Move one slider or try a short drought."}},{"k":"mission_explain","v":{"s":"Explain the evidence"}},{"k":"mission_explain_k2","v":{"s":"Tell what happened"}},{"k":"mission_explain_note","v":{"s":"Predict, test, and tell the biological story."}},{"k":"mission_explain_note_k2","v":{"s":"Use a clue from what you saw."}},{"k":"mission_grow","v":{"s":"Let time pass"}},{"k":"mission_grow_10","v":{"s":"Grow 10 years"}},{"k":"mission_grow_k2","v":{"s":"Let 10 years pass"}},{"k":"mission_grow_note","v":{"s":"Grow the tree and watch its budget respond."}},{"k":"mission_grow_note_k2","v":{"s":"Watch what changes in the tree."}},{"k":"mission_label","v":{"s":"Your field mission"}},{"k":"mission_sub","v":{"s":"Start small: change one thing, let time pass, then use the limiting factor and carbon budget to explain what happened."}},{"k":"mission_sub_k2","v":{"s":"Try one change. Grow 10 years. Then tell what helped or hurt your tree."}},{"k":"mission_title","v":{"s":"Grow a tree that can make the next generation"}},{"k":"mission_try_drought","v":{"s":"Try a 3-year drought"}},{"k":"mixed_k2","v":{"s":"Shoots stayed close while seeds reached farther. Both ways added new trees this time."}},{"k":"modelled_daily_flow","v":{"s":"Modelled daily flow"}},{"k":"needles","v":{"s":"Needles"}},{"k":"new_leaves","v":{"s":"New leaves"}},{"k":"new_leaves_lower","v":{"s":"new leaves"}},{"k":"new_mix_k2","v":{"s":"Different"}},{"k":"new_tree_started_many_k2","v":{"s":"new trees started growing"}},{"k":"new_tree_started_one_k2","v":{"s":"new tree started growing"}},{"k":"new_trees_started_k2","v":{"s":"new trees started"}},{"k":"next_discovery","v":{"s":"Next discovery"}},{"k":"no_annual_surplus","v":{"s":"No whole-year surplus to divide"}},{"k":"no_annual_surplus_note","v":{"s":"Across the modelled year, the tree spends more than it makes. Stored sugar covers the deficit, so the annual growth plan pauses until carbon income returns. Sinks become the source."}},{"k":"no_budget_k2","v":{"s":"No food is saved for new trees yet. Go back to Grow, save some food for seeds, and let years pass."}},{"k":"no_prediction","v":{"s":"No strategy prediction yet"}},{"k":"no_prediction_copy","v":{"s":"Commit carbon, then predict establishment, distance, and diversity before running the decade."}},{"k":"no_prediction_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Move a slider, then say what you think will grow and where."}},{"k":"no_prediction_k2","v":{"s":"Choose before you guess"}},{"k":"no_scheduled_drought","v":{"s":"No scheduled drought"}},{"k":"none_established_lesson","v":{"s":"No descendants established this decade. That is evidence about this event and this wager, not proof that the strategy can never work. Change one part of the plan and compare another decade."}},{"k":"none_established_lesson_k2","v":{"s":"No new tree started this time. One try is not enough to know. Change one choice and try again."}},{"k":"none_survived","v":{"s":"No species survived the full run"}},{"k":"notice","v":{"s":"Notice"}},{"k":"observe","v":{"s":"Observe"}},{"k":"of","v":{"s":"of"}},{"k":"only_variable","v":{"s":"Only variable"}},{"k":"outcome_eyebrow","v":{"s":"Decade outcome"}},{"k":"over_bank","v":{"s":"beyond the bank"}},{"k":"over_bank_k2","v":{"s":"too much used"}},{"k":"overcommitted_k2","v":{"s":"You used more saved food than the tree has. Pull one slider back."}},{"k":"oxygen_output","v":{"s":"Oxygen"}},{"k":"phenology_broad_autumn_detail","v":{"s":"Pigments show; leaves detach"}},{"k":"phenology_broad_autumn_title","v":{"s":"Color + leaf fall"}},{"k":"phenology_broad_process","v":{"s":"As chlorophyll breaks down, other pigments become visible. The tree reclaims some nutrients, forms an abscission layer that seals the twig, and the leaf detaches. Species and weather change the timing and colors."}},{"k":"phenology_broad_process_k2","v":{"s":"Green fades, the tree saves useful materials, a tiny seal forms, and the leaves let go."}},{"k":"phenology_broad_spring_detail","v":{"s":"New leaves unfold"}},{"k":"phenology_broad_spring_title","v":{"s":"Budburst"}},{"k":"phenology_broad_summer_detail","v":{"s":"Chlorophyll captures light"}},{"k":"phenology_broad_summer_title","v":{"s":"Full green canopy"}},{"k":"phenology_broad_winter_detail","v":{"s":"Dormant buds wait"}},{"k":"phenology_broad_winter_title","v":{"s":"Bare branches"}},{"k":"phenology_habit_broad","v":{"s":"Deciduous broadleaf"}},{"k":"phenology_habit_needle","v":{"s":"Evergreen needles"}},{"k":"phenology_label","v":{"s":"Seasonal leaf-life calendar"}},{"k":"phenology_needle_autumn_detail","v":{"s":"Small cohorts turn and drop"}},{"k":"phenology_needle_autumn_title","v":{"s":"Older needles shed"}},{"k":"phenology_needle_process","v":{"s":"Evergreen means foliage is retained across seasons, not forever. Pines shed older needle cohorts gradually, and the accumulating needles form forest-floor duff."}},{"k":"phenology_needle_spring_detail","v":{"s":"Fresh needles expand"}},{"k":"phenology_needle_spring_title","v":{"s":"New candle growth"}},{"k":"phenology_needle_summer_detail","v":{"s":"Several age groups stay green"}},{"k":"phenology_needle_summer_title","v":{"s":"Needles working"}},{"k":"phenology_needle_winter_detail","v":{"s":"Foliage spans seasons"}},{"k":"phenology_needle_winter_title","v":{"s":"Needles retained"}},{"k":"phenology_title","v":{"s":"Leaf-life calendar"}},{"k":"phenology_title_k2","v":{"s":"A leaf's year"}},{"k":"phloem","v":{"s":"Phloem"}},{"k":"phloem_route_autumn_alt","v":{"s":"Autumn sugar route: leaves through phloem to storage in roots and trunk."}},{"k":"phloem_route_spring_alt","v":{"s":"Sugar route right now: stored reserves to phloem to new leaves."}},{"k":"phloem_route_summer_alt","v":{"s":"Sugar route right now: leaves to phloem to growing tissues and roots."}},{"k":"phloem_route_winter_alt","v":{"s":"Winter sugar route: stored reserves through phloem to living tissues."}},{"k":"photosynthesis","v":{"s":"Photosynthesis"}},{"k":"photosynthesis_stopped","v":{"s":"Photosynthesis has stopped"}},{"k":"photosynthesis_stopped_copy","v":{"s":"After a tree dies, its leaves no longer exchange gases or add sugar to the carbon budget. The response curves and bottleneck only describe a living tree, so they pause here."}},{"k":"photosynthesis_stopped_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Its leaves can no longer use sunlight, water, and air to make sugar. Start a new seedling to watch the leaf kitchen work again."}},{"k":"photosynthesis_stopped_k2","v":{"s":"This tree has stopped making food"}},{"k":"plan_clone","v":{"s":"Betting on reliability"}},{"k":"plan_clone_copy","v":{"s":"Your copies are likely to establish nearby, with the same genes and often the same roots."}},{"k":"plan_clone_copy_k2","v":{"s":"New shoots often start nearby and grow much like the parent tree."}},{"k":"plan_clone_k2","v":{"s":"Growing near the parent"}},{"k":"plan_empty","v":{"s":"Build your strategy"}},{"k":"plan_empty_copy","v":{"s":"Move at least one carbon slider. The model will turn that investment into attempts."}},{"k":"plan_empty_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Move one slider. You can try seeds, shoots, or both."}},{"k":"plan_empty_k2","v":{"s":"Pick a way to begin"}},{"k":"plan_mixed","v":{"s":"A hedged forest"}},{"k":"plan_mixed_copy","v":{"s":"Some descendants can travel and differ; others stay close and establish more reliably."}},{"k":"plan_mixed_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Seeds can travel farther. Shoots often start growing close to the parent."}},{"k":"plan_mixed_k2","v":{"s":"Two kinds of chances"}},{"k":"plan_seed","v":{"s":"Betting on variation"}},{"k":"plan_seed_copy","v":{"s":"Your attempts can travel and recombine, but most will fail before establishment."}},{"k":"plan_seed_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Seeds may land far away and be different from the parent, but many will not start growing."}},{"k":"plan_seed_k2","v":{"s":"Sending seeds out"}},{"k":"predict","v":{"s":"Predict"}},{"k":"predict_clone","v":{"s":"Reliability leads the wager"}},{"k":"predict_clone_copy","v":{"s":"Expect high nearby establishment, low genetic variety, and shared vulnerabilities."}},{"k":"predict_mix","v":{"s":"A mixed plan trades reach for reliability"}},{"k":"predict_mix_copy","v":{"s":"Predict more nearby establishment from clones and more distance and variation from seeds."}},{"k":"predict_mix_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Guess which kind will start more often and which will travel farther."}},{"k":"predict_mix_k2","v":{"s":"Seeds should spread; shoots should stay close"}},{"k":"predict_seed","v":{"s":"Reach and variation lead the wager"}},{"k":"predict_seed_copy","v":{"s":"Expect lower establishment but wider dispersal and new genetic combinations."}},{"k":"predict_seed_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Many seeds may not grow, but the ones that do can land far from the parent."}},{"k":"predict_seed_k2","v":{"s":"Seeds may travel farther"}},{"k":"predict_shoot_copy_k2","v":{"s":"The new shoots should stay close and grow much like the parent."}},{"k":"predict_shoot_k2","v":{"s":"Shoots may start more often nearby"}},{"k":"question_navigation","v":{"s":"Question navigation"}},{"k":"questions_explored","v":{"s":"Questions explored"}},{"k":"quiz_eyebrow","v":{"s":"Canopy of understanding"}},{"k":"read_decade","v":{"s":"Read the decade"}},{"k":"read_decade_copy","v":{"s":"Connect the event, the survivor counts, and the spatial pattern."}},{"k":"read_decade_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Use the weather card, the number that grew, and where the marks landed."}},{"k":"read_decade_k2","v":{"s":"Read what happened"}},{"k":"read_strategies","v":{"s":"Read the strategies"}},{"k":"read_strategies_copy","v":{"s":"Trace each outcome back to tolerance, defense, lifespan, and reproductive route."}},{"k":"ready_to_use_k2","v":{"s":"ready to use"}},{"k":"reasoning","v":{"s":"Reasoning"}},{"k":"reasoning_copy","v":{"s":"Link the evidence to a biological mechanism."}},{"k":"reasoning_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Tell how the clue supports your idea."}},{"k":"record_clonal_k2","v":{"s":"Most of your new trees grew as nearby shoots. They started often, stayed close, and shared the parent's traits."}},{"k":"record_eyebrow","v":{"s":"Forest legacy"}},{"k":"record_k2","v":{"s":"Your forest story so far"}},{"k":"record_mixed_k2","v":{"s":"You used both ways: nearby shoots that started often and seeds that reached farther."}},{"k":"record_one_round_k2","v":{"s":"One try is a clue, not the whole answer. Try another plan or another kind of weather."}},{"k":"record_seed_k2","v":{"s":"Most of your new trees came from seeds. They spread farther and were different from the parent, but many tries did not grow."}},{"k":"record_sub_k2","v":{"s":"Every ten-year try you have made with this tree."}},{"k":"reflection_clearing","v":{"s":"Reflection clearing"}},{"k":"relative_reach","v":{"s":"Relative reach"}},{"k":"relative_reach_k2","v":{"s":"How far it goes"}},{"k":"release_decade","v":{"s":"Release the decade"}},{"k":"release_decade_copy","v":{"s":"Lock in the carbon wager, then let chance and disturbance act."}},{"k":"release_decade_copy_k2","v":{"s":"Use the saved food, then see which new trees start growing."}},{"k":"release_decade_k2","v":{"s":"Let 10 years pass"}},{"k":"released_to_air","v":{"s":"Released to air"}},{"k":"reproduction_bank","v":{"s":"Reproduction bank"}},{"k":"reproduction_bank_k2","v":{"s":"Food saved for new trees"}},{"k":"result_explain","v":{"s":"Connect the disturbance to each route's establishment, distance, and shared or varied genes."}},{"k":"result_explain_k2","v":{"s":"Use the event, the number that grew, and the map to tell why this result makes sense."}},{"k":"review_questions","v":{"s":"Review the questions"}},{"k":"revise_model","v":{"s":"Not yet - revise the model"}},{"k":"revise_model_k2","v":{"s":"Not yet - look at the clue"}},{"k":"revisit_connected","v":{"s":"You connected this idea before. Revisit it to make the explanation even stronger."}},{"k":"roots_trunk","v":{"s":"Roots + trunk"}},{"k":"roots_trunk_lower","v":{"s":"roots and trunk"}},{"k":"route_absorb","v":{