catalog entry is content-bound, but this PD engine cannot verify its digest."}},{"k":"catalog_this_draft_is_too_large_to_store","v":{"s":"This draft is too large to store on the My modules shelf."}},{"k":"catalog_this_draft_needs_accessibility_authoring_fi","v":{"s":"This draft needs accessibility-authoring fixes before it can run"}},{"k":"catalog_this_module_content_digest_could_not_be_veri","v":{"s":"This module content digest could not be verified."}},{"k":"catalog_this_module_does_not_match_the_content_diges","v":{"s":"This module does not match the content digest in the approved catalog."}},{"k":"catalog_this_module_identity_does_not_match_the_appr","v":{"s":"This module identity does not match the approved catalog."}},{"k":"catalog_this_module_language_does_not_match_the_appr","v":{"s":"This module language does not match the approved catalog."}},{"k":"catalog_this_module_needs_accessibility_authoring_fi","v":{"s":"This module needs accessibility-authoring fixes before it can run."}},{"k":"catalog_this_module_version_does_not_match_the_appro","v":{"s":"This module version does not match the approved catalog."}},{"k":"catalog_title_topic_summary","v":{"s":"title, topic, summary…"}},{"k":"catalog_top_level_value_must_be_a_json_object","v":{"s":"Top-level value must be a JSON object."}},{"k":"catalog_type_your_response","v":{"s":"Type your response…"}},{"k":"catalog_unsupported_credential_profile","v":{"s":"Unsupported credential profile."}},{"k":"catalog_what_do_you_do","v":{"s":"What do you do?"}},{"k":"catalog_write_how_you_would_open_this_conversation","v":{"s":"Write how you would open and carry this conversation…"}},{"k":"catalog_write_how_you_would_respond","v":{"s":"Write how you would respond…"}},{"k":"catalog_you_reached_an_ending","v":{"s":"You reached an ending — this scenario is complete."}},{"k":"error_reporter_badge_aria","v":{"s":"View captured errors and report a bug"}},{"k":"adminhub","v":{"o":[{"k":"mtss_title","v":{"s":"MTSS Triage"}},{"k":"mtss_desc","v":{"s":"Screening scores against YOUR benchmark cut points: suggested risk bands for team review (never automatic placement), intervention grouping, and window-over-window progress."}},{"k":"announcements_title","v":{"s":"Family Announcements"}},{"k":"announcements_desc","v":{"s":"One announcement, every family language: AI-translated with human review, exported as accessible lang-tagged documents with a translation disclosure — the whole-building packet the Bridge’s live messaging doesn’t cover."}},{"k":"evaluation_title","v":{"s":"Educator Evaluation"}},{"k":"evaluation_desc","v":{"s":"Opens your connected district evaluation portal; otherwise your private on-device workspace — completion and weighting views, walkthroughs, formal observations, SPM / SLO, dialogue, receipts, and audit history, with framework profiles for PA Act 13 and Maine PEPG."}},{"k":"walkthrough_title","v":{"s":"UDL Walkthrough"}},{"k":"walkthrough_desc","v":{"s":"Growth-framed classroom visits scored against UDL 3.0 look-fors — feedback cards for teachers, a building heatmap, trends, and inter-rater checks for research use."}},{"k":"walkthrough_copilot_title","v":{"s":"Walkthrough Copilot"}},{"k":"walkthrough_copilot_desc","v":{"s":"Turn shorthand walkthrough notes into evidence-based coaching feedback you write and approve — every claim cited back to your own notes, with practice scenarios for building the habit. Formative coaching only; never rates anyone."}},{"k":"dispro_title","v":{"s":"Disproportionality Analyzer"}},{"k":"dispro_desc","v":{"s":"Risk indexes, risk ratios, and composition from aggregate discipline or identification counts — stability cautions, alternate ratios for small groups, multi-year trends."}},{"k":"timelines_title","v":{"s":"SpEd Timelines"}},{"k":"timelines_desc","v":{"s":"Evaluation clocks, IEP annuals, and triennials on one urgency dashboard with per-provider caseloads — student codes only; due dates are editable prefills you confirm against your state rule."}},{"k":"eligibility_title","v":{"s":"Diagnosis, Evaluation & School Eligibility"}},{"k":"eligibility_desc","v":{"s":"Compare clinical diagnosis, IDEA, and Section 504; follow the evaluation path; review federal definitions, safeguards, and timelines; explore open-question cases; and build a privacy-safe meeting-preparation guide. Never decides eligibility, services, or placement."}},{"k":"meetings_title","v":{"s":"Meeting Documentation"}},{"k":"meetings_desc","v":{"s":"Turn notes or a transcript into your district’s meeting format — SST, IEP team, 504, and custom templates — with source-anchored decisions, an action-item tracker, and local name masking before any AI call."}},{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Leadership Hub"}},{"k":"subtitle","v":{"s":"Tools for principals, coaches, and student-services leaders"}},{"k":"close_aria","v":{"s":"Close Leadership Hub"}},{"k":"covenant","v":{"s":"How this suite handles information: analysis tools use aggregate counts or de-identified codes. Everything you enter stays in your signed-in profile on this device and is never uploaded, protected by your device sign-in rather than by separate encryption. Connecting a district portal adds shared, authenticated records staff can see and acknowledge. Apply your district’s retention rules, and keep a backup so a lost device is not a lost year. Human review stays in control—never an automated verdict about a teacher or student."}},{"k":"guide_link","v":{"s":"Leader’s guide: how to use these tools"}},{"k":"backup_title","v":{"s":"Back up this hub"}},{"k":"backup_desc","v":{"s":"Everything above lives only in this browser. Download one file with all of it, and restore on a new device or after a wipe."}},{"k":"backup_empty","v":{"s":"Nothing to back up yet — the hub tools have no saved data on this device."}},{"k":"backup_done","v":{"s":"Backup downloaded ({count} saved items). Keep it where you keep confidential files."}},{"k":"backup_failed","v":{"s":"Backup failed: "}},{"k":"backup_export","v":{"s":"Download backup"}},{"k":"restore_not_backup","v":{"s":"That file is not a Leadership Hub backup."}},{"k":"restore_empty","v":{"s":"The backup contains no hub data."}},{"k":"restore_confirm","v":{"s":"Restore this backup, dated {date}?"}},{"k":"restore_done_skipped","v":{"s":"Restored {count} items; {skipped} entries outside the hub were ignored. Reopen a tool to see its data."}},{"k":"restore_done","v":{"s":"Restored {count} items. Reopen a tool to see its data."}},{"k":"restore_failed","v":{"s":"Restore failed: "}},{"k":"backup_restore","v":{"s":"Restore from backup"}},{"k":"backup_caveat","v":{"s":"The file contains whatever the tools store — codes, notes, and settings. Treat it like the confidential records it may describe, and delete old copies per your retention policy."}},{"k":"drive_unchanged","v":{"s":"No changes since the last Drive backup."}},{"k":"drive_saved","v":{"s":"Backup saved to your school Drive ({count} items)."}},{"k":"drive_auto_failed","v":{"s":"Automatic Drive backup failed: "}},{"k":"drive_setup_open","v":{"s":"Set up automatic Drive backup (school Google account)"}},{"k":"drive_setup_intro","v":{"s":"A 3-minute script on your school-managed Google account saves this hub to your Drive automatically — covered by your district’s data agreement. Follow the setup steps in the leader’s guide, then paste the web-app URL and token here."}},{"k":"drive_url_placeholder","v":{"s":"Web app URL ending in /exec"}},{"k":"drive_token_placeholder","v":{"s":"From setup()"}},{"k":"drive_connected","v":{"s":"Drive backup connected. Saving a first backup now…"}},{"k":"drive_connect_failed","v":{"s":"Could not connect: "}},{"k":"drive_connect_hint","v":{"s":" — check the URL ends in /exec, the token matches setup(), and the deployment allows Anyone."}},{"k":"drive_connecting","v":{"s":"Connecting…"}},{"k":"drive_connect","v":{"s":"Connect & test"}},{"k":"drive_on","v":{"s":"Drive auto-backup on"}},{"k":"drive_last_saved","v":{"s":"last saved {time}"}},{"k":"drive_not_yet","v":{"s":"no backup saved yet"}},{"k":"drive_save_failed","v":{"s":"Drive backup failed: "}},{"k":"drive_saving","v":{"s":"Saving…"}},{"k":"drive_save_now","v":{"s":"Back up to Drive now"}},{"k":"drive_disconnect_confirm","v":{"s":"Stop backing up to Drive? Existing backups stay in your Drive folder; only the connection on this device is removed."}},{"k":"drive_disconnected","v":{"s":"Drive backup disconnected."}},{"k":"drive_disconnect","v":{"s":"Disconnect"}},{"k":"restore_item_one","v":{"s":"item"}},{"k":"restore_item_many","v":{"s":"items"}},{"k":"restore_confirm_effect","v":{"s":"Data for these tools on this device will be replaced by the backup. Tools not listed are left alone, and nothing outside the Leadership Hub is touched."}},{"k":"drive_url_label","v":{"s":"Web app URL"}},{"k":"drive_token_label","v":{"s":"Backup token"}},{"k":"guide_link_aria","v":{"s":"Leader’s guide: how to use these tools (opens in a new tab)"}}],"id":752}},{"k":"readinglib_open_rn_mirror_notice","v":{"s":"Accessibility-ready Open RN chapter mirror · CC BY 4.0 · educational material only. Follow current clinical policy, instructor guidance, and professional standards for patient-care decisions."}},{"k":"concept_quest","v":{"o":[{"k":"solo_gm_turn","v":{"s":"Turn {turn}"}},{"k":"solo_gm_your_message","v":{"s":"Your message"}},{"k":"solo_gm_history_count","v":{"s":"{count} entries"}},{"k":"solo_gm_history","v":{"s":"Recent conversation"}},{"k":"solo_numeric_invalid","v":{"s":"Check that the value is a valid number and that any units in both fields agree."}},{"k":"solo_numeric_help","v":{"s":"Enter a number, decimal, or fraction. Include units when the question requires them."}},{"k":"solo_latest_review","v":{"s":"Review this idea again"}},{"k":"solo_latest_correct","v":{"s":"Correct on the most recent attempt"}},{"k":"solo_review_understood","v":{"s":"Self-reviewed: key ideas understood"}},{"k":"solo_review_needs_practice","v":{"s":"Self-reviewed: more practice requested"}},{"k":"solo_not_reached","v":{"s":"Not reached"}},{"k":"solo_review_all_items","v":{"s":"Review all {count} assessment items"}},{"k":"solo_first_accuracy","v":{"s":"{accuracy}% correct on first attempts. The score above uses your most recent attempt for each automatically scored item."}},{"k":"solo_item_score","v":{"s":"{score} / {maximum} for this item."}},{"k":"solo_partly_correct","v":{"s":"Partly correct. Review the answer guide before your next turn."}},{"k":"solo_items_seen","v":{"s":"Items explored"}},{"k":"solo_gm_action_explain","v":{"s":"Explain an idea"}},{"k":"solo_gm_action_talk","v":{"s":"Talk to the guide"}},{"k":"solo_gm_action_investigate","v":{"s":"Investigate"}},{"k":"solo_gm_rules_notice","v":{"s":"Story conversations help you reason. Use the question and path controls to change game progress."}},{"k":"solo_gm_send","v":{"s":"Send to game master"}},{"k":"solo_gm_placeholder","v":{"s":"Describe what you investigate, ask a question, or explain your reasoning."}},{"k":"solo_gm_your_action","v":{"s":"Your action or explanation"}},{"k":"solo_gm_action_type","v":{"s":"What would you like to do?"}},{"k":"solo_gm_suggestions","v":{"s":"Suggested actions"}},{"k":"solo_gm_lesson_evidence","v":{"s":"From your lesson"}},{"k":"solo_gm_retry","v":{"s":"Retry AI narration"}},{"k":"solo_gm_failed","v":{"s":"AI narration is unavailable for this moment. Your adventure guide is ready and you can keep playing."}},{"k":"solo_gm_thinking","v":{"s":"Your game master is thinking. You can keep playing while the story catches up."}},{"k":"solo_gm_no_provider","v":{"s":"The adventure guide is available now. AI narration becomes available when your AI provider is connected."}},{"k":"solo_gm_ai_toggle","v":{"s":"AI game master"}},{"k":"solo_gm_intro","v":{"s":"Investigate the scene, talk with your guide, or explain a lesson idea."}},{"k":"solo_gm_title","v":{"s":"Game master"}},{"k":"solo_gm_explain_prompt","v":{"s":"Help me plan an explanation using evidence from the lesson."}},{"k":"solo_gm_explain_choice","v":{"s":"Plan an explanation"}},{"k":"solo_gm_talk_prompt","v":{"s":"What should I think about before my next move?"}},{"k":"solo_gm_talk_choice","v":{"s":"Ask the guide"}},{"k":"solo_gm_investigate_prompt","v":{"s":"Help me investigate a lesson clue in this location."}},{"k":"solo_gm_investigate_choice","v":{"s":"Look for a lesson clue"}},{"k":"solo_gm_guide_question","v":{"s":"What do you notice, and which lesson detail supports your thinking?"}},{"k":"solo_gm_guide_reflect","v":{"s":"Which lesson idea will you carry into your next adventure?"}},{"k":"solo_gm_guide_name","v":{"s":"The Wayfinder"}},{"k":"solo_gm_fallback_investigate","v":{"s":"Look for a detail in the lesson that connects to this location. Describe what you notice and why it might matter."}},{"k":"solo_gm_fallback_talk","v":{"s":"Your guide invites you to name the idea you want to understand. Ask what evidence could help you test it."}},{"k":"solo_gm_fallback_explain","v":{"s":"Check your explanation against the lesson. Identify one supporting detail, then explain how it supports your idea."}},{"k":"solo_gm_fallback_explore","v":{"s":"Study the connected paths and decide what to investigate next. Use the lesson ideas to guide your journey."}},{"k":"solo_gm_fallback_battle","v":{"s":"A misconception stands in your path. Investigate the lesson evidence, prepare your explanation, and use the question controls when you are ready."}},{"k":"solo_gm_fallback_defeat","v":{"s":"This is a moment to regroup. Review the last question and choose one idea to strengthen before your next adventure."}},{"k":"solo_gm_fallback_complete","v":{"s":"The final misconception has been defeated. Think back to the evidence and ideas that helped you reach this point."}},{"k":"solo_need_practice","v":{"s":"I want more practice with this idea"}},{"k":"solo_understood","v":{"s":"My explanation covers the key ideas"}},{"k":"solo_self_review_label","v":{"s":"After comparing your explanation"}},{"k":"solo_answer_guide","v":{"s":"Answer guide"}},{"k":"solo_compare_guide","v":{"s":"Compare with answer guide"}},{"k":"solo_your_explanation","v":{"s":"Your explanation"}},{"k":"solo_written_scope","v":{"s":"Explain your reasoning, then compare it with the answer guide. This is a self-review checkpoint; it is not automatically graded and does not award correctness XP."}},{"k":"solo_evidence_label","v":{"s":"Supporting evidence"}},{"k":"solo_evidence_part","v":{"s":"Choose the evidence that supports your answer."}},{"k":"solo_answer_part","v":{"s":"Answer"}},{"k":"solo_correct_partner","v":{"s":"Choose or write the correct partner"}},{"k":"solo_select_pair","v":{"s":"Choose a pair"}},{"k":"solo_mismatch_pair","v":{"s":"Which pair does not belong?"}},{"k":"solo_ordering_reason","v":{"s":"What principle determines the order?"}},{"k":"solo_select_position","v":{"s":"Choose a position"}},{"k":"solo_wrong_position","v":{"s":"Which position needs correcting?"}},{"k":"solo_no","v":{"s":"No"}},{"k":"solo_yes","v":{"s":"Yes"}},{"k":"solo_select_response","v":{"s":"Choose a response"}},{"k":"solo_sequence_check","v":{"s":"Is this sequence in the correct order?"}},{"k":"solo_units","v":{"s":"Units"}},{"k":"solo_fill_answer","v":{"s":"Complete the blank"}},{"k":"solo_numeric_answer","v":{"s":"Your value"}},{"k":"solo_select_all","v":{"s":"Select every answer that applies."}},{"k":"solo_no_image_description","v":{"s":"No visual description provided."}},{"k":"solo_finish_review","v":{"s":"3. Record self-review and continue"}},{"k":"solo_item_number","v":{"s":"Question {number}"}},{"k":"solo_next_practice","v":{"s":"Ideas for more practice"}},{"k":"solo_review_count","v":{"s":"{count} items were self-reviewed and excluded from that score."}},{"k":"solo_graded_accuracy","v":{"s":"{accuracy}% correct on automatically scored responses."}},{"k":"solo_no_automatic_score","v":{"s":"This adventure used self-review checkpoints. No automatic accuracy score was assigned."}},{"k":"solo_coverage_summary","v":{"s":"You explored {done} of {total} assessment items."}},{"k":"solo_self_review_notice","v":{"s":"Your own comparison was recorded. This item is excluded from automatic accuracy and correctness XP."}},{"k":"solo_flagged_practice","v":{"s":"Added to your ideas for more practice."}},{"k":"solo_regrouped","v":{"s":"Your guide helped you regroup and restored your health so you can explore the remaining assessment items. This recovery does not change your answer results."}},{"k":"solo_review_recorded","v":{"s":"Self-review recorded"}},{"k":"solo_items_required","v":{"s":"Add at least one assessment question to start an adventure."}},{"k":"solo_start_new","v":{"s":"Start a new adventure"}},{"k":"solo_scripted_setup_help","v":{"s":"A scripted guide is available now. The adventure remains playable without an AI connection."}},{"k":"solo_ai_setup_help","v":{"s":"The AI narrates the adventure and responds to your investigations, conversations, and explanations using lesson context. Game rules and scores stay in the engine."}},{"k":"solo_enable_ai","v":{"s":"Use AI as the game master"}},{"k":"solo_storage_unavailable","v":{"s":"Device storage is unavailable. You can play, but progress will only last while this adventure stays open."}},{"k":"solo_corrupt_save","v":{"s":"The saved adventure could not be read. You can start a new one."}},{"k":"solo_expired_save","v":{"s":"The saved adventure expired. Start a new adventure."}},{"k":"solo_stale_save","v":{"s":"The assessment changed, so its old adventure cannot be resumed. Start a new adventure with the current items."}},{"k":"solo_resume","v":{"s":"Resume adventure"}},{"k":"solo_saved_progress","v":{"s":"{done} of {total} assessment items explored."}},{"k":"solo_saved_adventure","v":{"s":"Saved adventure"}},{"k":"solo_all_item_count","v":{"s":"{count} assessment items are included. Written responses use answer-guide self-review."}},{"k":"solo_delete_save","v":{"s":"Delete saved adventure"}},{"k":"solo_delete_prompt","v":{"s":"Delete this saved adventure from this device?"}},{"k":"solo_keep_current","v":{"s":"Save this adventure instead"}},{"k":"solo_load_saved_instead","v":{"s":"Load saved progress instead"}},{"k":"solo_retry_save","v":{"s":"Retry saving"}},{"k":"solo_save_failed","v":{"s":"Progress could not be saved on this device. Keep this adventure open and try saving again."}},{"k":"solo_save_conflict","v":{"s":"Another tab changed this saved adventure. Choose which progress to keep. Your current game is still open."}},{"k":"solo_saving","v":{"s":"Saving progress..."}},{"k":"solo_saved_device","v":{"s":"Progress saved on this device."}},{"k":"solo_delete_failed","v":{"s":"The save could not be removed. Another tab may have changed it."}},{"k":"solo_resume_unavailable","v":{"s":"This saved adventure is no longer available. You can start a new adventure."}},{"k":"solo_loading","v":{"s":"Loading Concept Quest..."}},{"k":"solo_load_failed","v":{"s":"Concept Quest could not load. Check your connection and try again."}},{"k":"solo_xp","v":{"s":"Adventure XP"}},{"k":"solo_sigils","v":{"s":"Concept sigils"}},{"k":"solo_shield","v":{"s":"Shield"}},{"k":"solo_health","v":{"s":"Health"}},{"k":"solo_local_notice","v":{"s":"Independent practice. Progress and your guide conversation are saved on this device for this account or local profile. This adventure does not submit an assessment score."}},{"k":"solo_inventory_empty","v":{"s":"Find items by exploring treasure rooms."}},{"k":"solo_use_item","v":{"s":"Use item"}},{"k":"solo_inventory","v":{"s":"Your inventory"}},{"k":"solo_map","v":{"s":"Adventure map"}},{"k":"solo_resolve","v":{"s":"3. Resolve this turn"}},{"k":"solo_choose_answer","v":{"s":"2. Respond to the encounter"}},{"k":"solo_choose_ability","v":{"s":"1. Choose an ability"}},{"k":"solo_enemy_health_label","v":{"s":"Encounter health"}},{"k":"solo_enemy_health","v":{"s":"Encounter health: {current}/{maximum}"}},{"k":"solo_explore","v":{"s":"Explore this location"}},{"k":"solo_revisit","v":{"s":"Revisit location"}},{"k":"solo_gate_locked","v":{"s":"Collect {count} more sigils first."}},{"k":"solo_path_help","v":{"s":"Choose a connected path. Encounters help you explore lesson ideas; treasure rooms hold useful items."}},{"k":"solo_current_location","v":{"s":"Current location"}},{"k":"solo_play_again","v":{"s":"Play again"}},{"k":"solo_debrief_summary","v":{"s":"{rounds} turns · {accuracy}% correct · {sigils} concept sigils"}},{"k":"solo_defeat","v":{"s":"Your health ran out. Review your discoveries, then restart to try a different ability or path."}},{"k":"solo_victory","v":{"s":"You connected the lesson ideas and defeated the final misconception."}},{"k":"solo_regroup","v":{"s":"Time to regroup"}},{"k":"solo_continue","v":{"s":"Continue adventure"}},{"k":"solo_correct_answer","v":{"s":"Correct answer: {answer}"}},{"k":"solo_damage","v":{"s":"You dealt {damage} damage and lost {incoming} health."}},{"k":"solo_incorrect","v":{"s":"Review the concept and try another turn."}},{"k":"solo_correct","v":{"s":"Correct. Your ability succeeded!"}},{"k":"solo_round_result","v":{"s":"Turn result"}},{"k":"solo_progress","v":{"s":"Adventure progress"}},{"k":"source_questions_required","v":{"s":"Concept Quest needs at least one multiple-choice question with a valid answer key."}},{"k":"solo_start","v":{"s":"Start solo adventure"}},{"k":"solo_rules","v":{"s":"Choose an ability and respond to each encounter. Correct answers power your ability. Review written answers against the guide. Explore every assessment item before completing the final boss."}},{"k":"solo_role","v":{"s":"Adventurer role"}},{"k":"solo_question_count","v":{"s":"{count} scored multiple-choice questions are available for encounters. Other assessment item types are not used in this game."}},{"k":"solo_intro","v":{"s":"Explore an adventure built from this assessment. Use abilities to overcome encounters, investigate clues, talk with your guide, and explain your ideas. Every assessment item stays in the learning path."}},{"k":"solo_setup","v":{"s":"Choose your adventurer"}},{"k":"solo_restart_confirm","v":{"s":"Restart from the beginning"}},{"k":"keep_playing","v":{"s":"Keep playing"}},{"k":"solo_restart_prompt","v":{"s":"Start a new adventure? This replaces the saved progress for this resource."}},{"k":"solo_close","v":{"s":"Back to Assess"}},{"k":"solo_restart","v":{"s":"Restart adventure"}},{"k":"solo_badge","v":{"s":"Solo adventure. No live session needed."}},{"k":"solo_title","v":{"s":"Concept Quest solo adventure"}},{"k":"solo_boss_limited","v":{"s":"The Mastery Barrier limited damage. Review the evidence and try again."}},{"k":"solo_boss_bonus","v":{"s":"Your correct answer broke the Mastery Barrier for 2 bonus damage."}},{"k":"solo_puzzle_locked","v":{"s":"The reasoning lock is still closed. Review the evidence and try again."}},{"k":"solo_puzzle_bonus","v":{"s":"Your correct answer opened the reasoning lock for 4 bonus damage."}},{"k":"solo_lens_description","v":{"s":"Use during an encounter to reveal a lesson clue."}},{"k":"solo_objective","v":{"s":"Explore every lesson item, compare your answers, and overcome the final misconception."}},{"k":"title","v":{"s":"Concept Quest"}},{"k":"launch_tooltip","v":{"s":"Launch an eight-room cooperative concept dungeon with teacher co-GM controls"}},{"k":"launch_aria","v":{"s":"Launch Concept Quest"}},{"k":"loading_retry","v":{"s":"Concept Quest is still loading. Try again in a moment."}},{"k":"loading_teacher_controls","v":{"s":"Loading Concept Quest co-GM controls…"}},{"k":"session_title","v":{"s":"{title}: Concept Quest"}},{"k":"objective","v":{"s":"Navigate together, use lesson concepts as abilities, and defeat the final misconception."}},{"k":"launched","v":{"s":"Concept Quest launched. You are the co-GM."}},{"k":"launch_failed","v":{"s":"Concept Quest could not launch."}},{"k":"sync_failed","v":{"s":"Concept Quest could not sync."}},{"k":"checks_succeeded","v":{"s":"{correct}/{tot