ging the brief, source, settings, or supports."}},{"k":"lesson","v":{"s":"Lesson reasoning"}},{"k":"choices","v":{"s":"Meaningful choices"}},{"k":"feasible","v":{"s":"Time and materials"}},{"k":"lesson_question","v":{"s":"Could a learner meet the criteria without applying the lesson idea? Tighten the task if so."}},{"k":"choices_question","v":{"s":"Can learners compare defensible approaches and explain a real tradeoff?"}},{"k":"feasible_question","v":{"s":"Can learners create and check this product with the time, materials, and access they actually have?"}},{"k":"missing_source","v":{"s":"Source excerpt missing: lesson alignment needs a teacher check against the original lesson."}},{"k":"missing_limits","v":{"s":"Add available time and materials in task settings so feasibility can be reviewed."}},{"k":"supported","v":{"s":"AI found supporting task wording"}},{"k":"revise","v":{"s":"Revision suggested"}},{"k":"unknown","v":{"s":"More information needed"}},{"k":"next","v":{"s":"Teacher next step:"}}],"id":856}},{"k":"resume","v":{"o":[{"k":"review","v":{"s":"Go to my review"}},{"k":"stage","v":{"s":"Continue in {stage}"}},{"k":"start","v":{"s":"Start writing"}}],"id":857}},{"k":"search","v":{"o":[{"k":"google_provider","v":{"s":"Google results via Serper"}},{"k":"web_provider","v":{"s":"Web search"}},{"k":"unavailable","v":{"s":"Web search is unavailable in this view. You can still add a source you have checked to your evidence."}},{"k":"busy","v":{"s":"Looking for sources…"}},{"k":"offline","v":{"s":"You are offline. Reconnect to search, or continue with your lesson evidence."}},{"k":"connection","v":{"s":"Search is not connected. Continue with your lesson evidence or try again after connecting search."}},{"k":"error","v":{"s":"Search did not finish. Try again, or continue with your lesson evidence."}},{"k":"empty","v":{"s":"No usable source links were returned. Try a more specific topic. An empty search does not settle the question."}},{"k":"heading","v":{"s":"Find 