ck the row and try adding the reference again."}},{"k":"notes_changed","v":{"s":"The reference could not be added. Check for a duplicate or make room in your evidence notes."}},{"k":"query_help","v":{"s":"Start from a question we still need to answer"}},{"k":"query_help_note","v":{"s":"Choose a question, then edit it before searching. Nothing is sent until you search."}},{"k":"notes_full","v":{"s":"Your evidence notes are full. Keep your writing and save the source separately, or make room before adding it."}},{"k":"notes_reference","v":{"s":"The reference is added to your evidence notes as an unchecked source. Explain what it supports or challenges in your own words."}},{"k":"saved_separately","v":{"s":"Citation details are saved in Saved outside sources. Add your own source-check note, then explain how the evidence affects your reasoning."}}],"id":858}},{"k":"source_review","v":{"o":[{"k":"open","v":{"s":"Open source: {domain}"}},{"k":"new_tab","v":{"s":"(opens in a new tab)"}},{"k":"heading","v":{"s":"Review this source before using it"}},{"k":"author","v":{"s":"Who wrote it, and what makes them a useful source for this question?"}},{"k":"date","v":{"s":"When was it published or updated? Does that date matter here? If you cannot find it, say so."}},{"k":"connection","v":{"s":"What does it actually show, and how does that support or challenge your claim?"}},{"k":"limits","v":{"s":"What does it leave uncertain? Does it apply to this situation, or do you need another source or a local check?"}},{"k":"write","v":{"s":"Record your source check in the evidence field in your own words. Opening a link does not verify a claim."}},{"k":"action","v":{"s":"Write my source check"}}],"id":859}},{"k":"review_next","v":{"o":[{"k":"question","v":{"s":"Write or accept the question you want to answer."}},{"k":"linked_explanation","v":{"s":"Explain the reasoning in your linked work so a reader can follow it."}},{"k":"missing_link","v":{"s":"Add the link to the work you described, or