utes","v":{"s":"Minutes"}},{"k":"step_materials","v":{"s":"Lesson resources:"}},{"k":"missing_material","v":{"s":"Resource no longer available in this lesson"}},{"k":"step_evidence","v":{"s":"Teaching guidance used in this step"}},{"k":"missing_recommendation","v":{"s":"The cited teaching guidance is unavailable. Review this step."}},{"k":"timing_error","v":{"s":"Step times must be positive whole minutes and add up to the version’s teaching time."}},{"k":"text_error","v":{"s":"Give each step a title and complete every teaching field. Expand each teacher prompt into the words you will say (at least 60 characters)."}},{"k":"stale_edits","v":{"s":"This saved version changed while you were editing. Copy your draft if needed, then discard edits to review the current version."}},{"k":"saving","v":{"s":"Adding edits…"}},{"k":"save","v":{"s":"Save edits"}},{"k":"discard","v":{"s":"Discard edits"}},{"k":"sources","v":{"s":"Teaching sources and evidence"}},{"k":"source_unavailable","v":{"s":"Source link unavailable"}},{"k":"evidence_general","v":{"s":"General instructional practice"}},{"k":"evidence_content","v":{"s":"Content-specific guidance"}},{"k":"scope_label","v":{"s":"Scope:"}},{"k":"evidence_level","v":{"s":"Evidence level:"}},{"k":"retrieved","v":{"s":"Retrieved:"}},{"k":"no_sources","v":{"s":"No research sources are attached to this version. Review the teaching choices against your lesson and learners."}},{"k":"load_error","v":{"s":"Teaching script tools could not load. Your lesson plan is still available."}},{"k":"loading","v":{"s":"Loading teaching script tools…"}},{"k":"retry_load","v":{"s":"Try loading again"}},{"k":"retention","v":{"s":"The three most recent script versions are kept. Download a version to keep a separate copy."}}],"id":873}},{"k":"storyforge_updates","v":{"o":[{"k":"ai_unavailable","v":{"s":"AI tools are unavailable. You can keep writing and use the self-check."}},{"k":"plan_stale","v":{"s":"Your draft changed. Generate a new plan to keep your 