 collect will appear here."}},{"k":"solo_inventory","v":{"s":"Your inventory"}},{"k":"solo_restarted","v":{"s":"Your room has restarted. Discoveries and hints are reset."}},{"k":"solo_player","v":{"s":"Solo escape room"}},{"k":"back_setup","v":{"s":"Back to room setup"}},{"k":"solo_restart","v":{"s":"Restart solo room"}},{"k":"solo_saved","v":{"s":"Play independently with the same clues and puzzles. Progress and unfinished settings resume in this browser tab; no live session is needed."}},{"k":"solo_storage_error","v":{"s":"Progress could not be saved in this tab. You can keep playing, but leave this room open to preserve your progress."}},{"k":"solo_restart_confirm","v":{"s":"Restart your solo attempt? Your discoveries, hints, and unfinished settings will reset."}},{"k":"solo_restart_yes","v":{"s":"Reset my progress"}},{"k":"review_step","v":{"s":"Checking {current}/{total}: {name}"}},{"k":"playability","v":{"s":"AI playability review"}},{"k":"review_intro","v":{"s":"An independent AI pass tries each device using its available clues, without the answer key or hints. This can flag ambiguity; it does not guarantee a good room."}},{"k":"review_calls","v":{"s":"Uses up to {count} additional requests to your configured AI provider. Review is optional; check the clues yourself before playing or launching."}},{"k":"run_review","v":{"s":"Check playability with AI"}},{"k":"review_cancelled","v":{"s":"Review stopped. The current provider request may finish, but no further checks will run."}},{"k":"stop_review","v":{"s":"Stop review"}},{"k":"review_incomplete","v":{"s":"Review incomplete. Some devices could not be checked. Try again when the AI provider is available."}},{"k":"review_matched","v":{"s":"The reviewer independently matched every device solution. Check its reasoning and try the room before launch."}},{"k":"review_concerns","v":{"s":"Some devices need a closer look. Review the findings and clarify their player instructions, or generate another room."}},{"k":"review