xplore this location"}},{"k":"already_built","v":{"s":"This project is already built."}},{"k":"need_resources","v":{"s":"Explore more locations to earn the required resources."}},{"k":"already_explored","v":{"s":"Already explored. Its resources have been collected."}},{"k":"reach_help","v":{"s":"Explore a connected location or build a shortcut to open this location."}},{"k":"votes","v":{"s":"Confirmed proposals for this move: {count}."}},{"k":"your_proposal","v":{"s":"Your confirmed proposal: {name}"}},{"k":"activity","v":{"s":"Lesson activity"}},{"k":"confirmed","v":{"s":"Response confirmed"}},{"k":"submit","v":{"s":"Submit response"}},{"k":"wait_review","v":{"s":"Your response is confirmed. Review the lesson while the teacher gathers responses."}},{"k":"hints","v":{"s":"Hints and lesson evidence"}},{"k":"hint","v":{"s":"Hint {number}"}},{"k":"response_count","v":{"s":"{count}/{total} learners have confirmed responses."}},{"k":"shared_rule","v":{"s":"The location is explored when at least half of the submitted responses are correct. Missing responses are not marked wrong. An unsuccessful activity costs no resources and can be tried again."}},{"k":"review_responses","v":{"s":"Review responses and resolve"}},{"k":"early_review","v":{"s":"Resolve before everyone responds"}},{"k":"early_notice","v":{"s":"{count} learners have not confirmed a response. Continue with the responses already received?"}},{"k":"resolve_received","v":{"s":"Resolve received responses"}},{"k":"keep_waiting","v":{"s":"Keep waiting"}},{"k":"teacher_responses","v":{"s":"Teacher response review"}},{"k":"correct","v":{"s":"Correct"}},{"k":"revisit","v":{"s":"Needs review"}},{"k":"project_completed","v":{"s":"Project built. Its effect now applies to your board."}},{"k":"location_completed","v":{"s":"Location explored. Resources collected and connected paths opened."}},{"k":"retry_activity","v":{"s":"This idea needs another look. No resources were lost. You can return to this location on a later move.