enture"}},{"k":"setup_headline","v":{"s":"Build a world with what you learn"}},{"k":"setup_description","v":{"s":"Explore connected places, work through lesson challenges, and turn earned resources into useful constructions. Play independently or make decisions together as a class."}},{"k":"choose_mission_step","v":{"s":"Choose a mission"}},{"k":"create_inspect_step","v":{"s":"Create and inspect the board"}},{"k":"explore_build_step","v":{"s":"Explore, learn, and build"}},{"k":"mission_picker","v":{"s":"Choose your mission"}},{"k":"mission_balance_unavailable","v":{"s":"This board does not have enough base resources for that mission."}},{"k":"mission_change_help","v":{"s":"Changing a mission creates a separate solo adventure. Existing saved progress stays with its original mission."}},{"k":"blueprint_locations","v":{"s":"{count} connected locations"}},{"k":"blueprint_concepts","v":{"s":"{count} lesson concepts"}},{"k":"blueprint_choice","v":{"s":"Choice challenges"}},{"k":"blueprint_order","v":{"s":"Sequence challenges"}},{"k":"blueprint_settings","v":{"s":"Configuration challenges"}},{"k":"blueprint_concept_list","v":{"s":"Ideas you will explore"}},{"k":"mission_concepts","v":{"s":"Lesson concepts"}},{"k":"mission_locations","v":{"s":"Locations explored"}},{"k":"mission_projects","v":{"s":"Projects built"}},{"k":"your_resources","v":{"s":"Your resources"}},{"k":"yield_bonus","v":{"s":"+{count} per successful location"}},{"k":"supply_help","v":{"s":"Earn by exploring. Spend on projects."}},{"k":"mission_checklist","v":{"s":"Mission checklist"}},{"k":"planner","v":{"s":"Plan a route or project"}},{"k":"planner_help","v":{"s":"Choose a construction goal to compare useful moves. These suggestions do not choose or spend anything."}},{"k":"planner_goal","v":{"s":"Construction goal"}},{"k":"planner_need","v":{"s":"Resources still needed"}},{"k":"planner_ready","v":{"s":"You can afford this project now. Inspect its effect before building."}},{"k":"inspect_project","v":{"s"