for this concept yet."}},{"k":"concept_first_counts","v":{"s":"First responses correct: {correct}/{total}."}},{"k":"concept_extend","v":{"s":"Latest recorded responses are correct. Invite learners to explain a connection or apply the idea in another example."}},{"k":"practice_fixed_order","v":{"s":"This activity keeps its original answer order because its wording may refer to choice positions."}},{"k":"planned_exploration","v":{"s":"Planned exploration {step}"}},{"k":"planned_map_help","v":{"s":"Numbered badges show the suggested exploration order for your construction goal. Locations open as earlier moves succeed."}},{"k":"your_construction_goal","v":{"s":"Your construction goal"}},{"k":"remembered_goal_built","v":{"s":"{name} is built. Choose another goal when you are ready."}},{"k":"remember_project_goal","v":{"s":"Remember this goal"}},{"k":"clear_project_goal","v":{"s":"Clear remembered goal"}},{"k":"plan_ready","v":{"s":"Ready to build with current resources."}},{"k":"plan_move_count","v":{"s":"{count} successful explorations, then 1 construction."}},{"k":"plan_turn_limit","v":{"s":"This plan needs {needed} moves, but only {remaining} move slots remain."}},{"k":"plan_finish_move","v":{"s":"Finish the current move to calculate the next exploration sequence."}},{"k":"plan_complete","v":{"s":"The mission is complete. Start another board to try a different construction plan."}},{"k":"plan_unavailable","v":{"s":"No exploration-only plan funds this project before the mission ends. Compare another goal or an income upgrade."}},{"k":"plan_completes","v":{"s":"Building this project at the end of this plan would complete the mission."}},{"k":"plan_income","v":{"s":"At most {count} extra {resource} after this plan. Actual gain depends on future successful moves."}},{"k":"plan_shortcut_open","v":{"s":"The destination would already be open by the time this plan builds the shortcut. The project still counts toward construction goals."}},{"k":"plan_steps_title","v":{"s":"Suggested exploration sequence"}},{"k":"plan_assumptions","v":{"s":"Estimates assume each listed activity succeeds and no other project is built first. The plan updates from confirmed progress after each move."}},{"k":"plan_projected_balance","v":{"s":"Projected supplies after this step"}},{"k":"plan_inspect_next","v":{"s":"Inspect first planned move"}},{"k":"plan_after_build","v":{"s":"Projected supplies after construction"}},{"k":"compare_projects","v":{"s":"Compare construction plans"}},{"k":"compare_projects_help","v":{"s":"Compare the exploration effort, remaining supplies, and effect of each project. Each estimate starts with the same confirmed progress."}},{"k":"use_project_goal","v":{"s":"Use this construction goal"}},{"k":"restore_workspace_unavailable","v":{"s":"Your view, construction goal, and unfinished response could not be restored in this tab."}},{"k":"save_workspace_unavailable","v":{"s":"Your view, construction goal, and unfinished response could not be saved in this tab."}},{"k":"shared_picture_omissions","v":{"s":"{count} pictures could not be included in this shared board. Vocabulary and activities remain available as text."}},{"k":"hide_board_images","v":{"s":"Hide pictures"}},{"k":"show_board_images","v":{"s":"Show pictures"}},{"k":"support_image_failed","v":{"s":"Picture unavailable. The text is still available."}},{"k":"illustrated_world","v":{"s":"An illustrated setting for your lesson adventure"}},{"k":"location_vocabulary","v":{"s":"Vocabulary for this location"}},{"k":"vocabulary_after_review","v":{"s":"Definitions, translations, and pictures appear after this location is reviewed."}},{"k":"vocabulary_definition","v":{"s":"Definition and translations"}},{"k":"support_timeout","v":{"s":"Artwork took too long. Your current board and pictures have been kept."}},{"k":"support_omitted","v":{"s":"Vocabulary added. {count} pictures could not be included; their text is available."}},{"k":"support_ready","v":{"s":"Vocabulary and artwork updated. Save the board or download a backup to keep these changes."}},{"k":"support_failed","v":{"s":"The picture could not be added. Your current board is unchanged."}},{"k":"vocabulary_next_board","v":{"s":"The selected vocabulary will guide the next board."}},{"k":"image_provider_needed","v":{"s":"Connect an image provider to generate artwork. Existing glossary pictures can still be reused."}},{"k":"replace_artwork","v":{"s":"Generate replacement picture"}},{"k":"generate_artwork","v":{"s":"Generate picture"}},{"k":"remove_artwork","v":{"s":"Remove picture"}},{"k":"support_setup_title","v":{"s":"Vocabulary and optional artwork"}},{"k":"support_setup_help","v":{"s":"Reuse a glossary from this lesson, choose the terms to include, and preview optional artwork. Pictures are never required to play."}},{"k":"choose_board_glossary","v":{"s":"Glossary to use"}},{"k":"no_glossary","v":{"s":"No glossary selected"}},{"k":"glossary","v":{"s":"Glossary"}},{"k":"language_unspecified","v":{"s":"Language unspecified"}},{"k":"glossary_lesson_match","v":{"s":"This glossary matches the lesson source and language."}},{"k":"glossary_review_context","v":{"s":"Check the definitions and language before using this glossary. Its lesson match could not be confirmed."}},{"k":"selected_vocabulary_count","v":{"s":"{selected} of {total} terms selected. Choose up to {limit}."}},{"k":"search_glossary_terms","v":{"s":"Search all glossary terms"}},{"k":"previous_terms","v":{"s":"Previous terms"}},{"k":"term_page","v":{"s":"Page {page} of {total}"}},{"k":"next_terms","v":{"s":"Next terms"}},{"k":"use_selected_vocabulary","v":{"s":"Use selected vocabulary"}},{"k":"no_glossary_available","v":{"s":"No glossary is available in this resource history. You can still create and play the board, or create a glossary first."}},{"k":"definition_availability","v":{"s":"Vocabulary support during play"}},{"k":"definitions_available","v":{"s":"Definitions and pictures available"}},{"k":"definitions_after_review","v":{"s":"Definitions and pictures after review"}},{"k":"vocabulary_snapshot","v":{"s":"The board keeps a copy of these terms. Later glossary edits do not change an ongoing game."}},{"k":"remove_board_vocabulary","v":{"s":"Remove vocabulary from this board"}},{"k":"review_term_locations","v":{"s":"Review vocabulary locations"}},{"k":"term_location_help","v":{"s":"Suggested links use words in the activity. Check the meaning and adjust the locations before play. Terms with more than one meaning need manual links."}},{"k":"world_and_project_art","v":{"s":"World, construction, and vocabulary pictures"}},{"k":"artwork_help","v":{"s":"Generate one picture at a time with your configured image provider. Existing pictures stay in place until a replacement succeeds. Construction pictures appear after their projects are built."}},{"k":"board_art_style","v":{"s":"Artwork style"}},{"k":"world_artwork","v":{"s":"World setting"}},{"k":"adding_glossary","v":{"s":"Preparing glossary terms and reusable pictures…"}},{"k":"generating_artwork","v":{"s":"Generating and preparing a picture…"}},{"k":"artwork_cancelled","v":{"s":"Cancelled. Your current vocabulary and artwork have been kept."}},{"k":"vocabulary_linked_count","v":{"s":"{linked} of {total} terms are linked to locations. Review the links before play."}},{"k":"play_without_support_save","v":{"s":"The board was saved, but its vocabulary and artwork could not be saved. You can keep playing with them now. Download a board file to keep a copy."}},{"k":"file_contents_with_support","v":{"s":"A board file includes its lesson source, activities, solutions, hints, and any attached vocabulary and pictures. It does not include learner identities, responses or live-session progress."}},{"k":"artwork_size_error","v":{"s":"This picture could not be made small enough for the board. Try generating another picture. Your current picture is kept."}},{"k":"artwork_format_error","v":{"s":"This picture could not be opened. Try generating another picture. Your current picture is kept."}},{"k":"artwork_decode_error","v":{"s":"The picture took too long to open. Try again. Your current picture is kept."}},{"k":"artwork_limit_error","v":{"s":"The vocabulary and pictures could not be added. Remove an unused picture or choose fewer terms, then try again. Your current board is kept."}},{"k":"vocabulary_translation_limit","v":{"s":"Up to four available translations are copied with each term."}},{"k":"support_live_size","v":{"s":"This board has too much visual or vocabulary support for a shared session. Use shorter descriptions or fewer cues and terms before launching. Your board and pictures are kept."}},{"k":"guide_construction_tools","v":{"s":"Construction and planning tools. These open after your first successful exploration."}},{"k":"guide_journal_tools","v":{"s":"Learning trail. This opens after your first review."}},{"k":"visual_challenges","v":{"s":"Visual learning challenges"}},{"k":"visual_editor_help","v":{"s":"Add glossary pictures to a question clue, response choices, sequence items, or configuration choices. Keep a complete text description beside each picture. Review the activity and solution before enabling its pictures."}},{"k":"visual_editor_rule","v":{"s":"Enabled challenge pictures and their descriptions appear while answering, even when glossary definitions are set to appear after review. They use the existing activity answer and rewards."}},{"k":"visual_location","v":{"s":"Activity to illustrate"}},{"k":"visual_check_solution","v":{"s":"Review solution and lesson evidence"}},{"k":"visual_needs_pictures","v":{"s":"Add pictures to the selected vocabulary to create visual challenges."}},{"k":"visual_no_matches","v":{"s":"No choice or sequence item exactly matches a pictured term. Choose the pictures below."}},{"k":"visual_suggest","v":{"s":"Suggest matching pictures"}},{"k":"visual_question_clue","v":{"s":"Question clue"}},{"k":"visual_sequence_item","v":{"s":"Sequence item: {text}"}},{"k":"visual_response_choice","v":{"s":"Response choice: {text}"}},{"k":"visual_picture_for","v":{"s":"Picture for {label}"}},{"k":"visual_no_picture","v":{"s":"No picture"}},{"k":"visual_description","v":{"s":"Equivalent text description"}},{"k":"visual_cue_count","v":{"s":"{count} visual cues attached."}},{"k":"visual_preview","v":{"s":"Preview challenge"}},{"k":"visual_clear","v":{"s":"Clear challenge pictures"}},{"k":"visual_learner_preview","v":{"s":"Learner preview"}},{"k":"visual_preview_help","v":{"s":"Preview responses do not change the board or record a score."}},{"k":"visual_enable_reviewed","v":{"s":"I reviewed the pictures, text descriptions, and answer. Enable this visual challenge."}},{"k":"visual_review_changes","v":{"s":"Preview before enabling. Changes to this activity, its cues, or a selected picture require another review."}},{"k":"guide_start","v":{"s":"Guide my first build"}},{"k":"guide_invitation","v":{"s":"A short guide through exploring, answering, and building. You choose every move."}},{"k":"guide_explore","v":{"s":"Start with one location"}},{"k":"guide_answer","v":{"s":"Explore the evidence and respond"}},{"k":"guide_reward","v":{"s":"Review what you earned"}},{"k":"guide_retry","v":{"s":"Review, then try again"}},{"k":"guide_gather","v":{"s":"Gather supplies for your first project"}},{"k":"guide_build","v":{"s":"Your first project is ready"}},{"k":"guide_complete","v":{"s":"Your first build is complete"}},{"k":"guide_explore_help","v":{"s":"Inspect {name}, then use its Explore button. A successful response earns the supplies shown in the move preview."}},{"k":"guide_teacher_answer","v":{"s":"Learners respond independently. Wait for confirmed responses, then review and resolve the activity."}},{"k":"guide_answer_confirmed","v":{"s":"Your response is confirmed. The teacher will open the review after gathering responses."}},{"k":"guide_answer_help","v":{"s":"Read the question, examine any pictures and their text descriptions, and choose a response. Hints and lesson 