dentify the answer. Use a question clue when only one relevant picture is available."}},{"k":"visual_needs_vocabulary","v":{"s":"Select glossary terms to add pictures or supporting descriptions."}},{"k":"visual_balance_title","v":{"s":"Balance the support across choices"}},{"k":"visual_balance_help","v":{"s":"Check both pictures and descriptions. These counts identify gaps; preview the content to judge whether choices have comparable detail and useful clues."}},{"k":"visual_balance_counts","v":{"s":"Pictures: {pictures}/{total}. Descriptions: {descriptions}/{total}."}},{"k":"visual_correct_picture_warning","v":{"s":"Only the correct choice has a picture. Its appearance may reveal the answer."}},{"k":"visual_missing_pictures","v":{"s":"Choices without pictures: {choices}"}},{"k":"visual_missing_descriptions","v":{"s":"Choices without descriptions: {choices}"}},{"k":"visual_text_balanced","v":{"s":"Every choice has a description and uses text only."}},{"k":"visual_fill_no_matches","v":{"s":"No missing choice has a unique matching glossary definition. Add support to the remaining choices below, or leave all choices as plain text."}},{"k":"visual_fill_descriptions","v":{"s":"Fill matching glossary descriptions"}},{"k":"visual_group_text","v":{"s":"Use descriptions only for this group"}},{"k":"visual_move_clue","v":{"s":"Move the single picture to the question clue"}},{"k":"visual_support_for","v":{"s":"Glossary support for {label}"}},{"k":"visual_no_support","v":{"s":"No added support"}},{"k":"visual_show_cue_picture","v":{"s":"Show the glossary picture for this cue"}},{"k":"finale_yield","v":{"s":"Earn +1 {resource} on each future successful exploration."}},{"k":"finale_path","v":{"s":"Open a direct path to {location}."}},{"k":"finale_instant","v":{"s":"Collect another full reward immediately without exploring."}},{"k":"finale_other_path","v":{"s":"Open a new direct path to a distant location."}},{"k":"finale_other_yield","v":{"s":"Earn an extra resource on each future successful exploration."}},{"k":"finale_download_failed","v":{"s":"Your plan could not be downloaded. Your current response is still shown here."}},{"k":"finale_title","v":{"s":"Final challenge: put your discoveries to work"}},{"k":"finale_scenario","v":{"s":"A new team is joining {board}. Choose a construction you completed and connect two lesson concepts to plan their first investigation."}},{"k":"finale_separate","v":{"s":"Your mission is already complete. This challenge records a plan without changing supplies or game scores."}},{"k":"finale_start","v":{"s":"Start the final challenge"}},{"k":"finale_teacher","v":{"s":"Use your plan to model a discussion. Each learner has a separate plan in their own tab. Ask learners to discuss or download theirs to share."}},{"k":"finale_private","v":{"s":"Your plan stays in this browser tab, including after a reload. Discuss it or download it to share with your teacher before the board ends or restarts."}},{"k":"finale_project_step","v":{"s":"1. Put a completed construction to use"}},{"k":"finale_project","v":{"s":"Construction for the new team"}},{"k":"finale_pick_project","v":{"s":"Choose a completed construction"}},{"k":"finale_effect","v":{"s":"Which board effect would this construction provide?"}},{"k":"finale_pick_effect","v":{"s":"Choose its effect"}},{"k":"finale_evidence_step","v":{"s":"2. Connect evidence from two concepts"}},{"k":"finale_evidence_help","v":{"s":"Choose two explored locations with different concept labels. Use their lesson evidence to explain a connection."}},{"k":"finale_evidence","v":{"s":"Evidence location {number}"}},{"k":"finale_pick_evidence","v":{"s":"Choose explored evidence"}},{"k":"finale_read_evidence","v":{"s":"Read evidence: {name}"}},{"k":"finale_plan_step","v":{"s":"3. Explain the investigation plan"}},{"k":"finale_response_mode","v":{"s":"How will you explain your plan?"}},{"k":"finale_write","v":{"s":"Write my explanation"}},{"k":"finale_oral","v":{"s":"Explain aloud or with my communication tools"}},{"k":"finale_starters","v":{"s":"Sentence starters and review prompts"}},{"k":"finale_starter_project","v":{"s":"Our construction helps the team by…"}},{"k":"finale_starter_connection","v":{"s":"The evidence at the two locations connects because…"}},{"k":"finale_starter_investigation","v":{"s":"To investigate this connection, the new team could…"}},{"k":"finale_explanation","v":{"s":"My plan and evidence"}},{"k":"finale_length","v":{"s":"{count}/{limit} characters"}},{"k":"finale_oral_help","v":{"s":"Use speech, signing, a drawing, or your communication tools. No microphone or recording is needed. Explain the construction, the evidence connection, and what the team could investigate."}},{"k":"finale_oral_done","v":{"s":"I have explained my plan."}},{"k":"finale_self_review","v":{"s":"Review your explanation:"}},{"k":"finale_check_connection","v":{"s":"I connected the two lesson concepts."}},{"k":"finale_check_evidence","v":{"s":"I used evidence from both selected locations."}},{"k":"finale_check_purpose","v":{"s":"I explained how the construction helps the new team investigate."}},{"k":"finale_review","v":{"s":"Review my plan"}},{"k":"finale_download","v":{"s":"Download my plan"}},{"k":"finale_finished","v":{"s":"Your plan is ready to discuss"}},{"k":"finale_revise","v":{"s":"Strengthen your plan"}},{"k":"finale_success","v":{"s":"Board rules and evidence choices checked. You have completed your self-review."}},{"k":"finale_feedback_help","v":{"s":"Use the feedback below, revise your choices, then review again."}},{"k":"finale_rule_ok","v":{"s":"Your selected effect matches the construction."}},{"k":"finale_rule_fix","v":{"s":"Revisit the construction effect: {effect}"}},{"k":"finale_project_missing","v":{"s":"Choose a completed construction and its effect."}},{"k":"finale_connection_ok","v":{"s":"Your evidence covers two different lesson concepts."}},{"k":"finale_connection_fix","v":{"s":"Choose two explored locations with different concept labels."}},{"k":"finale_response_ok","v":{"s":"Your explanation is included or marked as explained."}},{"k":"finale_response_fix","v":{"s":"Write your plan, or explain it using your communication tools and mark it as explained."}},{"k":"finale_checks_ok","v":{"s":"You checked your connection, evidence, and construction purpose."}},{"k":"finale_checks_fix","v":{"s":"Review your explanation against each of the three prompts before checking them."}},{"k":"finale_feedback_scope","v":{"s":"These checks verify the board rule and your selected evidence. The meaning of your explanation needs your own or your teacher’s review; it is not automatically graded."}},{"k":"finale_discuss","v":{"s":"Discuss: How would your investigation change if the team used a different construction?"}},{"k":"replay_model_reason","v":{"s":"Practice this lesson activity"}},{"k":"replay_revisit","v":{"s":"Your latest game response needs review"}},{"k":"replay_strengthen","v":{"s":"You improved after a game retry"}},{"k":"replay_unattempted","v":{"s":"No recorded game response here"}},{"k":"replay_extend","v":{"s":"Revisit a previously correct response"}},{"k":"replay_title","v":{"s":"Your next practice route"}},{"k":"replay_teacher_intro","v":{"s":"Model a short practice route through the lesson. Activities return after an incorrect check, with a different answer order when the wording allows it."}},{"k":"replay_intro","v":{"s":"Practice a short set of activities based on your recorded responses. Missed activities return after other available activities, with a different answer order when the wording allows it."}},{"k":"replay_local_solo","v":{"s":"This route saves with your solo game on this device. Practice checks are separate from your original game score."}},{"k":"replay_local_teacher","v":{"s":"Use a separate practice route to model review. Learners have their own routes; their checks are not submitted to the shared game."}},{"k":"replay_local_class","v":{"s":"Your route stays in this browser tab a